<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Kubhoka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Kubhoka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kubhoka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kubh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kubhoka</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Kubhoka chijendalela kulongalela Histolia jejatumbwile mu chitabu cha Utumbulilu chechakabhili chilongalela lukolu lwaka Ibulahimu. Lilobhi Kutoka lelitafusiliwi ngati Kubhoka lilandila kihengu cha bhandu bha Izilaeli kulemangana kuhuma mu utumwa wa Misili na kukelabhuka mu inchi ambaju Chapanga akabhili andaghili kumpekeha Ibulahimu. Kulengana na majopalelu, bhasomi bhahobhalela kubha pandu pakolongwa pa chitabu chenu chakalembakiki na mlota Musa, na lijambu lenu lilandiwa na chitabu chenu. Chitabu cha Utumbulilu 24:4, chilandila ntundu Musa moakalembile pandu pakumu pa chitabu chenu. Mu chifungu cha chitabu chaka Yoshua 8:31, chiloghola amuli jejibhili mu Sula 20:25, na kupwagha, “Ngati moilembakike mu chitabu cha tolati jaka Musa.” Mu itabu ya Lulaghilu Lwahenu iloghola mala pamaheli na kukelabhukila kulemba mambu ghaghakalembakiki na Musa, kwa ulenganesu mu chitabu chaka Mako 12:26 kubhili na malobhi ghaghalongalela chitutu chechibhelela moto panga kutinyika. Malobhi ghani ghakalembakiki mkati ja “Chitabu chaka Musa” (Mako 12:26). Chilandila kubha chitendu cha bhana bha Izilaeli kubhoka mu inchi ja Misili chakapitalili pachilanda ja hyaka 1,300 au 1,400 K. K. (Mangani jaka Kristo). Mu chitabu cha 1 Bhakolongwa 6:1, chihobhaleka kubha chitendu cha kubhoka chakahengakiki ngati hyaka ya 480, mangani ja chaka cha kachechi cha utawala waka Solomoni ngati nkolongwa wa Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Kubhoka chibhoha msisitizu wa ntundu ambau Chapanga moakahengile nahuli kukamulakila ulongwana waki panani ja chilanga cheakundaghile Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo. Chitabu chilandila kubhokana na matendu makolongwa gha ukombola waka Chapanga kwa bhana bhaka Ibulahimu ambabhu nde bhandu bha Izilaeli, pabhakabhili bhabhoka mu inchi ja Misili (Sula 1-12). Kuhuma konihoku Chapanga akabhalongwihi bhandu bhaki mbaka mu uwanda ghoukabhili pahi ja chitombi cha Sinai, pandu ambapu Chapanga akumpekihi Musa shelia yamaheli nahuli Bhaizilaeli bhaijengalyaje (Sula 12-19). Shelia ayeyi ilandila ntundu moibhapalakila kutenda, ntundu moibhapalakila kubhoha nyambiku (nhupu), na malaghalakilu gha kuchenga Lihema Lihuhu (pandu ambapu pakapaliki kubha matamu ghaka Chapanga pachilanda jabhu), bhelabhela Lisanduku la Lulaghilu na hindu yengi ya kuhengela lihengu la kujojabhela mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu, na ingobhu ya kipenganyambiku (Sula 20-31). Bhela, baada ja kihengu cha kuasi kwa bhana bha Izilaeli kwa kulilenganakela chimong'umong'u cha ng'ombi ja zahabu, Musa akahimangini na Chapanga kabhete baada ja kuasi hoku (Sula 32-33). Mu pandu pa kujomukela pa chitabu chenu, tusoma ntundu hindu heyi yeyatumiki kwa ndandi ja kunjojabhela Chapanga moyalenganakike (Sula 33-40).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Maelezu gha bhana bha Izilaeli ntundu mobhajeghalakile mu utumwa mu inchi ja Misili (Sula 1).</para>
  <para style="io">Malobhi ghaka Musa kutumbula umwana waki mbaka pala paakalowakiki kubhakombola bhandu bhaka Chapanga (Sula 2-4).</para>
  <para style="io">Bhela mlemba wa chitabu alandila ntundu Chapanga moakahengile ngangachu na kujilapula inchi ja Misili kwa malapuliku makolongwa kwa lengu la kubhakombola bhandu bhaki kuhuma mu inchi jenijela, na bhelabhela mu ujoghuheku wa manjolinjoli ghaka Falao (Sula 5-15:21).</para>
  <para style="io">Kuhuma panihapa bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakatendiki mwanja na kuhika pandu pa chitombi cha Sinai (Sula 15-19:22).</para>
  <para style="io">Tusoma ntundu Chapanga moakumpekihe Tolati Musa, shelia jejakabhili na maelezu gha mkati ghaghalandili ntundu bhandu bhaka Chapanga, Bhaizialeli, moaibhapalakile kutama na kujojabhela (Sula 20-31).</para>
  <para style="io">Tusoma ntundu bhana bha Izilaeli mobhakahengile uasi kwaka Chapanga, pala pabhakundobhiki mbeli waka Musa joakalowakiki Haluni abhalenganakyaje chimong'umong'u chechabhili na liumbu la ng'ombi ja zahabu (Sula ja 32).</para>
  <para style="io">Tusoma ntundu Musa moakaubhonile ulumbalilu au ung'anyi waka Chapanga, na kubhabhola Bhaizilaeli shelia yaka Chapanga, papamu na kubhaelekeza ntundu wa kulenganakela Lihema Lihuhu, Lisanduku la Lulaghilu na hindu yengi ya kujojabhela yeitumika mu Lihema Lihuhu, na ingobhu yeipalika kuwatakika na bhapenganyambiku (Sula 33-40).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhang'ahakika ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />Aghagha nde mahina gha bhana bha chikambaku bha Izilaeli, ambabhu bhakapiti ku Misili na Yakobo tati wabhu, kila jumu papamu na bhandu bha munyumba jake: <verse eid="EXO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Leubeni, Simioni, Lawi na Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />na Isaka, Zebuloni na Benyamini, <verse eid="EXO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />na Dani, Nafutali, Gadi na Asheli. <verse eid="EXO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />Bhabhelakeka bhokapi bhaka Yakobo bhakabhi bhandu sabini. Chikahi chenihechi Yusufu akabhi ajomwili kulongulela kutama ku Misili. <verse eid="EXO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Panakatai, Yusufu na bhalongu bhaki bhokapi, na chibheleku chela chokapi chakapotile, <verse eid="EXO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />nambu bhabhelakeka bhaka Izilaeli bhakajonjukiki namaa, bhakabhi bhamaheli na bhakabhi na makili nakanopi, bhakajaghanili kila pandu ku inchi ja Misili.<verse eid="EXO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Bhela, akapitalili nkolongwa jongi kutawala ku Misili, jonihoju ngacheakummanyi Yusufu. <verse eid="EXO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Najombi akabhapwaghili bhandu bhake, “Ndingalyaje ntundu Bhaizilaeli mobhabheli bhamaheli na mobhabheli na makili kupeta tepani. <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" />Henu tulondaje indela ja kubhahengela kwa malangu na kubhahibhalakila nahuli ngabhijonjukeka, nangakutenda bhenibhela, ngati ngondu anajipitalili anabhakubha papamu na maadui bhitu na kukomana na tepani na kujitila inchi jenu.” <verse eid="EXO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" />Bhela, Bhamisili bhakabhahawili bhajemalela bha kubhajemalela Bhaizilaeli na kubhang'aha kwa lihengu lelinonwipe. Bhaizilaeli bhakahengiki lihengu la kunchengela Falao michi ja kubheka chilebhi chaki, Pitomu na Lamesesi. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Nambu kwa ntundu mobhakajendalili kubhang'aha nde ntundu Bhaizilaeli mobhakapetalili kujonjukeka na kujaghanila mu inchi ja Misili. Henu Bhamisili bhakabhajowipi namaa Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />Bhela, Bhamisili bhakabhajomalakili Bhaizilaeli bhahengaje lihengu lelinonwipe. <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" />Bhakaghatendiki matamu gha Bhaizilaeli kubha mabhabha kwa kutenda lihengu linonope la kulenganakela chokaa ja kuchengela na kufyatula matofali na mahengu gha mu mighonda. Mu mahengu ghabhu ghokapi gha kunonopa, Bhamisili bhakabhatendili Bhaizilaeli panga na chiha.<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Bhela, nkolongwa wa Bhamisili akabhalaghalakili Shifula na Pua bhabhakabhi bhabhabheleha akambomba bha Kiebulania, <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />akabhapwaghile, “Pamwabheleha akambomba bha Kiebulania, anaabhelakiki mwana wa chikambaku, munkomaje, nambu ngati mwana wa chimbomba, mundekaje atamaje.” <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" />Nambu bhabheleha bhanihabha bhakabhi bhuntopela Chapanga, ngachebhakatendiki ngati mobhalaghalakiwi na nkolongwa wa Misili, nambu bhakabhalekiki bhana bha chikambaku bhatamaje. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Bhela nkolongwa wa Misili akabhalohiki bhabheleha habha, na kubhalalukila, “Kwa ndandi kiki mtendiki anana? Maghambu kiki mwalekiki bhana bha chikambaku kutama?”<verse eid="EXO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" />Bhabheleha bhakamuyangiki Falao, “Akambomba bha Kiebulania ngachebhalengana na akambomba bha Kimisili, bhombi bhabhi na makili, nabhombi bhalibhopola bhana mangani ja bhabheleha kuhika.” <verse eid="EXO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20" />Bhela, Chapanga akabhatendili ghamboni bhabheleha habha, nabhombi Bhaizilaeli bhakapetalili kujonjukeka na kubha na makili nakanope. <verse eid="EXO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21" />Kwa kubha bhabheleha habha bhuntopila Chapanga, Chapanga akabhajangatili kubha na bhana bhabhu bhene. <verse eid="EXO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Bhela Falao akabhalaghalakili bhandu bhaki bhokapi, akapwaghaje, “Kila mwana wa chikambaku joanabhelakikaje kwa Bhaebulania mundekalaje mu nkoka Naili, nambu kila mwana wa chimbomba mundekaje atamaje.”<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s">Kubhelakeka kwaka Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />Mundu jumu wa likabila la Bhalawi akuntowili mbomba jumu, mbomba hoju bhelabhela akabhi wa likabila la Bhalawi. <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" />Mbomba hoju akapatiki chitumbu, na kulibhopola mwana wa chikambaku. Paakumbweni mwana hoju kubha nde mnyahi akunhiiki kwa myehi jitatu. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Nambu paakaweni ngacheaweza kunhiya nakanopi, akalenganakili chikapu, akachipakiki chindu chechilengana na lami. Panihapa akumbekiki mwana hoju mkati jaki, akachihiiki pachilanda ja mateti munkeghi ja nkoka Naili. <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" />Ndombu waka mwana jola akalihiiki pambipi na pandu pala nahuli alolaje cheanachumpata mwana.<verse eid="EXO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />Bhela, mwali waka Falao akahelili ku nkoka Naili kujogha, na bhatumika bhaki bhakabhi bhajendajenda munkeghi ja nkoka. Mwali jola akachiweni chikapu pachilanda ja mateti, akuntumiki mtumika waki kujenda kundetela. <verse eid="EXO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />Akachihowili chikapu chela, na kumbona mwana wa chikambaku mkati jaki. Mwana akabhi alela, akumboni chiha. Akapwaghaje, “Jonjoni nde jumu wa bhana bha Bhaebulania.”<verse eid="EXO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Palapala ndombu waka mwana hoju akundalukili mwali waka Falao, “Bho, nyenda le nikakupalila jumu wa akambomba wa Kiebulania akulelilaje mwana jonjone kwa ndandi jako?”<verse eid="EXO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Mwali waka Falao akamuyangike, “Ena, ujendaje ukundohaje.” Mwali jola akapiti kundoha mabhu waka mwana jola. <verse eid="EXO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Mwali waka Falao akumpwaghili mabhu jola, “Untolaje mwana jonjoni unyangatyaje kunjongeha kwa ndandi jangu, nanatu ananukulepaje.” Bhela mbomba jola akuntoliki mwana jola na kundela. <verse eid="EXO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />Mwana paakajomwili kujonga, mabhu waki akumpeliki kwaka mwali waka nkolongwa Falao, najombi akunjopiki na kuntenda kubha mwana waki. Akundohiki lihina laki Musa, akapwaghaje, “Maghambu numbohiki mu machi.”<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa akembalela ku inchi ja Midiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />Musa paakabhi akolike, akapiti kubhabhona Bhaebulania bhajaki, ntundu mobhahengela lihengu linonopi. Akumbweni Mmisili akundapulaje Muebulania, jumu wa bhalongu bhaki. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Musa akalingiki koni na koni, na paakaweni kubha njeta mundu, akundapwili na kunkoma Mmisili jola, na kunhiya muluhanga. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Chilabhu jaki, Musa akabhokiki kabhete, akabhaweni Bhaebulania bhabheli bhakomana. Bhela, akundalukili jola joakabhi andapula njaki, “Maghambu kiki undapula Muebulania njako?”<verse eid="EXO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Mundu jola akayangike, “Bho, nde nane joakubhekiki wehepa kubha njemalela na ntemula wito? Bho, upala kungoma ngati mounkomile Mmisili jola?” Panihapa Musa akajowipi, na kuholalela, “Chakaka lijambu lenilihengiki lela lijomwi kumanyikana.” <verse eid="EXO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" />Bhela Falao paakajowini lijambu heli, akapaliki kunkoma Musa, nambu Musa akuntiliki Falao na kujenda kutama mu inchi ja Midiani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 2:15">Lichobha limu, Musa akabhi atemi munkeghi ja chilibha cha machi. <verse eid="EXO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" />Mpenganyambiku wa ku Midiani akabhi na akakamwali saba, nabhombi bhakahikiki kuteka machi mu chilibha, bhakatwelakili pandu pa kukengela hinyama machi nahuli kughakenga mambeleli na imbuhi yaka tati wabhu. <verse eid="EXO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />Bhadima bhakumu bhakahikiki na kubhatopola akakamwali habha. Nambu Musa akajemiki kubhajangatila akakamwali habha, na kuikenga machi hinyama yabhu. <verse eid="EXO 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />Akakamwali bhala pabhakakelawiki kunyumba jaka Leueli tati wabhu, akabhalalukile, “Bho, kubhi bhole lalenu kulabhalila kubhuja?”<verse eid="EXO 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Bhakamuyangike, “Mmisili jumu akatukengalili kuhuma mu mabhoku gha bhadima. Kabhete mundu hoju akatutekili machi na kuikenga hinyama yitu.”<verse eid="EXO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Tati wabhu akabhalalukili akakamwali bhaki, “Bho, abhi kwako? Maghambu kiki mundekiki mundu jonihoju konihoko? Mundohaje ahika kula chilebhe na tepani.”<verse eid="EXO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Musa akajetakili kutama kwaka mundu hoju, panihapa mundu hoju akumpeki Musa mwali waki joakalowakiki Sipola akubha nhwanu waki. <verse eid="EXO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" />Sipola akumbelakili mwana wa chikambaku. Najombi Musa akundohiki lihina laki Geshomu, ndandi jaki, “Mi nungeni mu inchi ja kighene.”<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />Hyaka yamaheli yakapetike, nkolongwa wa ku Misili akapotile, Bhaizilaeli bhakaleliki cha muntima kwa ndandi ja utumwa wabhu. Bhakundelili Chapanga nahuli kulobha ujangatilu, na chilelu chabhu chakunhikili Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" />Chapanga akajowini chilelu chabhu cha muntima, najombi akakombwiki lulaghilu lwaki loakatendiki na Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />Bhela, Chapanga akabhalingalili Bhaizilaeli na kubhabhonela chiha. Panihapa akaweni kubha impalika kubhajangatila.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga ampitalila Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />Lichobha limu, Musa akabhi adima hinyama yaka Yesulo nkowanu wake, mpenganyambiku wa ku Midiani. Musa akaipeliki hinyama kutali ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa chingwenje, najombi akahikiki mbaka ku Holebu, chitombi chaka Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" />Konihoku mtumika wa kunani waka Bambo Chapanga akumpitalili Musa mu chimuli cha moto chechibhelela kuhuma pachilanda ja chitutu. Musa akalingalili na kukangacha kuchibhona chitutu chibhelela moto, nambu ngachechitinyika. <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Musa akaholalile, “Anang'anambuka henu, na kujenda kuchibhona chindu hechi cha kukangacha, anamonaje kubha maghambu kiki chitutu hechi ngachechitinyika.”<verse eid="EXO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />Bambo Chapanga paakumbweni Musa ang'anambwiki nahuli alolaje, Chapanga akundohiki kuhuma mkati ja chitutu chela, “Musa! Musa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 3:4">Najombi Musa akayangike, “Naam! Nepani pambane.”<verse eid="EXO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" />Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Ngawiheghalela pambane nakanopi. Uhulaje magubasi mu magholu ghako, maghambu pandu paujemiki hapa nde pandu pahuhu.” <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" />Kabheti Chapanga akumpwaghili Musa, “Nepani nde Chapanga wa akahokolu bhaku, Chapanga waka Ibulahimu, Chapanga waka Isaka na Chapanga waka Yakobo.” Musa paakajowini ghanihagha, akalihiiki pamihu jaki kwa mabhoku, maghambu akajowipi kundingalila Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Chakaka naghaweni mang'ahiku gha bhandu bhangu mu Misili, nanatu nyowini chilelu chabhu ntundu mobhahengakewa na bhajemalela bhabhu. Nepani manyi mang'ahiku ghabhu, <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" />henu nhelili kubhakengalela kuhuma mu mabhoku gha Bhamisili, na kubhakweha kuhuma mu inchi jeniheji, na kubhapelaka mu inchi jinyahi na ngolongwa, inchi jejitwelile mahibha na buse, inchi ja Bhakanaani, Bhahiti, Bhaamoli, Bhapelizi, Bhahivi na Bhayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />Bhela, chilelu cha Bhaizilaeli chinhikile, na nepani mweni ntundu Bhamisili mobhang'ahila Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />Henu, ananukutumaje ujendaje kwaka Falao, nahuli ukabhabhohaje bhandu bhangu Bhaizilaeli kuhuma mu inchi ja ku Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />Nambu Musa akumpwaghi Chapanga, “Nepani na nane mbaka nyenda kwaka Falao na kubhapiha Bhaizilaeli bhabhokaje mu inchi ja ku Misili?”<verse eid="EXO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" />Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Chakaka nepani anangubha papamu na wehapa. Jenjenu anajikubha nginyulila kwako kubha nde nepani nenukutuma: Bhela anaujomwili kubhapiha bhandu mu Misili, mwanjojabhalyaje Chapanga mu chitombi chenjeno.”<verse eid="EXO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Musa akumpwaghi Chapanga, “Anambiti kwa Bhaizilaeli na kubhapwaghila, ‘Chapanga wa akatati bhinu andumiki kwinu,’ nabhombi anabhanaluki, ‘Lihina laki nane?’ Ananibhayanga bhole?”<verse eid="EXO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" />Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Nepani Mile Nemile. Bhenibhela nde mowabhapwaghilaje Bhaizilaeli, ‘Nepani Mile andumiki kwino.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />Kabhete Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli malobhi ghangane, ‘Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akahokulu bhinu, Chapanga waka Ibulahimu, Chapanga waka Isaka, na Chapanga waka Yakobo andumiki kwino.’ ” Lendenu nde lihina langu mileli, nalombi nde ukombukelu wangu mbaka hibheleku yokapi yeihika. <verse eid="EXO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" />Ujendaje, ukabhabhongana bhazee bha ku Izilaeli papamu, ukabhapwaghilaje, “Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akahokulu bhinu, Chapanga waka Ibulahimu, Chapanga waka Isaka, na Chapanga waka Yakobo akambitalili na kumbwaghila, ‘Nundingalili, nanatu naghawe ghamtendiwi ku Misili hoku. <verse eid="EXO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />Nanatu mbwaghiki ananumpihaje kuhuma mu mang'ahiku ghinu mu inchi ja Misili, na kumpeleka ku inchi ja Bhakanaani, Bhahiti, Bhaamoli, Bhapelizi, Bhahivi, na Bhayebusi, inchi jejitwelile mahibha na buse.’<verse eid="EXO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />“Bhazee bha Izilaeli anabhakujowanyaje. Bhela wehapa na bhezee habha mwijendaje kwaka Falao na kumpwaghila, ‘Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Bhaebulania atupitalile. Henu tukulobha utulekakyaje tujenda mwanja wa machobha ghatatu kuchingwenje, nahuli kubhoha nyambiku kwaka Bambo Chapanga witu.’ <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />Chakaka manyi kubha nkolongwa wa ku Misili ngaandeki njendaje, mbaka chiwoku chechibhi na makili chinjomalakyaje. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" />Nambu ananhatambula chiwoku changu na kubhalapula Bhamisili kwa ngangachu yokapi yeanandendaje pachilanda jabhu. Paghijomuka ghanihagha anaandekakyaje mbokaje.<verse eid="EXO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" />“Nanatu ananabhatendaje Bhamisili bhakubhaje na mitima jambone ja kubhahengela Bhaizilaeli, bhela, pamwibhokaje mu inchi jeniheji ngamwibhoki mabhoku matopu. <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" />Kila mbomba Muizilaeli anaandobha wapambipi jaki Mmisili na mbomba jokapi joatama mu nyumba jaki ampekyaje hindu yeilenganakiki kwa madini gha feza, zahabu na ingobhu, na mwehapa anamwawatika bhana bhinu na akakamwali bhinu. Bhenibhela nde momwihengaje kubhatolela hindu ya Bhamisili.”<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga ampekeha Musa lujiniku lwa kutenda ngangachu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Bhela Musa akamuyangiki Bambo Chapanga, “Anakukubha bhole ngati Bhaizilaeli ngabhihobhaleli na ngabhijowaneli chenikipwagha, maghambu anabhapwaghaje, ‘Bambo Chapanga ngacheakupitalile’?”<verse eid="EXO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akundalukili Musa, “Ukamwi kike mu mabhoku ghako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:2">Musa akayangike, “Ndonga.”<verse eid="EXO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Jilekalaje pahi.” Musa akajilekili pahi ndonga jela, najombi jakang'anambwiki kubha lijoka, Musa akatilike. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Hatambulaje chiwoku chaku, unkamulaje nkela.” Henu Musa akahatambwili chiwoku chaki akalikamwili lijoka lela, panihapa lijoka heli lakang'anambwiki kabheti kubha ndonga mumabhoku ghaki. <verse eid="EXO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" />Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Utendaje anana nahuli Bhaizilaeli bhahobhalyaje kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akahokulu bhabhu, Chapanga waka Ibulahimu, Chapanga waka Isaka, na Chapanga waka Yakobo, nukupitalili wehapa.”<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />Kabheti Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghili Musa, “Ubhekaje chiwoku chaku pachihimba mkati ja likanzu laku.” Panihapa Musa akabhekiki chiwoku chaki pachihimba mkati ja likanzu laki, nambu paakachipihiki, chakabhi na chitamu cha malohi, chihuhu kupukupu. <verse eid="EXO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" />Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Henu ukelabhuhaje kabheti chiwoku chaku hechi pachihimba mkati ja likanzu laku.” Musa akachikelawihi chiwoku chaki pachihimba mkati ja likanzu laki na paakachipiiki, ukabhi ulamike, ngati pandu pangi pa hyegha jaki. <verse eid="EXO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ngati ngabhakuhobhaleli wehapa, wala kujowanela sauti ja nginyulila ja kutumbula, pangi anabhahobhalyaje nginyulila ja kabheli. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Nambu ngati ngabhahobhaleli nginyulila ibheli heyi au kughahobhalela malobhi ghaku, teka machi gha mu nkoka Naili na kughajitila panani ja luhombi. Machi hagha anaghakubha mwahe panani ja luhombi.”<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />Nambu Musa akumpwaghili Bambo Chapanga, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, nepani ngachemili na uwezu wa kulongela wichu kutumbula pakutumbula, wala kutumbu chikahi wehapa pautumbula kulongela na nepani mtumika waku. Nepani ndopiki kulongela, na lulimi lwangu lutehi kutopa.”<verse eid="EXO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />Bambo Chapanga akundalukile, “Nde nane joabhombiki ndomu waka mundu? Nde nane joantenda mundu kubha ngapwagha au ngajowa? Nde nane joampekeha mundu kulola au ngalola? Bho, nga nepani, Bambo Chapanga? <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" />Bhela jendaje, nepani namwete ananukujangatyaje kupwagha, nanatu ananukubholaje lijambu la kupwagha.”<verse eid="EXO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" />Nambu Musa akapwaghike, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, chondi untumaje mundu jonge kutenda lihengu lenihele.”<verse eid="EXO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akumbonili inyela Musa, na akumpwaghile, “Bho, si ubhi na mbeli waku, Haluni, Mlawi? Manyi jombi aweza kulongela wichu. Papamu na ghanihagha, lingalyaje, sajenu ahika kuhimangana na wehapa, najombi paanaakubhonaje, anahekalyaje muntima waki. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" />Wehapa anaulongila naku na kumpwaghila ghala ghaapalika kughalongela. Nepani namwete ananunjangataje mwehapa mwabheli kupwagha, nanatu ananumbolaje lijambu la kuhenga. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" />Haluni anaalongilaje na Bhaizilaeli kwa kupetela wehapa. Jombi anakubha ngati ndomu waku, na wehapa anaukubha ngati Chapanga kwaki. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />Henu utolaje ndonga jenjenu mu chiwoku chaku, nahuli kwa ndonga jeniheji anautendaje nginyulila yela.”<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa akelabhuka ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Bhela Musa akakelawiki kwaka Yesulo, nkowanu wake, na kumpwaghila, “Chondi unyetakyaje ngelabhukaje ku Misili kwa bhalongu bhangu, nakalolaje ngati bhakona bhomi.” Yesulo akumpwaghile, “Ujendaje kwa lukwale.”<verse eid="EXO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa akabya akali ku Midiani hoku, “Ukelabhukaje ku Misili kwa ndandi bhandu bhokapi bhabhapalikaje kukukoma bhapotile.” <verse eid="EXO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" />Panihapa Musa akuntoliki nhwanu waki na bhana bhaki, akabhakwehiki panani ja liponda na kutumbula mwanja kukelabhuka ku Misili. Najombi akajitoliki ndonga jaka Chapanga jela mu chiwoku chaki.<verse eid="EXO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" />Kabheti Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Pawihikaje ku Misili, ukatendaje palongi jaka Falao ngangachu yokapi yenukupekihi lujiniku lwa kuihenga. Nambu anandendaje mtima waka Falao kubha unonopi nahuli ngayijetakela kubhalekakela bhandu bhabhokaje. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" />Na wehapa umpwaghila Falao, Bambo Chapanga apwagha anana, ‘Izilaeli nde mwana wangu nepani wa chikambaku, mbelakeka wangu wa kutumbula. <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />Nanatu nakakupwaghili: Undekaje mwana wangu abhokaje, nahuli awezaje kunyojabhela nepani. Nambu wehapa ukakaniki kundeka ajendaje, henu lingalyaje, ananunkomaje mwana waku mbelakeka waku wa kutumbula.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />Chikahi Musa paakabhi akona mwindela kukelabhuka ku Misili, akabhi pandu pa kughonela bhagheni, henu, Bambo Chapanga akahimangini naku na kupala kunkoma. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Nambu Sipola akatondwili liganga la kutema, akahekiti ligovi laka mwana waki na kulibheka pamagholu ghaka Musa. Sipola akapwaghike, “Chakaka wehapa nde undomi wangu wa mwahi.” <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akundekiki Musa kubha mwome. Maghambu Sipola paakabhi anheketa mwana jando akabhi apwagha, “Chakaka wehapa nde undomi wangu wa mwahi.”<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Haluni, “Jendaje kuchingwenje ukahimangana na Musa.” Henu, Haluni akapiti, akahimangini na Musa ku chitombi chaka Chapanga, na kundamukila kwa kunkumbatila. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Bhela Musa akumpwaghili Haluni mambu ghokapi ghaakalaghalakiwi na Bambo Chapanga apwaghaje, na nginyulila yokapi yeakalaghalakiwi kutenda. <verse eid="EXO 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Musa na Haluni bhakapiti ku Misili na kubhabhongana bhazee bhokapi bha Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />Haluni akabhapwaghili kila chindu Bambo Chapanga cheakabhi ampwaghili Musa. Bhelabhela akatendiki nginyulila yokapi palongi ja bhandu bhokapi. <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />Bhandu bhakahobhalili, na pabhakajowini kubha Bambo Chapanga abhahikili Bhaizilaeli, na kubha aghaweni mang'ahiku ghabhu, bhandu bhokapi bhakachikimi na kujojabhela.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s">Musa na Haluni palongi jaka Falao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Bhela Musa na Haluni bhakapiti kwaka Falao, na kumpwaghila, “Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli apwagha anana, ‘Waleka bhandu bhangu bhabhokaje, nahuli bhakandendila uwangalalu kuchingwenje.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" />Nambu Falao akabhalalukile, “Bambo Chapanga nde nane, mbaka nunjowanyaje na kubhaleka Bhaizilaeli bhabhokaje? Nepani ngachenummanye Bambo Chapanga hujo, wala nganabhalekakeli Bhaizilaeli bhabhokaje.”<verse eid="EXO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Musa na Haluni bhakamuyangike, “Chapanga wa Bhaebulania ahimangini na tepani. Henu utulekaje tujendaje mwanja wa machobha ghatatu kuchingwenje nahuli kumbokela Bambo Chapanga witu nyambiku, ngati ngachetutendiki bhenibhela jombi anaatulapula kwa chitamu au kwa ngondo.”<verse eid="EXO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Nambu nkolongwa wa ku Misili akapwaghike, “Mbona wa Musa na Haluni mpala kubhatenda bhandu ngabhihenga lihengo? Njendanyaje mu mahengu ghino!” <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Panihapa Falao akapwaghike, “Lingalyaje, sajenu bhandu abhabha nde bhamaheli kuliku bhandu bhango, na mwehapa mubhahibhalila kuhenga lihengu!”<verse eid="EXO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Lichobha lelalela Falao akabhalaghalakili hiongozi bha bhatumwa na bhajemalela bha bhandu akapwaghaje, <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />“Kutumbu sajenu ngamwapekeha bhandu abhabha manyonyoli majomu gha kulenganakela matofali ngati mokwabheli pakutumbula. Ibhapalika bhakabhongana manyonyoli majomu bhene. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Nambu ubhalangiku wa matofali ghaghakabhi ghalenganakewa kila lichobha ghakubha bhelabhela, panga na kukepakewa litofali hata limu. Kwa ndandi bhandu abhabha nde bhakata ndemana bhalapu ngomela, bhakapwaghaje, ‘Utulekaje tujendaje kumbokeha Chapanga witu nyambiku.’ <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />Mwajonjukyaje lihengu linonopi bhandu abhabha nahuli bhakangamalaje na lihengu na bhakotukaje kujowanela malobhi gha upuhi kuhuma kwa ihongozi bhabhu.”<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Henu ihongozi bha bhatumwa na bhajemalela bhakapiti kubhapwaghila bhandu, “Anana nde Falao moapwaghila, ‘Nepani nganyendaleli kundetela manyonyoli majomu. <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />Njendanyanye mkalondaje manyonyoli majomu mabheni pokapi pamwiwezaje kughapata, nambu lihengu linu ngalikepakewi hata pachokopi.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />Panihapa bhandu bhokapi bhakapechangini kila pandu ku inchi ja ku Misili kubhongana manyonyoli majomu. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Bhajemalela bha bhatumwa bhakakangamili, bhakapwaghaje, “Muhengaje lihengu linu la kila lichobha la kufyatula matofali ngati pakutumbu hapa pamukabhi mpekewa manyonyoli majomu.” <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />Bhajemalela bha Bhaizilaeli bhabhahaghuliwi na hiongozi bha bhatumwa bhaka Falao bhakalapuliki na kulalukiwa, “Maghambu kiki ngachemuhikishi ubhalangiku wa matofali ghinu lichu na lalenu, ngati pakutumbula?”<verse eid="EXO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Panihapa bhajemalela bha Bhaizilaeli bhakapiti kundelela Falao bhakapwaghaje, “Maghambu kiki utuhengili anana, tepani tabhatumika bhako? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />Bhatumika bhaku ngachetupekewa manyonyoli majomu, hata bhela bhatupwaghila, ‘Mfyatulaje matofali!’ Lingalyaje, tepani bhatumika bhaku tulapulika, nambu lihakau nde la bhandu bhaku wamwete.”<verse eid="EXO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Nambu Falao akapwaghike, “Mwehapa nde mwakata nde ndandi mpwagha, ‘Utuleka tujenda kumbokela Bambo Chapanga nyambiku.’ <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Bhela, njendanyaje henu, mkahenga lihengo. Nganumpekehi manyonyoli majomu, na papamu na ghanihagha impalika kulenganakela ubhalangiku gholaghola wa matofali.” <verse eid="EXO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Bhajemalela bha Bhaizilaeli bhakamanyi kubha bhabhili mu mang'ahiku pabhakapwaghakiwi, “Ngacheimpalika kupunguza ubhalangiku wa matofali ghampalika kufyatula kila lichobha.”<verse eid="EXO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />Pabhakabhokiki kwaka Falao, bhakahimangini na Musa na Haluni bhakabhili bhalendalela kuhimangana nabhu. <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" />Bhakabhapwaghili Musa na Haluni, “Bambo Chapanga na andingalyaje na kuntemula mwehapa. Mtutendiki tuhakaliwaje palongi jaka Falao, na hiongozi bhaki, nanamu mwapekihi ndandi ja kutukoma tepane.”<verse eid="EXO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa andalamakila Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" />Bhela Musa akakelawiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghaje, “Wenga wa Bambo, maghambu kiki waletili mang'ahiku bhandu abhabha? Maghambu kiki undumiki nepane? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" />Maghambu kutumbula panakapiti kwaka Falao, na kulongela naku kwa lihina laku, abhapekihi mang'ahiku bhandu abhabha, na wehapa ngacheutendiki chokapi kubhakombola bhandu bhako!”<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Henu anaulolaje chindu cheananuntendila Falao, kwa ndandi ja chiwoku changu chechibhili na makili anaabhalekakyaje bhandu bhabhokaje, kwa chiwoku changu chechibhili na makili anaabhatopulaje bhabhokaje mu inchi jake.”<verse eid="EXO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga andoha Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Bhela Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" />Nakumpitalili Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo, ngati Chapanga Mweni Makili, nambu kwa lihina langu Bambo Chapanga, ngachenamanyakini kwabho. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" />Kabheti nakatendiki lulaghilu lwangu na bhombi, kubha ananabhapekya inchi ja Kanaani, inchi jebhakabhi bhatama ngati bhaghene. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, nyowini chilelu cha Bhaizilaeli, ambabhu Bhamisili bhabhajomalakela kuhenga lihengu la kung'ahakika, nanatu nulukombwiki lulaghilu lwangu. <verse eid="EXO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" />Bhela ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli, ‘Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, nanatu ananumbohaje kuhuma mu utumwa wa Bhamisili. Nanatu ananumbeka kulijeka mbokaje kuhuma mu utumwa wabho, nanatu ananunkombulaje kwa chiwoku changu chechibhi na makile, na kwa matendu makolongwa. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />Ananuntolaje kubha bhandu bhangu, nanatu anangubha Chapanga winu. Nanamu anammanyeje kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nenumbohiki pahi ja ibwahila ya Bhamisili. <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />Nanatu ananundetaje mu inchi jela jenakalapiki kumpekeha Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yokobo, ananumpekyaje inchi jeniheji jikubhaje jinu mabhete. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Musa akabhalandili Bhaizilaeli mambu ghanihagha, nambu ngachebhunjowanile kwa ndandi ja mabhinilu makolongwa gha muntima na utumwa wa kunonopa.<verse eid="EXO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />“Ujendaje ukumpwaghila Falao nkolongwa wa ku Misili, nahuli abhalekakyaje Bhaizilaeli bhabhokaje mu inchi jake.”<verse eid="EXO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" />Nambu Musa akumpwaghi Bambo Chapanga, “Ngati Bhaizilaeli ngachebhanyowanela nepani, bho Falao ananyowanyaje lelo? Nepani mili na chimama.”<verse eid="EXO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akabhalaghalakili Musa na Haluni, kubhokana na Bhaizilaeli na Falao, nkolongwa wa Misili, najombi akabhalaghalakili kubhabhoha Bhaizilaeli kuhuma mu inchi ja Misili.<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akahokolu bhaka Musa na Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />Aghagha nde mahina gha akahokolu bha lukolu yaka Izilaeli, bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Leubeni mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa chikambaku waka Izilaeli bhakabhili Henoki, Palu, Hesiloni, na Kalimi. Bhanihabha bhakabhili nde akahokulu mu lukolu yaka Leubeni. <verse eid="EXO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Simeoni bhakabhili Yemueli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Sohali na Shauli. Shauli akabhi mwana waka mbomba Mkanaani. Bhanihabha bhakabhili nde akahokolu mu lukolu yaka Simeoni. <verse eid="EXO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Ghangani nde mahina gha bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Lawi kulengana na ibheleku yabhu, Gelishomu, Kohati na Melali. Lawi akatami hyaka mia jimu na selasini na saba. <verse eid="EXO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Gelishomu, bhakabhili Libini na Shimei, kulengana na lukolu yabhu. <verse eid="EXO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Kohati bhakabhili Amulamu, Ishali, Hebuloni na Uzieli. Kohati akatemi hyaka mia jimu na selasini na tatu. <verse eid="EXO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Melali bhakabhili Mahili na Mushi. Bhanihabha nde akahokulu bha Bhalawi kulengana na ibheleku yabhu.<verse eid="EXO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" />Amulamu akuntowili Yokebedi, nihenga waki, najombi akumbelakili Haluni na Musa. Amulamu akatemi hyaka mia jimu na selasini na saba. <verse eid="EXO 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Ishali bhakabhi Kola, Nefegi na Zikili. <verse eid="EXO 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Uzieli bhakabhi Mishaeli, Elisafani, na Sitili.<verse eid="EXO 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Haluni akuntowili Elisheba, mwali waka Aminadabu, ndombu waka Nashoni, najombi akumbelakili Nadabu, Abihu, Eleazali na Itamali. <verse eid="EXO 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Kola bhakabhi Asili, Elikana na Abiasafu. Bhanihabha nde bhabhakabhili akahokolu bha lukolu yaka Kola. <verse eid="EXO 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Eleazali mwana waka Haluni akuntowili jumu wa akamwali bhaka Putieli, najombi akumbelakili Fenehasi. Bhanihabha nde bhabhakabhili akahokolu bha bhalongu bha Bhalawi, kulengana na lukolu yabhu.<verse eid="EXO 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" />Abhabha nde Haluni na Musa bhalabhala, Bambo Chapanga bhaakabhapwaghile, “Mubhapihaje Bhaizilaeli kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili kulengana na makabila ghabhu.” <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Bhanihabha nde Musa jolajola, na Haluni jolajola bhabhakalongili na Falao nkolongwa wa ku Misili, kubha abhalekakyaje Bhaizilaeli bhabhokaje mu inchi ja Misili.<verse eid="EXO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambo Chapanga andaghalakila Musa na Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28" />Lichobha lela Bambo Chapanga paakalongili na Musa ku inchi ja ku Misili, <verse eid="EXO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29" />akumpwaghile, “Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga. Umpwaghila Falao nkolongwa wa ku Misili mambu ghokapi ghanukupwaghila.”<verse eid="EXO 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Nambu Musa akumpwaghi Bambo Chapanga, “Nepani nongela kwa chimama, bho, nkolongwa Falao ananyowanya nenga?”<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Lingalyaje, nukutendiki kubha ngati Chapanga kwaka Falao, najombi Haluni mbeli waku anakubhaje mlota wako. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />Umpwaghilaje Haluni kila chindu chenukulaghalakile, najombi Haluni mbeli waku anaampwaghilaje Falao abhalekakyaje Bhaizilaeli bhabhokaje mu inchi jaki. <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3" />Nambu ananutendaje mtima waka Falao kubha wa kunonopa, na hata ngati ananyonjukili nginyulila na ngangachu mu inchi ja ku Misili, <verse eid="EXO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4" />nambu Falao ngaanjowaneli mwehapa. Nanatu anamekaje chiwoku chechibhi na makili na kujilapula inchi ja Misili, na kubhapiha bhandu bhangu, Bhaizilaeli, bhabhokaje mu inchi ja Misili kwa utemulu ukolongwa. <verse eid="EXO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" />Chikahi panihatambula chiwoku changu Bhamisili anabhamanyaje kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, na kubhapiha Bhaizilaeli bhapita monihomu.” <verse eid="EXO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Musa na Haluni bhakatendiki ngati Bambo Chapanga moakabhalaghalakile. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" />Musa akabhi na hyaka semanini, na Haluni akabhi na hyaka semanini na itatu chikahi pabhakalongili na Falao.<verse eid="EXO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndonga jaka Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghili Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" />“Ngati Falao anaampwaghili, ‘Mtenda ngangachu,’ panihapa umpwaghila Haluni, ‘Tola ndonga jaku na ujilekalaje pahi palongi jaka Falao,’ najombi ndonga heji anajing'anambukaje na kubha lijoka.” <verse eid="EXO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Panihapa Musa na Haluni bhakapiti kwaka Falao na kutenda ngati mobhakalaghalakiwi na Bambo Chapanga. Haluni akajilekili ndonga jela pahi palongi jaka Falao na bhatumika bhaki, najombi jakabhi lijoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" />Bhela Falao najombi akabhalohiki bhabhabhili na mbulau na bhahabhi na bhaganga bha ku Misili, nabhombi bhakatendiki bhelabhela kwa uhabhi wabhu. <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />Kila jumu akajilekili ndonga jaki pahi, nayombi yakang'anambwiki kubha lijoka. Nambu ndonga jaka Haluni jakaimiliki ndonga yabhu. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Hata bhela mtima waka Falao ukajendalili kubha wa kunonopa namaa, najombi ngacheanjowanile Musa na Haluni, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakapwaghile.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilapuliku la kutumbula: Machi ghang'anambuka kubha mwahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Mtima waka Falao utehi kunonopa, akana kubhalekakela Bhaizilaeli bhabhokaje. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Henu ujendaje ukahimangana na Falao chilabhu lukela, chikahi payijenda kunkoka Naili. Undendalyaje munkeghi ja nkoka. Utotulaje ndonga jela jejang'anambwiki kubha lijoka jela mu chiwoku chaku. <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />Bhela umpwaghila Falao, ‘Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Bhaebulania, andumiki nukupwaghilaje: Ubhalekaje bhandu bhangu bhajendaje, nahuli bhapata kunyojabhela kuchingwenje. Nambu mbaka sajenu ngacheunyowanela. <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17" />Haleli nde leapwagha Bambo Chapanga: Kwa lijambu aleli anaumanyaje kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga. Lingalyaje, ananaghalapulaje machi gha nkoka Naili kwa ndonga jenjenu, na machi ghokapi anaghang'anambukaje kubha mwahi. <verse eid="EXO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18" />Homba yeibhi mu nkoka Naili anaikuwaje, na nkoka hoghu anaunungaje chihakau, na Bhamisili ngabhiwezi kunywa machi ghaki.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Umpwaghila Haluni, ‘Utola ndonga jaku jela uhatambula chiwoku chaku panani ja machi gha Misili, na panani ja mikoka jokapi, panani ja mikolulela, panani ja hilibha na panani ja matanda ghokapi, nayombi anaikubha mwahi. Anakubya na mwahi inchi jokapi ja ku Misili, mbaka mu yombu ya mikongu na ihulu ya lutopi.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" />Musa na Haluni bhakatendiki ngati Bambo Chapanga moakalaghalakile. Haluni akajukwihi ndonga jaki kunani palongi jaka Falao na bhatumika bhaki na kughalapula machi gha nkoka Naili, na machi ghokapi ghakang'anambwiki kubha mwahi. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Homba yeyakabhi mu nkoka Naili yakahwile, na machi ghakanungiki chihakau namaa mbaka Bhamisili ngachebhakaweziki kunywa machi ghaki. Mwahi ukabhi kila pandu mu inchi ja ku Misili. <verse eid="EXO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Nambu bhahabhi bha ku Misili kwa kutumila uhabhi wabhu bhakahengiki bhelabhela, na mtima waka Falao ukabhi unonwipe, ngacheabhajowanile Musa na Haluni, ngati bhela Bambo Chapanga moakapwaghile. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />Bhela, Falao akakelawiki na kujenda mu nyumba jaki, na mambu ghokapi ghaghapitalili hagha ngacheaghabhekiki muntima waki. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />Bhamisili bhokapi bhakahembikihembiki munkeghi ja nkoka Naili nahuli bhapata machi gha kunywa, kwa ndandi ngachebhaweziki kunywa machi gha nkoka hoghu.<verse eid="EXO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Ghakapetiki machobha saba kutumbula Bambo Chapanga paakaghalapwi machi gha nkoka Naili.<verse eid="EXO 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="s">Lilapuliku la kabheli: Mahungula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ujendaje kwaka Falao ukumpwaghilaje: Lendenu nde leapwagha Bambo Chapanga, ‘Ubhalekaje bhandu bhangu bhabhokaje, nahuli bhapata kunyojabhela. <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" />Ngati anaukaniki kubhalekakela bhabhokaje, lingalyaje, ananijilapulaje inchi jaku kwa kuleta mahungula. <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />Nkoka Naili anautwelalaje mahungula, naghombi anaghajingala mbaka munyumba jaku na kuchumba chaku cha kughonela na pachitanda chaku, na munyumba ya bhatumika bhaku, na bhandu bhaku. Mahungula ghanihagha anaghajingalaje pa ihinja hinu na mu yombu hinu ya kuhunyila uhembi. <verse eid="EXO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />Mahungula anaghakwelaje panani ja hyegha jaku, na panani ja bhandu bhaku na bhatumika bhaku bhokapi.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Umpwaghila Haluni, ‘Uhatambulaje chiwoku chaku chechibhili na ndonga panani ja mikoka, panani ja mikolulela na matanda, naghombi mahungula anaghapitalyaje na kujaghanila kila pandu mu inchi ja Misili.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" />Bhela, Haluni akahatambwili chiwoku chaki chechibhili na ndonga panani ja machi ghokapi gha Misili, naghombi mahungula ghakapitalili na kuhyeka inchi jokapi ja Misili. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Nambu bhahabhi bha ku Misili kwa uhabhi wabhu, nabhombi bhakaletiki mahungula panani ja inchi ja Misili.<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />Bhela Falao akundohiki Musa na Haluni, na kubhapwaghila, “Mundobhaje Bambo Chapanga abhohaje mahungula kuhuma kwangu na kwa bhandu bhangu, nanatu ananabhalekakyaje bhandu bhinu bhajenda, nahuli bhakumbokihaje nyambiku Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Musa akumpwaghi Falao, “Ena! Nukupekeha lujiniku lwa kuloghola kubha nde chikahi bhole cheupala kukulobhela wehapa, bhatumika bhaku, na bhandu bhaku, nahuli mahungula aghagha ghabhokaje kwinu na munyumba hinu. Nambu ghahighalyaje pela ghaghabhili mu nkoka Naili.”<verse eid="EXO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" />Falao akapwaghike, “Mnobhilaje chilabhu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 8:10">Musa akayangike, “Anaikubha ngati moupwaghile, nahuli upata kumanya kubha njeta jongi jokapi joabhi ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu. <verse eid="EXO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Mahungula anaghabhokaje kwaku, na mu manyumba ghaku, kwa bhatumika bhaku na kwa bhandu bhaku, anaghahighalyaje gha mu nkoka Naili pela.” <verse eid="EXO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" />Panihapa Musa na Haluni bhakabhokiki kunyumba jaka Falao, na Musa akundelili Bambo Chapanga aghabhohaje mahungula ghaakabhi aghaletiki kwaka Falao. <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />Najombi Bambo Chapanga akatendiki lijambu lela leakalobhiki Musa, mahungula ghakahwili mu manyumba, muibhanja na mu mighonda. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />Bhandu bhakabhongini mahungula ghanihagha mapogha mapogha, na inchi jokapi ja Misili jakanungike. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" />Nambu Falao paakaweni kubhili na mbanga, akautendiki mtima waki kubha kunonopa kabhete, bhela ngacheakabhajowanili Musa na Haluni, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakapwaghile.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilapuliku la katatu: Ipapane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Umpwaghila Haluni, ‘Uhatambulaje ndonga jaku na kululapula luhombi lwa ndema,’ na luhombi analung'anambukaje kubha ipapane mu inchi jokapi ja Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Bhakatendiki bhenibhela, Haluni akahatambwili chiwoku chaki chechibhili na ndonga chela na kululapula luhombi lwa ndema, nalwombi lukang'anambwiki kubha ipapane na kubhahikila bhandu na hinyama. Luhombi lwokapi mu inchi jokapi ja Misili lukabhi ipapane. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" />Nambu bhahabhi bha ku Misili, kwa uhabhi wabhu nabhombi bhakalengiki kulung'anambula luhombi kubha ipapane, nambu ngachebhawezike. Ipapane heyi yakajaghanili kwa bhandu na kwa hinyama. <verse eid="EXO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" />Panihapa bhahabhi bhala bhakumpwaghi Falao, “Aleli nde lihengu la chiwoku chaka Chapanga.” Nambu mtima waka Falao ukajendalili kubha wa kunonopa najombi ngacheanjowanili Musa na Haluni, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakapwaghile.<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilapuliku la kachechi: Mabhembi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Chilabhu ujumukaje lukela pachibhombu unjendila Falao chikahi paajenda kunkoka na umpwaghilaje: Bambo Chapanga apwagha anana, ‘Ubhalekaje bhandu bhangu bhajendaje, nahuli bhapata kunyojabhela. <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />Ngati ngawalekakeli bhandu bhangu bhabhokaje ananukuletilaje mabhongelu gha mabhembi panani jaku, kwa bhatumika bhaku, kwa bhandu bhaku na mu manyumba ghinu. Nyumba yokapi ya Bhamisili anaitwelilaje mabhembi, na hata luhombi lwokapi lwa inchi jokapi ja Misili. <verse eid="EXO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" />Nambu lichobha heli pandu pa Gosheni kobhatama bhandu bhangu ngakwikubhi na mabhongelu gha mabhembi, nahuli mpata kumanya kubha nepani Bambo Chapanga, mili mu inchi jenjeno. <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />Nanatu ananabhatengaje pachilanda ja bhandu bhangu na bhandu bhako. Nginyulila heji ja kukangacha anajipitalyaje chilabhu.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akatendiki bhenibhela. Akaletiki mabhongelu makolongwa gha mabhembi ghakatwelili mu nyumba jaka Falao na mu manyumba gha bhatumika bhaki, kabheti inchi jokapi ja Misili jakayonangiki na mabhembi.<verse eid="EXO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Panihapa Falao akundohiki Musa na Haluni na kubhapwaghila, “Njendanyaje mukumbohila Chapanga winu nyambiku mu inchi jenjeno.”<verse eid="EXO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Nambu Musa akumpwaghile, “Ngabhela! Leniheli ngalikubhi wichu. Nyambiku jeanatumbokiha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, anaikubhaje lihakalilu kwa Bhamisili. Ngati anatubhohiki nyambiku ambayu nde lihakalilu palongi ja Bhamisili, bho, ngabhatulapuli kwa maganga? <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />Itupalika tujendaje mwanja wa machobha ghatatu kuchingwenje nahuli kumbokela nyambiku Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, ngati moakatulaghalakile.”<verse eid="EXO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" />Bhela Falao akapwaghike, “Ananundekakyaje njendaje kumbokela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu nyambiku kuchingwenje hoku, nambu ngamwijenda kutali nakanope. Henu mnobhilaje na nepane.”<verse eid="EXO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29" />Musa akayangike, “Chikahi pela panibhokaje, ananundobhaje Bambo Chapanga nahuli mabhongelu aghagha gha mabhembi ghabhokaje kwaka Falao, kwa bhatumika bhaki na kwa bhandu bhaki, chilabhu. Nambu Falao ngawatukolowa kabhete, kwa kulepalela kubhalekakela bhandu bhajendaje kumbokela Bambo Chapanga nyambiku.”<verse eid="EXO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30" />Panihapa Musa akundekiki Falao na kundobha Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31" />Bambo Chapanga akatendiki ngati Musa moakundobhile. Bambo Chapanga akaghabhohiki mabhembi kwaka Falao, na kwa bhatumika bhaki, na kwa bhandu bhaki, njeta libhembi hata limu lelakahighalile. <verse eid="EXO 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32" />Nambu hata chikahi chenjenu kabheti Falao akautendiki mtima waki kubha wa kunonopa, wala ngacheakajetakili Bhaizilaeli habha bhabhokaje.<verse eid="EXO 8:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s">Lilapuliku la kahanu: Kupotela kwa hinyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ujendaje kwaka Falao ukumpwaghilaje: Lendenu nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Bhaebulania leapwagha, ‘Ubhalekaje bhandu bhangu bhajendaje nahuli bhakapataje kunyojabhela. <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" />Ngati anaukana kubhaleka bhajendaje, na kujendalela kubhahibhalakila, <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" />ananhatambulaje chiwoku changu na kuleta lilapuliku lihakau namaa kwa hinyama yaku yeibhili mu mighonda jaku, panani ja falasi yaku, maponda ghaku, ngamia yaku, ng'ombi yaku, mambeleli ghaku, na imbuhi yaku. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga anaatengaje pachilanda ja hinyama ya Bhaizilaeli na hinyama ya Bhamisili, kubha njeta chinyama hata chimu chaka Muizilaeli cheanachipotilaje. <verse eid="EXO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />Bambo Chapanga akabhekiki chikahi na kupwagha: Chilabhu nepani Bambo Chapanga anandendaje lijambu lenu mu inchi ja Misili.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" />Chilabhu jaki Bambo Chapanga akatendiki cheakapwaghike. Hinyama yokapi ya Bhamisili yakahwile, nambu njeta chinyama hata chimu cha Bhaizilaeli chechakawile. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Falao akabhatumiki bhatumika bhaki kulalukila panani ja hinyama ya Bhaizilaeli, pabhakelawiki bhakumpwaghili kubha njeta chinyama chabhu hata chimu chechiwile. Nambu mtima waka Falao ukajendali kubha na ing'omu, wala ngacheukajetakili kubhalekakela bhandu bhajendaje.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilapuliku la sita: Maputi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa na Haluni, “Mhapulaje ilihu ya mvune, najombi Musa aghahomaje kunani palongi jaka Falao. <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" />Ilihu yeniheyi anaikubhaje luhombi lupepandau loanalujaghanyaje panani ja inchi jokapi ja Misili. Nalwombi analuletaje maputi ghaghahimba, na kupojoka panani ja bhandu na hinyama, mu inchi jokapi ja Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" />Bhela bhakatoliki ilihu kuhuma mu mvune na kujema palongi jaka Falao. Musa akahuwiki kunani, naghombi maputi ghaghahimba ghakapitalile mu hyegha ja bhandu na hinyama. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Bhalondola bhala ngachebhaweziki kujema palongi jaka Musa kwa ndandi ja maputi ghala, maghambu nabhombi bhaganga bhakabhi na mapute, na Bhamisili bhokapi bhakabhi naghu. <verse eid="EXO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga akautendiki mtima waka Falao kubha wa kunonopa, najombi ngacheabhajowanili Musa na Haluni, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakumpwaghile Musa.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilapuliku la saba: Iyula ja maganga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ujumukaje lukela pachibhombu, unjendila Falao, umpwaghilaje: Lendenu nde leapwagha Bambo Chapanga wa Bhaebulania, ‘Ubhalekakyaje bhandu bhangu bhabhokaje, nahuli bhakanyojabyaje. <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" />Maghambu chikahi chenjenu ananetaje malapuliku ghangu ghaghabhili na makili kwaku, bhatumika bhaku na bhandu bhaku, nahuli upata kumanya kubha njeta jongi joabhi ngati nepani mu ndema wokapi. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />Kwa ndandi mbaka sajenu nakabya nhatambwili chiwoku changu na kukulapula wehapa na bhandu bhaku kwa chitamu, na wehapa ukabya ujomwili kuyonangeka. <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" />Nambu nukulekiki wehapa ukubhaje wamwomi kwa ndandi jenjenu ngolongwa, nahuli mbataje kukulangiha makili ghangu na lihina langu lipata kumanyikana pundema pokapi. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Nambu wakali kulangiha ing'omu kwa bhandu bhangu, wala ngacheupala kubhaleka bhajendaje. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Lingalyaje, chilabhu chikahi ngati chenjenu ananetaje iyula ngolongwa namaa ja maganga ambaju ngachejilabhalili kutonya mu inchi ja Misili, kutumbula lichobha pajakabhombakiki mbaka lalenu. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />Bhela laghalakyaje hinyama yaku na chokapi chechibhili ku mighonda hoku ibhekakikaje mkati, kwa ndandi iyula ja maganga anajuntonyila kila mundu na kila chinyama chechibhili mu mighonda na yangakubha kunyumba, nayombi anaikuwaje.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Bhatumika bhaka Falao ambabhu bhakabhi bhajoghopa chela cheakalongili Bambo Chapanga, bhakatendiki manyata kubhakelabhuha bhatumwa bhabhu na hinyamya yabhu mkati. <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />Nambu bhala bhabhakabhi bhalikana lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga bhakabhalekiki bhatumwa bhabhu na hinyama yabhu kumighonda.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Uhatambulaje chiwoku chaku kunani, nahuli iyula ja maganga jitonyaje panani ja inchi jokapi ja Misili, jabhatonyilaje bhandu, hinyama na panani ja kila chindu chechimela mu mighonda ja Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" />Bhela, Musa paakahatambwili chiwoku chaki chechakabhili na ndonga chela kunani, Bambo Chapanga akaletiki kulundamila na iyula ja maganga, unang'anu wa chitobhi ukamuliki mbaka pa inchi. Henu Bambo Chapanga akajitendiki iyula ja maganga kutonya panani ja inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />Bhela kukabhili na iyula ngolongwa ja maganga jejahangaghini na unang'anu wa itobhi pandu pokapi. Kukabhili na mbelu wa kujoghoha namaa ambau ngacheulabhalili kupitalila mu inchi ja Misili, kutumbu inchi heji pajakabhi litaifa. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Iyula ja maganga heji jakayoningi kila chindu mu inchi ja Misili chechikabhili ku mighonda, bhandu na hinyama, jakayoningi kila chindu chechimela mu mighonda na kuheketa kila nkongu wa mungonda. <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" />Mu muchi wa ku Gosheni kanjika jaki pela, kobhakabhi bhatama Bhaizilaeli, iyula ja maganga heji ngachejatonyike.<verse eid="EXO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />Bhela, Falao akalaghalakili Musa na Haluni bhalowakikaje, na kubhapwaghila, “Sajenu nepani ndendiki mahoku. Bambo Chapanga atendiki ngati mokupalakila, nepani na bhandu bhangu tuhokihe. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" />Mundobhaje Bambo Chapanga, kwa ndandi kulundamila hoku na iyula jenu ja maganga ipetalile. Nepani ananundekakyaje mbokaje, wala ngamwitami kabhete nakanope.”<verse eid="EXO 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" />Musa akayangike, “Chikahi pela panikubha mbitiki kunja ja muchi, ananhatambulaje mabhoku ghangu kunani kundobha Bambo Chapanga. Kulundamila anakujomukaje, wala ngapikubhi na iyula ja maganga kabhete, nahuli upata kumanya kubha ndema ghongoni nde waka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" />Nambu manyi kubha wehapa na bhatumika bhaku, mwakona ngachemunjoghopa Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />Mimea jejitumika kulenganakela ingobhu na mahunu gha shayili yakayonangike, kwa kubha shayili yakabhili na mapukutu, na mimea ja kulenganakela ingobhu heji jakabhi jipihiki malobha. <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />Nambu inganu na ntundu ghongi ghoulengana na inganu ngacheyayonangike, maghambu yakabhi yakali ngacheikolike.<verse eid="EXO 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Panihapa Musa akabhokiki kwaka Falao na kujenda kunja ja muchi. Musa akahatambwili mabhoku ghaki kunani kundobha Bambo Chapanga. Kulundamila na iyula ja maganga yakatumbile, wala iyula ngachejajendalili kutonya pa inchi kabhete. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />Nambu Falao paakaweni kubha iyula, na iyula ja maganga, na kulundamila kujomwiki, akakelabhukili kuhenga mahoku kabhete. Jombi na bhatumika bhaki bhakajendalili kubha na mitima ja kunonopa. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Bhela, mtima waka Falao ukabhili wa kunonopa, najombi ngacheabhalekiki Bhaizilaeli bhajendaje, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakalongulili kupwagha kupetela Musa.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s">Lilapuliku la nane: Nzige</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ujendaje kwaka Falao, kwa kubha nepani nutendiki mtima waki kubha wa kunonopa na mitima ja bhatumika bhaki nahuli nepani mbataje kutenda nginyulila yenjenu pachilanda jabhu, <verse eid="EXO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2" />nahuli upata kubhalandila bhana bhaku na bhachokolu bhaku ntundu monakabhatendili Bhamisili kwa ukali na ntundu mondendili nginyulila yangu pachilanda jabhu, na mwehapa mpata kumanya kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" />Bhela, Musa na Haluni bhakapiti kwaka Falao, na kumpwaghila, “Lendenu nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Bhaebulania, leapwagha, ‘Anaujendalyaje kukana kuliheleha palongi jangu mbaka lile? Ubhalekaje bhandu bhangu bhajendaje, nahuli bhapata kunyojabhela. <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" />Ngati anaukana kubhalekakela bhandu bhangu bhajendaje, lingalyaje, chilabhu ananetaje nzige mu inchi jaku. <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" />Inchi jokapi ja Misili anajiyekaliwaje na nzige yeniheyi. Anaikula kila chindu chechihighalili pajakajomwiki iyula ja maganga, kabheti ngabhachileki chokapi panani ja mikongu jokapi jejimela mu mighonda. <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />Nzige yeniheyi anaitwelalaje mu nyumba jaku, mu nyumba ya bhatumika bhaku na nyumba ya Bhamisili bhokapi. Anaikubhaje yamaheli, hata bhazee bhinu ngachebhalabhalili kuibhona kutumbu pabhabhelakiki, mbaka lalenu.’ ” Panihapa Musa akabhokiki kwaka Falao.<verse eid="EXO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />Bhatumika bhaka Falao bhakundalukile, “Bho, mundu ajoju anaatung'ahaje mbaka lile? Ubhalekaje bhandu abhabha bhajendaje, nahuli bhakunjojabyaje Bambo Chapanga wabhu. Bho, ukona ngacheumanyi kubha Misili jiyonangike?”<verse eid="EXO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Panihapa Musa na Haluni bhakalowakiki kabhete kwaka Falao. Falao akabhapwaghile, “Njendaje, mukunjojabyaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu. Nambu mbwaghilaje nde akanane bhabhijendaje papamu na mwehapa?”<verse eid="EXO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" />Musa akayangike, “Anatujendaje na akakombu bhitu, na bhazee, papamu na bhana bhitu na akakamwali bhitu, kabheti papamu na mambeleli ghitu, ng'ombi, na imbuhi, kwa ndandi itupalika kuntendela Bambo Chapanga uwangalalu.”<verse eid="EXO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Falao akapwaghike, “Bambo Chapanga akubha papamu na mwehapa, ngati ananunjetakili mwehapa njendaje papamu na akabhahanu bhinu na bhana bhinu, ndingalyaje, chakaka mbili na maholalelu mahakau mu mitima jino. <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Ngabhela! Akanalomi kanjika jabhu bhajendaje, bhakunjojabyaje Bambo Chapanga, maghambu leniheli nde lendobhikaje.” Panihapa Musa na Haluni bhakabhengakiki palongi jaka Falao.<verse eid="EXO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Hatambulaje chiwoku chaku kunani ja inchi ja ku Misili nahuli libhongelu la nzige liwezaje kujingila panani ja inchi, nahuli ikulaje kila mmea ghoumela mu mighonda, na kila chindu chechikahighalili kubhokana na iyula ja maganga jela.” <verse eid="EXO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Panihapa Musa akahatambwili chiwoku chaki chechikabhili na ndonga chela panani ja inchi ja ku Misili, Bambo Chapanga akaletiki mpongu kuhuma kolipita lyobha ukapuliki mu inchi jokapi muhi jokapi na ikilu jokapi, pakwahikiki lukela mpongu ukaletiki nzige. <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />Nzige yeniheyi yakajaghanili kila pandu mu inchi ja ku Misili, yakabhili yamaheli namaa, na ngacheilabhalili kupitalila nzige ngati yeniheyi mu chikahi chokapi chela, wala ngalikubhi kabheti ng'o. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" />Nzige yeniheyi yakayekalili inchi jokapi ja Misili, mbaka inchi jakabhonakini kubha lwihi. Yakakuliki kila chindu chechikabhili chihighalili kubhokana na iyula ja maganga jela, kila chindu chechikabhili mu mighonda, papamu na mapambiku gha mu mikongu. Njeta lihamba hata limu lelakahighalili mu inchi. Njeta lihamba lokapi lela lelahighalili panani ja mikongu wala mimea mu inchi ja Misili.<verse eid="EXO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />Falao akabhalohiki manyata Musa na Haluni, na kubhapwaghila, “Nuntendili mahoku Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, na kwinu mwehapa bhelabhela. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" />Bhela nundobha, mnekakyaje mahoku ghangu kwa mala jenjenu kabhete, na mundobhaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, abhohaje lilapuliku lendenu lihakau kwangu nepane.” <verse eid="EXO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />Panihapa Musa akabhokiki kwaka Falao, na kundobha Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" />Najombi Bambo Chapanga akaung'anambwili mpongu ukolongwa ghoukapuliki kuhuma kolijibhi lyobha, ghoubhili na makili ghamaheli, mpongu hoghu ukabhohiki nzige yela na kuipeleka mu Bahali ja Shamu. Njeta nzige hata jimu jejakahighalili pokapi mu inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="EXO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga akautendiki mtima waka Falao kubha wa kunonopa, najombi ngacheakabhalekiki Bhaizilaeli bhabhokaje.<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilapuliku la tisa: Lwihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghili Musa, “Hatambulaje chibhoku chaku kunani nahuli lwihi lukolongwa lujaghanyaje mu inchi ja Misili, bhandu bhapapi papihaje mu lwihi.” <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Bhela Musa akahatambwili chiwoku chaki kunani, panihapa kukabhili na lwihi lukolongwa mu inchi jokapi ja Misili kwa machobha ghatatu. <verse eid="EXO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />Njeta mundu jokapi joakaweziki kumbona njaki, wala kubhoka pandu paakabhili kwa machobha ghatatu. Nambu Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhakabhili na unang'anu pandu pabhakabhi bhatama.<verse eid="EXO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" />Panihapa Falao akundohiki Musa na kupwagha, “Njendanyaje, mukunjojabyaje Bambo Chapanga. Akambomba na bhana bhinu muweza kujenda papamu nabhu, nambu mambeleli ghinu, imbuhi hinu, na ng'ombi hinu muilekaje.”<verse eid="EXO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Nambu Musa akumpwaghile, “Itupalika utulekakyaje tukubha na nhupu, na hinyama ya nyambiku ja kujochakeka ja kubhoha palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu. <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />Tepani itupalika tubhokaje na hinyama hitu yokapi, wala njeta chinyama hata chimu chechihighalyaje. Maghambu itupalika kutumila hinyama yeniheyi mu kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, kwa kubha mbaka patwihikaje konihoku ngachetumanyi kubha nde hinyama bholi yeanatutumilaje nahuli kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga akautendiki mtima waka Falao kubha wa kunonopa, ngacheakapaliki kubhalekakela Bhaizilaeli bhabhokaje. <verse eid="EXO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Falao akumpwaghi Musa, “Ubhokaje palongi jangu! Ulilingalyaje, ngawihika palongi jangu kabhete! Maghambu lichobha pawihikaje kabhete palongi jangu, anaukuwaje!”<verse eid="EXO 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" />Musa akayangike, “Ulongi wichu! Nepani nganapabhoni kabhete pamihu jako.”<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s">Lilapuliku la komi: Kukomakeka kwa bhabhelakeka bha kutumbula bha bhandu na hinyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ananeta lilapuliku limu nakanope lenanundetila Falao na bhandu bha inchi ja Misili. Analijomwiki leniheli, anaandeka mbokaje pambane. Kabhete anaanjetakile mbokaje, anaambengaje mbokaje mu inchi jaki kabisa. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" />Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli bhabhalobhaje Bhamisili bhabhatama pambipi jabhu hindu ya madini gha feza na hindu ya zahabu.” <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" />Bambo Chapanga akabhatendiki Bhamisili bhakubhaje na mtima wa kubhajangatila Bhaizilaeli, najombi Musa akabhi mundu wa kutopela namaa mu inchi ja Misili, kwa bhatumika bhaka Falao na bhandu bhaki bhokapi.<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Musa akumpwaghi Falao, “Bambo Chapanga apwagha anana, ‘Pakwihika ikilu pamahiku nepani anambetaje pachilanda ja inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />Panipetaje kila mbelakeka wa kutumbula mu inchi ja Misili anapotilaje, mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa chikambaku waku wehapa wa Falao, joatama pachiteu cha kikolongwa, mbaka mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa chikambaku waka mtumwa waku wa chimbomba, joayagha chilebhi kwa liganga, papamu na kila mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa hinyama. <verse eid="EXO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />Anakukubhaje na chilelu chikolongwa namaa mu inchi jokapi ja Misili, chilelu chenihechi ngachechilabhali kupitalila, wala ngachipitalile kabhete ng'o. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" />Nambu pachilanda ja bhandu bha Bhaizilaeli, njeta hata nakawa jejibumaje kwaka mundu wala chinyama chokapi. Panihapa nde pamwimanyaje kubha Bambo Chapanga abhekiki ulekanganu pachilanda ja Bhamisili na Bhaizilaeli.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />Musa akajomulili kwa kumpwaghila Falao, “Bhatumika bhaku bhokapi anabhanhikilaje, na kunjikamila palongi jangu, bhakapwaghaje, ‘Ubhokaje, wehapa papamu na bhandu bhaku bhokapi bhabhukujengalela!’ Paghijomukaje ghanihagha anamokaje.” Panihapa Musa, koni akabhya na inyela namaa, akabhokiki kwaka Falao.<verse eid="EXO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Falao anaajendalyaje kukana kukujowanela, nahuli ngangachu jangu jipata kujonjukeka mu inchi ja Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Musa na Haluni bhakatendiki ngangachu yokapi heyi palongi jaka Falao, nambu Bambo Chapanga akautendiki mtima waka Falao kubha wa kunonopa, akakaniki kubhaleka Bhaizilaeli bhabhokaje mu inchi jaki.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="s">Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa na Haluni, pabhakabhili bhakona ku inchi ja Misili, <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" />“Mwehi ghongoni anaukubhaje mwehi wa kutumbula wa chaka kwinu mwehapa. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />Ubhapwaghila bhandu bhokapi bha ku Izilaeli kubha mu lichobha la komi la mwehi ghoni, kila mundu anaatolaje mwanalimbeleli limu kwa ndandi ja nyumba jaki, limu kwa kila nyumba. <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />Anakubhili nyumba jokapi jibhili na bhandu bhachokopi bhangakuweza kujomola mwanalimbeleli nhilima hoju, wehapa papamu na bhandu bha nyumba ja pambipi muhaghulaje mwanalimbeleli jumu, kwa ubhalangiku wa bhandu bhabhabhi monihomu. Panihapa anammanyaji kubha ipalika inyama jamaheli au inyama jichokopi kubhokana na kupala kwaka kila mundu. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" />Hinyama yemwihaghulaje, ipalika ikubhaje ya chikambaku na ya chaka chimu, na yangakubha na chilema, muweza kuhaghula kuhuma mu mambeleli au imbuhi. <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />Nanamu ngohaje chinyama hechi mbaka mu lichobha la komi na nchechi la mwehi ghoni, lichobha heli, bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli anabhachinjaje chinyama hechi chikahi cha pakamihe. <verse eid="EXO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" />Panihapa bhitolaje mwahi wakumu na kuupaka mu ngelakete ya munani ya ndyangu, na ngelakete ibheli ya milyangu ja kila nyumba mobhikulaje hinyama heji. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" />Ikilu jelajela anabhakula inyama jejijochakiki pamotu, papamu na mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila, na likolu libhabha la mahamba. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />Ngamwikula inyama jibhehi wala ja kututuha, nambu jikubhaje jijochakiki pamoto, papamu na mmutu, magholu na inyama yaki ya mkati. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" />Ngamwihighakila inyama jokapi mbaka lukela, inyama jejihighalyaji mbaka lukela, mjijochaje pamoto. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Kabheti mwikulaje anana: Mwalikongaje mihunga mu ibhunu hinu, mwiwataje magubase mu magholu ghino, na mwikamulaje ndonga hinu mumabhoku ghino. Mkulaje manyata, jenjenu nde Pasaka jaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" />“Ikilu jejeji anambetaje mu inchi jokapi ja Misili na kunkoma kila mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa Bhamisili, waka mundu na wa hinyama, nanatu ananitemulaje ichapanga yokapi ya Misili. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" />Mwahi anaukubha nginyulila kwa ndandi jinu ja kulangiha nyumba yemwikubhaje. Nanatu panaubhonaje mwahi ghonihoghu, anambetaje panani jinu. Njeta lilapuliku la uyonangeku leanalumpataje mwenga panajilapulaje inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="EXO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />Lichobha lendenu analikubhaje ukombukelu kwinu, na mwehapa anamujitendaje kubha uwangalalu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, mu hibheleku hinu jokapi. Anamjikamulaje kubha amuli ja mileli.”<verse eid="EXO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwangalalu wa mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" />Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Kwa machobha saba, anamkulaje mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila. Lichobha la kutumbula pa machobha saba hagha, mwibhohaje amila yeibhili mu nyumba hinu, maghambu mundu jokapi anaakuliki libumunda lelijeghaliki amila mu chikahi cha machobha saba hagha, anaipalikaje kuntopola kutali kuhuma pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli bhokapi jumula. <verse eid="EXO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />Lichobha la kutumbula mkubhaje na uhimanganu uhuhu, na uhimanganu uhuhu ghongi mu lichobha la saba. Mu machobha ghanihagha ngamwitenda lihengu lokapi lela, nambu pela kuteleka chilebhe chaka kila jumu, leniheli pela nde leanamulihengaje. <verse eid="EXO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" />Anamuhekalyaje uwangalalu ghoni wa mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila ngati ukombukelu wa lichobha panakumbohiki mwehapa, mabhongelu gha Bhaizilaeli, kuhuma ku Misili. Bhela mwalitunzaje lichobha leniheli kwa ibheleku yinu yokapi yeihika, kubha amuli ja mileli. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />Bhela anamkulaje mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila kutumbu pakamihi ja lichobha la komi na nchechi la mwehi wa kutumbula, mbaka pakamihi ja lichobha la ishilini na jimu ja mwehi gholaghola wa kutumbula. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" />Kwa chikahi cha machobha saba, ngamwikubha na amila jokapi mu nyumba hinu. Mundu jokapi, akubhi ngeni au mwenehi, anakuliki chindu chechijeghaliki amila, anaatopuliwaje kutali na bhandu bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />Ngamwikula chindu chokapi chechijeghaliki amila. Pokapi pamwitamaje, impalika kula mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila.”<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pasaka ja kutumbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />Bhela, Musa akabhalohiki bhazee bhokapi bha Izilaeli na kubhapwaghila, “Njendanyaje mkahaghulaje bhanambeleli na kuchinja kwa ndandi ja nyumba hinu, mkachinjaje na kula mu lichobha la Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />Mtolaje mmea wa hisopu, njwihaje mu mwahi ghoubhili mu bakuli na kupaka mwahi hoghu mu ngelakete ya munani na ngelakete ibheli ya munkeghi ja milyangu ja nyumba hino. Mundu jokapi ngayipita kunja ja ndyangu wa nyumba jaki ikilu jeniheji mbaka lukela. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" />Kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga payipetaje na kubhalapula Bhamisili, anaabhonaje mwahi mu ngelakete ya munani ja ndyangu, na ngelakete ibheli ya milyangu, Bambo Chapanga anaapetaje panani, wala ngaandeki myonanga kujingila mu nyumba hinu na kunkoma mwehapa. <verse eid="EXO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />Mkamulaje malaghalakilu ghangani mwehapa na bhana bhinu ngati amuli ja mileli. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />Pamwijingalaje mu inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga anaampekyaje, ngati moakalaghile, njendalyaje kukamula ntetu ghonihoghu. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" />Bhana bhinu pabhandalukyaje, ‘Uwangalalu aghoghu ubhili na ndandi kike kwino?’ <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />Mwehapa mwapwaghilaje, ‘Jenjenu nde nyambiku ja Pasaka kwaka Bambo Chapanga, kwa ndandi akaipetiki panani nyumba ya Bhaizilaeli ku inchi ja ku Misili hoku chikahi paakabhakomiki Bhamisili, nambu tepani ngacheatukomike.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 12:27">Panihapa bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakachikimi na kunjojabhela Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki ngati bhela Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakili Musa na Haluni.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomakeka kwa bhabhelakeka bha kutumbula bha Bhamisili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />Pakwahikiki ikilu pamahiku, Bambo Chapanga akabhakomiki bhabhelakeka bha chikambaku bha kutumbula bhokapi bha ku Misili. Bhokapi bhakapotile, kutumbu mbelakeka wa chikambaku wa kutumbula waka Falao, mpwelelu wa ukolongwa, mbaka mbelakeka wa chikambaku waka mundu joakongakiki mu nyumba ja bhakongeka, na bhabhelakeka bha chikambaku bha kutumbula bhokapi bha hinyama. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" />Falao, na bhatumika bhaki bhokapi, na Bhamisili bhokapi bhakajumwiki ikilu, na kukabhili na chilelu chikolongwa namaa mu inchi ja ku Misili, maghambu ngachekwabhili na nyumba hata jimu mwangakupotela mundu. <verse eid="EXO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Ikilu jelajela Falao akabhalohiki Musa na Haluni na kubhapwaghila, “Njumukanyaje! Mbokanyaje pachilanda ja bhandu bhangu. Njendanyaje, mwehapa papamu na Bhaizilaeli abhabha, mukunjojabyaje Bambo Chapanga ngati mondobhile. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Mtolanyaje mabhongelu ghinu gha mambeleli na imbuhi papamu na ng'ombi, na mbokanyaje ngati mondobhile, bhelabhela mkanobhilaje mbengalelu na nepane.”<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />Bhamisili bhakabhatopwili Bhaizilaeli bhabhokaje manyata na kujileka inchi jabhu. Bhakapwaghaje, “Ngati ngamboki, chakaka anatupotilaje!” <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Henu, Bhaizilaeli bhakautoliki uhembi wabhu ghobhuhunyiki mangani ja kuujeghela amila, na mabakuli ghabhu gha kuhunyila na kughakonga chibwahila kwa ingobhu na kughatotola mu mabhegha. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki ngati Musa moakalaghalakile, nabhombi bhakabhalobhiki Bhamisili bhabhapekyaje hindu yeilenganakiki kwa madini gha feza, zahabu na ingobho. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" />Bambo Chapanga akabhatendiki Bhaizilaeli bhapalakakaje na Bhamisili, nabhombi Bhamisili bhakabhapekihi kila chindu chebhakalobhiki. Bhenibhela nde Bhaizilaeli mobhanyaghulile Bhamisili hindu jabhu.<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhabhoka ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki mwanja kuhuma ku Lamesesi mbaka ku Sukoti. Bhakabhili bhakambaku ngati laki sita bhabhajenda kwa magholu panga na ubhalangiku wa akambomba na bhana. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Bhandu bhangi bhamaheli bhakabhili papamu nabhu. Bhelabhela Bhaizilaeli bhakabhokiki koni bhakabyaje papamu na mabhongelu ghabhu makolongwa gha mambeleli, imbuhi na ng'ombi. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" />Bhakalenganakili mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila kwa uhembi ghola ghowahunyakiki ghobhutoliki ku Misili. Uhembi hoghu ghowahunyakike ngachewajeghaliki amili, maghambu bhakabhohakiki ku Misili kwa manyata, nabhombi ngachebhabhili na chikahi cha kulenganakela chilebhi cha kula mwindela.<verse eid="EXO 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakabhili bhatemi ku Misili kwa chikahi cha hyaka mia nchechi na selasini. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />Payajomwiki hyaka heyi mia nchechi na selasini, makabila ghokapi ghaka Bambo Chapanga ghakabhokiki ku inchi ja ku Misili. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />Ikilu jeniheji Bambo Chapanga akabhili abhalingalila Bhaizilaeli nahuli abhabhohaje kuhuma mu inchi ja Misili, mu ikilu heji Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhapalika kuhekalela kwa kuchelukila ikilu jokapi nahuli kuntopela Bambo Chapanga mu hibheleku yabhu yokapi yeihika.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghaghapalika kuhengakeka mu uwangalalu wa Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />Bambo akumpwaghi Musa na Haluni, “Ghongoni nde ntetu kwa ndandi ja Pasaka: Ngeni ngacheapalika kula Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />Nambu ntumwa jokapi joahemaliki kwa madini gha feza, aweza kula Pasaka ngati anabhi ahekiti jando. <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" />Ngeni jokapi joatama kwinu, au mtumika jomundepiki kuhenga lihengu, ngacheapalika kula Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" />Inyama jokapi jipalika mkulaje mkati ja nyumba, ngamwitola inyama na kupiha kunja ja nyumba heji, na ngamwitunyula chihupa chokapi chela cha chinyama hechi. <verse eid="EXO 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />Bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli ibhapalika bhahekalyaje uwangalalu hoghu. <verse eid="EXO 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />Ngati ngeni jokapi joatama pachilanda jinu anaapala kuhekalela uwangalalu wa Pasaka, ipalika hoti akanalomi bhokapi bha mu nyumba jaki bhachekulaje jando, panihapa anabhalangikaje kubha ngati mwenehi na kupalika kuhekalela Pasaka. Mwanalomi jokapi jwangakuchekula jando ngayikula chilebhi cha uwangalalu wa Pasaka ng'o. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" />Ntetu ghongoni anauhengaje lihengu kwaka mwenehi Muizilaeli, na bhagheni bhabhitamaje papamu na mwenga.” <verse eid="EXO 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhakatendiki bhenibhela, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakile Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" />Lichobha lelalela Bambo Chapanga akabhabhohiki Bhaizilaeli mu inchi ja ku Misili kulengana na makabila ghabhu.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s">Kubhekakeka palongi jaka Chapanga kwa bhabhelakeka bha kutumbula bha chikambaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" />“Mmekilaje wichu kila mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa chikambaku. Maghambu bhabhelakeka bhokapi bha kutumbula bha chikambaku bha Izilaeli na kila mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa chikambaku wa hinyama, bhokapi habha nde bhangu.”<verse eid="EXO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwangalalu wa mabumunda ghangakubhekakeka amila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Musa akabhapwaghi bhandu, “Mlikombukaje lichobha lenu, lichobha lemwabhokiki mu inchi ja ku Misili, mu inchi ja utumwa, kwa ndandi Bambo Chapanga akumbohiki monihomu kwa chibhoku chaki chechibhi na makili. Ngamwikula libumunda lelijeghaliki amila mu lichobha lendenu. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" />Lalenu mwehi wa kutumbula ghoulowakeka Abibu, anambokaje mu inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" />Bambo Chapanga panaandetaje mu inchi jebhatama Bhakanaani, Bhahiti, Bhaamoli, Bhahivi, na Bhayebusi, inchi jeakabhalapile akahokolu bhinu kubha anaampekya mwehapa, inchi jejitwelile mahibha na busi, ikupalika kuhekalela uwangalalu hoghu kila chaka mu mwehi ghoni wa kutumbula. <verse eid="EXO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />Anamkulaje mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila kwa chikahi cha machobha saba, na mu lichobha la saba nde uwangalalu wa kuntopela Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Kwa chikahi cha machobha saba anamkulaje mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila, ngakwikubha na mabumunda ghaghajeghaliki amila, wala amila ngajibhonikana pachilanda jinu na mu inchi jinu jokapi. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Lichobha heli wampwaghila mwana waku, ‘Ndenda anana kwa ndandi ja kukomboka lijambu leakanhengile Bambo Chapanga lichobha panabhokaje kuhuma ku inchi ja ku Misili.’ <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" />Uwangalalu ghoni anaukubhaje ngati nginyulila mu chiwoku chaku na ukombukelu pa chibhongi ja pamihu jaku, nahuli ukombukaje shelia jaka Bambo Chapanga. Kwa ndandi Bambo Chapanga akakubhohiki mu inchi ja ku Misili kwa chibhoku chaki chechibhili na makili. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />Henu impalika kuhekalela uwangalalu ghoni kwa chikahi chechibhekakiki, kila chaka.”<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhabhelakeka bha kutumbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />Musa akajendalili kubhapwaghila, “Bambo Chapanga paanaandetaje mu inchi ja Kanaani na kumpekeha inchi jeniheji, ngati moakalapile kwinu mwehapa na kwa akahokolu bhinu, <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />impalika kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga kila mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa chikambaku. Kila mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa chikambaku waka kila mundu na hinyama hinu, bhokapi habha anabhakubhaje bhaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Nambu kila mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa liponda likambaku anaulikombulaje kwa kumbokeha Chapanga mwanalimbeleli, ngati ngacheunkombwili, unkomaje kwa kuntunyula hingu jaki. Kila mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa chikambaku pachilanda ja bhana bhaku ikupalika unkombulaje. <verse eid="EXO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />Machobha ghaghahika, mwana waku ngati anaakulalukili, ‘Lijambu heli ndandi jaki kike?’ Umpwaghilaje, ‘Kwa chiwoku chaki chechibhili na makili chaka Bambo Chapanga akatubhohiki mu inchi ja ku Misili, kuhuma mu inchi jetukabhili bhatumwa. <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />Falao kwa kunonopa mtima waki akakaniki kutulekakela tubhokaje, henu Bambo Chapanga akunkomiki kila mbelakeka wa chikambaku wa kutumbula wa Bhamisili, mundu na hinyama. Jenjenu nde ndandi ja kubhoha nyambiku kwaka Bambo Chapanga mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa chikambaku, wa hinyama yangu, na kunkombola kila mbelakeka wangu wa kutumbula wa chikambaku.’ <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />Lijambu lendenu analikubhaje ngati nginyulila mu mabhoku ghinu na ngati alama pa ibhongi ya pamihu jinu, kubha Bambo Chapanga akatubhohiki ku inchi ja Misili kwa chibhoku chaki chechibhili na makili.”<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguzu ja lihundi na nguzu ja moto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />Chikahi Falao paakabhalekakili Bhaizilaeli bhabhokaje, Chapanga ngacheabhalongwihi kupetela indela jejipeta mu inchi ja Bhafilisti, papamu na kubha indela heji jakabhi jijipi namaa. Kwa ndandi Chapanga akapwaghiki, “Anabhahimangini na bhandu na kukomana ngondo, bhaweza kung'anambula maholalelu ghabhu na kukelabhuka ku Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Panihapa Chapanga akabhalongwihi Bhaizilaeli kupetela indela ja kuyongolota kupetela mbaka kulipololu, kujenda ku Bahali ja Shamu. Bhaizilaeli bhakabhokiki ku inchi ja ku Misili koni bhakabya bhalibhekiki wichu kwa ngondo.<verse eid="EXO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" />Musa akatoliki ihupa yaka Yusufu, ngati Yusufu moakabhalapishe bhana bhaka Izilaeli mangane ja kupotela. Akapwaghaje, “Chakaka Chapanga anahikaje kunjangatila, nanamu anaimpalika kutola ihupa yangu kuhuma pambani na kuipeleka konihoko.”<verse eid="EXO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakabhokiki ku Sukoti, bhakapomulili ku Etamu, munkeghi ja chingwenje. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" />Chikahi cha muhi Bambo Chapanga akabhalongulili kwa nguzu ja lihundi kubhalongoha mu indela jabhu, na chikahi cha ikilu akabhalongulili kwa nguzu ja moto kubhamulakila, nahuli bhatendaje mwanja muhi na ikilu. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />Nguzu ja lihundi jela ngachejabhokiki pandu paki chikahi cha muhi, na nguzu jela ja moto ngachejabhokiki pandu paki chikahi cha ikilu, machobha ghokapi Bhaizilaeli bhakalonguhiki kwa nguzu heyi.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhalomboka Bahali ja Shamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />“Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli bhakelabhukaje kunyuma na bhapomulyaje pambipi na Pi Hahiloti, pachilanda ja Migidoli na Bahali ja Shamu. Anabhapomulyaje munkeghi ja bahali, pambipi na Baali Sefoni. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" />Falao anaapwaghaje, ‘Bhaizilaeli habha bhapotokapotoka mu inchi na chingwenje chabhahibhalakila ngabhiweza kulomboka.’ <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" />Panihapa nepani ananiutendaje mtima waka Falao kubha wa kunonopa, najombi anaanjengalyaje mwehapa. Nanatu anambataje utopelu kwa kunkoma Falao, papamu na manjolinjoli ghaki. Nabhombi Bhamisili anabhamanyaje kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.” Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki ngati mobhapwaghakike.<verse eid="EXO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Falao, nkolongwa wa ku Misili, paakajowini kubha Bhaizilaeli bhatilike, jombi na bhatumika bhaki bhakang'anambwili maholalelu ghabhu, bhakapwaghaje, “Tuhengiki kiki? Tubhalekakili Bhaizilaeli bhajenda panga kutuhengela lihengu kabheti!” <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Henu Falao akalibhekiki wichu ligali laki la ngondo, lelihutakika na falasi, na akapiti papamu na manjolinjoli ghaki. <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" />Akatoliki magali ghaki manyahi gha ngondo mia sita na magali ghangi ghokapi gha ngondo gha Bhamisili, ghakalonguhiwi na bhakolongwa bha manjolinjoli. <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" />Bambo Chapanga akautendiki mtima waka Falao, nkolongwa wa ku Misili kubha wa kunonopa namaa, najombi akabhajengalili Bhaizilaeli, maghambu Bhaizilaeli bhakabhokiki ku Misili kwa kukangamala. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" />Bhamisili papamu na falasi yabhu yokapi, magali gha falasi gha ngondo na bhabhakabhili bhakweliki panani ja falasi bhakabhajengalili Bhaizilaeli, bhakabhahimanili bhapomulili punkeghi ja Bahali ja Shamu, pambipi na Pi Hahiloti, palongi ja Baali Sefoni.<verse eid="EXO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />Falao paakaheghalili, Bhaizilaeli bhakabhaweni Bhamisili bhahika kunyuma jabho, bhakatengalamwiki namaa, na Bhaizilaeli bhakundelili Bambo Chapanga nahuli abhajangatyaje. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" />Bhakumpwaghi Musa, “Bho, ngachekukabhili na matengeli gha kuyaghanila ku inchi ja ku Misili mbaka utuletaje tuwelilaje kuchingwenji kone? Maghambu kiki ututendili bhenibhela kwa kutubhoha ku inchi ja ku Misili? <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Ngachetukupwaghili patukabhili ku Misili hoku, utulekaje kanjika jitu tubhatumakyaje Bhamisili? Ikabya mbanga nakanopi kwitu tepani kubhatumakila Bhamisili kuliku kuwelela kuchingwenji koni!”<verse eid="EXO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" />Musa akabhayangiki Bhaizilaeli, “Ngamwijoghopa! Njemaje kwa kukangamala, lalenu anambonaje ntundu Bambo Chapanga moankengalela. Bhamisili abhabha bhamubhabhona lalenu, ngamwabhoni kabheti ng'o. <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" />Bambo Chapanga anaankomanyaje mwehapa, nanamu mtamaje chinunu.”<verse eid="EXO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Maghambu kiki unelela? Ubhapwaghilaje Bhaizilaeli bhajendalyaje na mwanja wabhu. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />Jukuhaje ndonga jaku na uhatambulaje chiwoku chaku chechibhili na ndonga panani ja bahali. Machi anaghaghabhanikaje na Bhaizilaeli anabhawezaje kulomboka pachilanda ja bahali pandu pajomu. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" />Nepani ananijitenda mitima ja Bhamisili kubha ja kunonopa, nabhombi anabhunjengalyaje pachilanda ja bahali, nanatu ananilipatilaje ulumbalilu kubhokana na kuyonangeka kwaka Falao na manjolinjoli ghaki, magali ghaki gha ngondo papamu na bhabhatami panani ja falasi ya ngondo. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />Nabhombi Bhamisili anabhamanyaje kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga panalipatilaje utopelu kwa kunkoma Falao, magali ghaki gha ngondo papamu na bhabhatami panani ja falasi ya ngondo.”<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Bhela mtumika wa kunani bhaka Chapanga, joakabhili palongi ja lipogha la Bhaizilaeli akabhokiki na kutama kunyuma jabhu. Na nguzu ja lihundi jela jakabhokiki palongi jabhu na kujema kunyuma jabhu. <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />Nguzu heji jakatemi pachilanda ja Bhamisili na Bhaizilaeli. Lihundi lela lakabhayekiki Bhamisili lwihi, nambu lakabhamulakili Bhaizilaeli ikilu. Bhela mabhongelu ghabheli hagha, manjolinjoli ghaka Falao na libhongelu la Bhaizilaeli, ngacheghaheghalanili ikilu jokapi.<verse eid="EXO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />Musa akahatambwili chiwoku chaki panani ja bahali, najombi Bambo Chapanga akaghakangiki machi gha bahali kunyuma kwa mpongu ukali wa kolipita lyobha. Mpongu hoghu ukapuliki ikilu jokapi, ukaghabhiki machi gha bahali ipambala ibheli na pachilanda pakapitalili pandu pajomu. <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" />Nabhombi Bhaizilaeli bhakapetiki pachilanda ja bahali pandu pajomu, machi ghakajemiki ngati lumatu upambala wa kumalelelu na upambala wa kumangeja. <verse eid="EXO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Bhamisili bhakabhajengalili mkati ja bahali kupetela pandu pajomu, papamu na falasi yokapi yaka Falao, magali gha ngondo na bhabhatami panani ja falasi ya ngondo. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Pambipi na pachibhombu, Bambo Chapanga akaghalingalili manjolinjoli gha Bhamisili kuhuma mu nguzu ja moto jela na nguzu ja lihundi lela, na kughajeghela choghoi chikolongwa manjolinjoli gha Bhamisili. <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />Chapanga akaghatendiki maguludumu gha magali ghabhu ghapatilaje, magali ghabhu ghakabhi ghajenda mbolimboli. Bhela Bhamisili bhakapwaghike, “Tutilaje na kutama kutali na Bhaizilaeli. Maghambu Bambo Chapanga atenda kubhajangatila kukomana na tepane.”<verse eid="EXO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akampwaghi Musa, “Hatambulaje chiwoku chaku panani ja bahali nahuli machi ghakelabhukaje kabhete na kubhayeka Bhamisili, papamu na magali ghabhu gha ngondo na bhabhatami panani ja falasi.” <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" />Bhela, Musa akahatambwili chiwoku chaki panani ja bahali, na pakukabhili kuchile machi gha bahali ghakakelawiki na kubha ngati moghabhelile pakutumbula hapa. Bhamisili bhakalengiki kughatila machi, nambu Bambo Chapanga akabhakangili mkati ja bahali. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" />Machi ghakakelawiki na kughayeka magali gha ngondo na bhabhatami panani ja falasi papamu na manjolinjoli ghokapi ghaka Falao ghaghakabhi ghabhajengalela Bhaizilaeli bhakapotili mkati ja bahali. Ngacheakalamiki Mmisili hata jumu. <verse eid="EXO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" />Nambu Bhaizilaeli bhakapetiki mu bahali pandu pajomu, na machi ghakajemiki ngati lumatu upambala wabhu wa kumalelelu na upambala wabhu wa kumangeja.<verse eid="EXO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" />Lichobha lela Bambo Chapanga akabhakengalili Bhaizilaeli kuhuma mu mabhoku gha Bhamisili, nabhombi Bhaizilaeli bhakabhaweni Bhamisili bhabhapotile mu maheku gha bahali. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli pabhakaweni makili makolongwa ghaakatendiki Bambo Chapanga kwa Bhamisili, Bhaizilaeli bhakunjowipi Bambo Chapanga na kubheka lihobhalelu labhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga, na kwaka Musa mtumika waki.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s">Lujembu lwaka Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Bhela Musa papamu na Bhaizilaeli bhakunjembili Bambo Chapanga lujembu alolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">“Ananunjembilaje Bambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">kwa kubha aweziki kwa ulumbalilu ukolongwa. Falasi na bhabhatami panani ja falasi abhakangili mu bahali.<verse eid="EXO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />Bambo Chapanga nde makili ghangu na lujembu lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">najombi abhili ukengalelu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">Jombi nde Chapanga wangu, nanatu ananundumbalyaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">jombi nde Chapanga waka tati wangu, nanatu ananundumbalyaje.<verse eid="EXO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />Bambo Chapanga nde mundu wa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:3">Bambo Chapanga nde lihina lake.”<verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />“Magali gha ngondo ghaka Falao na manjolinjoli ghaki aghajibhihi mu bahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:4">Bhatumika bhahaghulika bhaka Falao bhakajibhili mu Bahali ja Shamu.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Machi ghaghanyolike ghakabhayekike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:5">bhakajibhili kokunyolike ngati liganga mbaka pahi.”<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />“Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, chiwoku chaku cha kumalelelu, chibhili na makili gha kukangacha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:6">Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, chiwoku chaku cha kumalelelu, ukuntimbiki adui.<verse eid="EXO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />Kwa ukolongwa wa ulumbalilu waku, ubhahabhuha pahi bhala bhabhakupenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:7">Ulekakela inyela jaku jikali, na kubhayonanga ngati matotela.<verse eid="EXO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />Kwa mbomu ja imbunu jaku machi ghakalibhongini pamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">Majegha gha machi ghakajemiki wema ngati lumatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">machi ghaghabhili kokunyolike kwa bahali ghakagandike.<verse eid="EXO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />Adui akapwaghike, ‘Ananabhajengalyaje na kubhakamula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">Ananilighabhilaje mali ghabhu ngati mombalila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">Anandolaje lipanga langu na chiwoku changu anachibhayonangaje.’<verse eid="EXO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Nambu ukaletiki mpongu wako, na bahali jakabhayekalile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:10">Bhakajibhili mkati ja machi ghamaheli ngati choma chechitopike.”<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />“Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, nde nane pachilanda ja ichapanga joalengana na wenga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Nde nane joabhi ngati wehapa, wehapa nde mhuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">nde nane joaweza kutenda ngangachu na mambu makolongwa ngati wehapa?<verse eid="EXO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />Ukahatambwili chiwoku chaku cha kumalelelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:12">na inchi jakabhamiliki maadui bhitu.<verse eid="EXO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />Wehapa kwa upalu waku ukolongwa ukabhalongwihi bhandu bhaku bhaubhakombwile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:13">Kwa makili ghaku ubhalongwihi mbaka pandu pa matamu ghaku mahuhu.<verse eid="EXO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14" />Bhandu bha mataifa naghange bhakajowini ghanihagha na kubhaghaja namaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:14">Bhafilisti bhakakamuliki na choghoi chikolongwa.<verse eid="EXO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15" />Bhakolongwa bha ku Edomu anabhajoghupaje.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:15">Ihongozi bha ku Moabu anabhabhaghajaje kwa choghoi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:15">bhandu bha ku Kanaani bhahekatiki mtima.<verse eid="EXO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />Kujoghupeka na choghoi anayabhakamulaje.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">Kwa makili gha chiwoku chaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">anabhatumbalaje ngati liganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">mbaka bhandu bhaku bhajomula kupeta, wenga wa Bambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">mbaka bhandu bhanihabha bhaubhakengalile bhapetaje.<verse eid="EXO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />Wehapa anaubhapelakaje na kubhabheka bhatamaje pa chitombi cha upwelelu waku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">Pandu pala paupahawile pakubhaje matamu ghaku, wenga wa Bambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">pandu pahuhu, paupachengiki kwa mabhoku ghaku, wenga wa Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />Wehapa wa Bambo Chapanga, anautawalaje mileli na mileli.”<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lujembu lwaka Miliamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />Falasi yaka Falao, magali ghaki gha ngondo na bhabhatami panani ja falasi yaki pabhakajingili mu bahali, pandu pajomu, Bambo Chapanga akaghakelawihi machi gha bahali na ghakabhahyekike, nambu Bhaizilaeli bhakapetiki mu bahali pandu pajomu.<verse eid="EXO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" />Bhela Miliamu, mlota mbomba jola, ndombu waka Haluni, akatoliki mbelakete mu chiwoku chaki, na akambomba bhokapi bhakunjengalili bhakabhili na mbelakete yabhu koni bhakahonaje na kukina. <verse eid="EXO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />Miliamu akabhalongwihi kujemba:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">“Munjembilaje Bambo Chapanga, maghambu atopaliki namaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">Falasi na bhabhatami panani ja falasi akabhakangili mu bahali.”<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Machi mabhabha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Bhela Musa akabhalongwihi Bhaizilaeli kuhuma ku Bahali ja Shamu na kujingila mu lipololu la ku Shuli. Kwa machobha ghatatu bhakatendiki mwanja kulipololu panga kughabhona machi. <verse eid="EXO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" />Pabhahikiki papalowakiki Mara, ngachebhaweziki kunywa machi gha pandu panihapa maghambu ghakabhi mabhabha. Pandu pakalowakiki Mara, maghambu machi ghaki ghakabhi mabhabha. <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Panihapa bhandu bhakung'ong'atakili Musa, bhakapwaghaje, “Henu tukunywaje kike?” <verse eid="EXO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" />Henu Musa akundelili Bambo Chapanga, najombi Bambo Chapanga akundangihi chipandi cha nkongu. Musa akachijeghili mkati ja machi, naghombi machi ghanihagha ghakang'anambwiki na kubha manyahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:25">Konihoku Bambo Chapanga akabhapekihi Bhaizilaeli amuli na shelia, na bhelabhela akabhalengike. <verse eid="EXO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" />Chapanga akabhapwaghile, “Ngati ananjowanili sauti jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu na kughahenga ghaghapalika pamihu jangu, ngati anamkamwili malaghalakilu ghangu na kuikamula amuli yangu yokapi, nepani nganundeteli hitamu ngati yenakabhaletile Bhamisili, kwa kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, nenundamiha mwehapa.”<verse eid="EXO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakahikiki ku Elimu, pandu papakabhili na chemuchemu komi na ibheli, na mikongu sabini ja mitende, nabhombi bhakatami konihoku pambipi na machi.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="s">Mana na ngwale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhakabhokiki ku Elimu, na kuhika ku chingwenje cha ku Sini pachilanda ja Elimu na Sinai. Haleli lakabhi lichobha la komi na nhwanu la mwehi wa kabheli kutumbula Bhaizilaeli pabhakabhokiki ku inchi ja ku Misili. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" />Henu Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhakung'ong'utakili Musa na Haluni kuchingwenji hoku. <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" />Bhaizilaeli bhakabhapwaghile, “Mbanga Bambo Chapanga akabya atukomiku chikahi patukabhili ku Misili hoku! Konihoku tukakuliki inyama na hilebhi yetukaipalike, nambu mwehapa mtuletiki kuchingwenji koni nahuli mtukomaje lipogha lenu lokapi kwa injala.”<verse eid="EXO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Lingalyaje nepani ananuntonyilaje iyula ja mabumunda kuhuma kunani kumahundi. Bhandu anabhapitaje kunja kila lichobha na kutondola chilebhi cha lichobha leniheli. Kwa indela jeniheji ananundengaje nahuli mbataje kulola ngati anankamulaje shelia yangu au ngabhela. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Mu lichobha la sita anabhatondulaje pandu pabheli pa chilebhi chebhatondola mu machobha ghokapi.”<verse eid="EXO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" />Henu Musa na Haluni bhakabhapwaghili Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, “Pakamihi jenjenu anammanyaje kubha Bambo Chapanga nde joakumbohiki ku inchi ja ku Misili. <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" />Kabhete chilabhu lukela anamubhonaje ulumbalilu waka Bambo Chapanga, kwa ndandi ajowini mang'ong'uteku ghinu. Bho, tepani nde akanane mbaka mtung'ong'utakela?” <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" />Bhela Musa akapwaghike, “Pakamihi Bambo Chapanga anaampekyaje inyama nkulaje, na lukela anaampekyaje mabumunda nkulaje mtupilaje, maghambu jombi aghajowini mang'ong'uteku ghinu. Bho, tepani nde akanane mbaka mtung'ong'utakela? Ngachemng'ong'uteka panani jitu tepani, nambu mng'ong'uteka panani jaka Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Panihapa Musa akumpwaghi Haluni, “Ubhapwaghilaje Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, ‘Muhikaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, kwa ndandi aghajowini mang'ong'uteku ghinu.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />Haluni paakabhi alongela na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, bhandu bhokapi bhakalingalili kulipololu hoku, palapala bhakauweni ulumbalilu waka Bambo Chapanga ukapitalyaje mu lihundi. <verse eid="EXO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" />“Nyowini mang'ong'uteku gha Bhaizilaeli. Ubhapwaghilaje, ‘Pakamihi anabhakulaje inyama, na lukela anabhakulaje mabumunda ghamughapala. Panihapa anammanyaje kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />Pakamihi pajahikike ngwale yamaheli yakaihyekiki kambi ya Bhaizilaeli. Lukela lwaki kukapitalili na lyangame, lakaghahyekiki makambi ghokapi gha Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" />Lyangami heli palajomike, lingalyaje, kukahighalili na chindu chipepandau na chechipepwike kulipololu hoku. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" />Bhaizilaeli pabhakaweni chindu hechi bhakakangichi na kulaluwana, “Chenjenu kike?” Maghambu ngachebhamanyi chakabhi chindu bhole. Panihapa Musa akabhapwaghile, “Lendenu nde libumunda leampekihi Bambo Chapanga mkulaje. <verse eid="EXO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />Lilobhi lendenu nde leapwagha Bambo Chapanga, ‘Mwehapa mtondulaje chindu hechi kila mundu ngati moawezela kujomola. Mtondulaje kila mundu pishi jimu kwa ndandi jaka kila mundu joabhile mkati ja lihema lino.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki bhenibhela, bhakumu bhabhu bhakatondwili nakanopi, bhangi pachokopi. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" />Nambu bhokapi pabhakapemiki, jola joakabhongini nakanopi ngacheakabhili na nyonjeka, kabheti jola joakabhongini pachokopi ngacheakabhili na ukepakeku. Kila jumu akabhongini chilebhi cheakapalike. <verse eid="EXO 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Panihapa Musa akabhapwaghi bhandu, “Mundu jokapi ngayihighakila chilebhi hechi mbaka lukela.” <verse eid="EXO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Nambu bhandu ngachebhunjowanili Musa. Bhakumu bhabhu bhakahighakili chilebhi mbaka lukela. Nambu lukela chilebhi hechi chakabhi na imbeku na kutumbula kununga. Bhela Musa akabhayomili namaa. <verse eid="EXO 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />Kila lukela, kila mundu akatondwili chilebhi cheaweza kula, na lyobha palakabhili likali, chilebhi chechahighalili kola kobhatondulaje, chakatehi kuyeyuka.<verse eid="EXO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />Lichobha la sita, Bhaizilaeli bhakatondwili chilebhi hechi mala pabheli, pishi ibheli kwaka kila mundu. Henu bhazee bhokapi bha Bhaizilaeli bhakapiti kwaka Musa, na kumpwaghila lijambu lenihele. <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" />Musa akabhapwaghile, “Jenjenu nde amuli jaka Bambo Chapanga, ‘Chilabhu analikubha lichobha la kupomulela, Sabato jihuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga. Bhela, njendaje mkajochaje au mkatutuhaje chilebhi chela chemchipala lalenu na chilebhi chechihighalyaje mchibhekaje mbaka lukela.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Bhela bhakatendiki bhenibhela na kuchileka chilebhi chengi mbaka lukela, ngati Musa moakalaghalakile, lukela lwaki bhakachiweni kubha ngachechibholiki wala kubha na imbeku. <verse eid="EXO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Musa akabhapwaghi bhandu, “Mkulaje chilebhi chechihighalili chenu lalenu, maghambu lalenu nde Sabato jaka Bambo Chapanga. Lalenu ngampati chilebhi chokapi chela kunja hoku. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" />Kwa machobha sita anamtondulaje chilebhi hechi, nambu lichobha la saba nde Sabato, mu lichobha leniheli ngachipatikane.”<verse eid="EXO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Hata bhela, bhandu bhakumu bhabhu bhakapitiki kujenda kutondola chilebhi mu lichobha la saba, nambu ngachebhapatiki chokapi. <verse eid="EXO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Bho, mbaka lile anamkanaje kuikamula amuli na shelia yango? <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Mkombukaje kubha, Bambo Chapanga ampekihi mwehapa lichobha la Sabato, nde ndandi akumpekihi chilebhi cha machobha ghabheli mu lichobha la sita. Bhela kila jumu winu apomulyaje panyumba jaki mu lichobha la saba. Mundu jokapi ngayibhoka mu lichobha la saba.” <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />Bhela bhandu bhakapomulili mu lichobha la saba.<verse eid="EXO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Bhaizilaeli bhakachilohiki chilebhi hechi “Mana”. Chakabhili ngati imbeju ya mapemba, chakabhi chihuhu, na kunogha kwaki kukabhili ngati libumunda lipepandau lelilenganakiki na buse. <verse eid="EXO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Musa akabhapwaghile, “Bambo Chapanga alaghalakili anana, ‘Mtolaje pishi jimu ja mana na kujighoha kwa ndandi ja ibheleku yeihika, nahuli nabhombi bhabhonaje chilebhi chela chenakumpekihi mwehapa mu chingwenje, chikahi panakumbohiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" />Musa akumpwaghi Haluni, “Utolaje chihulu, na ubhekaje pishi jimu ja mana mkati jake. Panihapa ubhekaje mana heji palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, nahuli jighohakikaje kwa ndandi ja ibheleku hinu yeihika.” <verse eid="EXO 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" />Bhela, Haluni akajibhekiki mana heji mkati ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, mokukabhili na ibau ya Shelia nahuli kujighoha, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" />Bhaizilaeli bhakakuliki mana kwa chikahi cha hyaka alobaini, mbaka pabhahikiki mu inchi jebhakabhi bhatama bhandu. Bhakakuliki mana heji mbaka pabhahikiki mu malindakanilu gha Kanaani. <verse eid="EXO 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />Pishi jimu nde pandu pamu pa komi pa chipemu chekilowakeka efa.<verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s">Machi kuhuma mu litalaghu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 20:1-13">Hesabu 20:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Lipogha lokapi la Bhaizilaeli bhakabhokiki kuhuma ku lipololu la ku Sini, na kujendalela na mwanja kuhuma pandu pamu mbaka pandu pangi ngati Bambo Chapanga moakalaghalakile. Bhakabhekiki likambi ku Lefidimu, nambu panihapa ngachepakabhili na machi gha bhandu kunywa. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" />Bhela bhandu bhakung'ong'utakili Musa na kupwagha, “Utupekyaje machi gha kunywa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 17:2">Musa akayangike, “Mbona mng'ong'utakela nepane? Bho, maghambu kike mundenga Bambo Chapanga?”<verse eid="EXO 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Nambu bhandu bhokapi bhakabhili na inywita, bhakung'ong'utakili Musa, bhakapwaghaje, “Maghambu kike ukatubhohiki ku Misili, na kutuleta pambani nahuli utukomaje kwa inywita tepani, bhana bhitu na hinyama hitu?”<verse eid="EXO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" />Musa akundobhiki namaa Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghaje, “Nabhatendila kike bhandu abhabha? Bhabhili pambipi kunapula kwa maganga.”<verse eid="EXO 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />Bambo Chapanga akamuyangiki Musa, “Ulongulyaje palongi ja bhandu, na ubhatolaje bhazee bhakumu bha Izilaeli papamu na wehapa. Utolaje mu mabhoku ghaku ndonga jela jeukalapwili mu nkoka Naili, na ujendaje. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" />Lingalyaje, nepani ananyemaje palongi jinu palitalaghu la Holebu. Ulapulaje litalaghu, na machi anaghapitaje, nahuli bhandu bhokapi bhapata kunywa.” Bhela, Musa akahengiki bhenibhela palongi ja bhazee bhokapi bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="EXO 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" />Musa akapalohiki pandu panihapa Masa, ndandi jaki “Kulenga” na Meliba, ndandi ja “Kung'ong'uteka” maghambu Bhaizilaeli bhakung'ong'utakili na kundenga Bambo Chapanga, bhakapwaghaje, “Bho, chakaka lelu kubha Bambo Chapanga abhi papamu na tepani au ngabhela?”<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhakomana ngondo na Bhaamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />Bhela, Bhaamaleki bhakahikiki kukomana ngondo na Bhaizilaeli ku Lefidimu hoku. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Musa akumpwaghi Yoshua, “Ubhahaghulaje akanalomi bhakumu, na ujendaje ukakomanaje na Bhaamaleki. Chilabhu ananyemaje panani jakanopi ja katombi, nakabyaje na ndonga jaka Chapanga mu chiwoku changu.” <verse eid="EXO 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Bhela, Yoshua akatendiki ngati Musa moakumpwaghile, akapiti kukomana ngondo na Bhaamaleki. Nambu Musa, Haluni na Huli bhakapiti kukwela panani jakanopi ja katombi. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" />Chikahi chokapi Musa paakakwehiki mabhoku ghaki kunani, Bhaizilaeli bhakashindike, nambu chikahi paakahelihi mabhoku ghaki, Bhaamaleki bhakashindike. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />Mabhoku ghaka Musa paghakatondike, Haluni na Huli bhakatoliki liganga na kumpekeha atamilaje. Haluni na Huli bhakakamulakili mabhoku ghaka Musa, jumu upambala wa kumalelelu na jumu upambala wa kumangeja. Panihapa mabhoku ghaka Musa ghakahighalili ghakwehakiki kunani mbaka lyobha palajibhile. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Bhela Yoshua akabhaweziki Bhaamaleki kwa lipanga.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ulembaje mambu aghagha mu chitabu nahuli ghakombukwaje, na unsomilaje Yoshua najombi ajowanaje, kubha ananabhayonangaje Bhaamaleki bhokapi pani pundema.” <verse eid="EXO 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Musa akachengiki pandu pa kumbokeha Chapanga nyambiku, na kupaloha, “Yehova Nisi.” Ndandi jaki Bambo Chapanga nde Bendela Jangu. <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />Musa akapwaghike, “Kwa ndandi mabhoku ghakakwehakiki mbaka pa chiteu cha kikolongwa chaka Bambo Chapanga. Bambo Chapanga anaakomanaje ngondo na Bhaamaleki chibheleku mbaka chibheleku.”<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesulu anjendela Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Bhela Yesulu, mpenganyambiku wa ku Midiani, nkowanu waki Musa, akajowini kila chindu Chapanga cheakuntendili Musa na Bhaizilaeli, bhandu bhake, ntundu Bambo Chapanga moabhabhokihe Bhaizilaeli kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="EXO 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Bhela Yesulu, koni akabya na Sipola, nhwanu waka Musa, ambaju Musa akabhi ankelawihe kwaka tati waki, akapiti kwaka Musa, <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />papamu na bhana bhabheli bhaka Musa. Lihina laka mwana wa kutumbula akalowakiki Gelishomu, kwa kubha Musa akapwaghiki, “Nepani mili nungeni mu inchi ja kigheni.” <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />Wa kabheli akalowakiki Eliezeli, kwa kubha Musa akapwaghiki, “Chapanga waka tati wangu akanyangatili, nahuli nganikomakeka na Falao.” <verse eid="EXO 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Yesulu, nkowanu waka Musa, papamu na bhana bhabheli bhaka Musa na nhwanu waki bhakapiti kwaka Musa kulipololu hoku, pandu paakabhili atama pambipi na chitombi chaka Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />Yesulu akabhili antumiki ntenga kwaka Musa, kupwagha, “Nepani Yesulu, nkowanu waku nhikiki kwaku na nhwanu waku, na bhana bhaku bhabheli.” <verse eid="EXO 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />Henu Musa akapitiki kunja na kujenda kunjopalela nkowanu waki, akachikimi na kunkumbatila. Bhakalamukanili na kujingila mulihema. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Musa akundandili nkowanu waki mambu ghokapi Bambo Chapanga ghaantendili Falao na Bhamisili kwa ndandi ja Bhaizilaeli, na kubhokana na mang'ahiku ghokapi ghabhahimangini naghu mwindela na ntundu Bambo Chapanga moabhakengalile. <verse eid="EXO 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Yesulu akahekalili namaa kujowana mambu ghokapi manyahi Bambo Chapanga ghaakabhatendili Bhaizilaeli kwa kubhabhoha mu mabhoku gha Bhamisili. <verse eid="EXO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Yesulu akapwaghike, “Alumbalikaje Bambo Chapanga, joakakukengalili wehapa kuhuma mu mabhoku gha Bhamisili na Falao! Alumbalikaje Bambo Chapanga joabhakengalili bhandu kuhuma mu mabhoku gha Bhamisili! <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" />Henu manyi kubha Bambo Chapanga nde nkolongwa kupeta ichapanga yokapi, kwa ndandi abhakombwili bhandu abhabha mu mabhoku gha Bhamisili ambabhu bhakuntendili kwa ujeuli.” <verse eid="EXO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Panihapa Yesulu, nkowanu waka Musa, akaletiki nyambiku ja kujochakeka na nyambiku hengi nahuli kumbokeha Chapanga, najombi Haluni papamu na bhazee bhokapi bha Izilaeli, bhakahikiki kula chilebhi papamu na Yesulu nkowanu waka Musa kwa ndandi ja kundumbalila Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhaghuliwa kwa bhatemula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 1:9-18">Kombukombu la Tolati 1:9-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Chilabhu jaki, Musa akatemi kutemula mahakau gha Bhaizilaeli, nabhombi bhakabhi bhajemiki kumyongolota kutumbula lukela mbaka pakamihe. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />Yesulu nkowanu waka Musa, paakaghaweni mambu ghokapi Musa ghaakabhili abhahengela Bhaizilaeli, akapwaghike, “Maghambu kike ubhahengela bhandu abhabha anana? Kwa ndandi kiki wehapa ukubha mtemula wa bhandu abhabha kanjika jako, koni bhandu abhabha bhajemiki kukuyongolota kutumbula lukela mbaka pakamihe?”<verse eid="EXO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Musa akamuyangike, “Ndenda anana maghambu bhandu bhahika kwangu kunalukila mapalu ghaka Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />Bhandu bhabheli anabhakomine, bhahika kwangu nepani, na nepani ndemula mundu na mundu na kubhabhola amuli na shelia yaka Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Henu Yesulu akumpwaghi Musa, “Lijambu aleli leutenda nga wicho. <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" />Wehapa papamu na bhandu bhabhakuhikila habha anamulitendaje kutonda waka. Lihengu nde lakutopa namaa kwaku, ngauwezi kulihenga kanjika jako. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />Nyowanyaje nepani, nukupekeha ushauli, najombi Chapanga na akubhaje papamu na wehapa. Ikupalika wehapa ukubhaje wa kubhajemalela bhandu palongi jaka Chapanga, na kumpelakela matakilu ghabhu kwaki. <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" />Ubhabholaje amuli na shelia, kabhete ubhabholaje ntundu wa kutama na kuhenga lihengu lebhapalika kulihenga. <verse eid="EXO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" />Nambu uhaghulaje bhandu bhabhaweza kukujangatila pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, bhandu bhabhunjojabhela Chapanga, bhandu bhalongwana bhabhahakalila ngolukelu, ubhahaghulaje bhakubhaje ihongozi panani ja bhandu maelufu, bhandu mamia, bhandu hamsini hamsini na bhandu makome. <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" />Ubhabhekaje bhakubhaje bhatemula bha bhandu kwa chikahi chokapi, nambu ubhapwaghilaje bhakuletilaje wehapa kila lihakau lelinonwipe, ghaghapepwiki bhaghatemulaje bhene. Kwa indela jeniheji anautendaje chibwahila chaku kubha cha kupepuka, kwa ndandi anabhakubhaje papamu na wehapa. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />Ngati anautendiki bhenibhela, na ngati Chapanga anaakulaghalakili bhenibhela, wehapa ngawitonde, na bhandu bhanihabha bhokapi anabhawezaje kukelabhuka kunyumba yabhu koni matakilu ghabhu ghajomwike.”<verse eid="EXO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Musa akunjowanili Yesulu, nkowanu waki, na kutenda kila chindu cheakapwaghike. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" />Musa akabhahawili bhandu bhabhaweza kunjangatila kuhuma kwa Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, na kubhatenda kubha ihongozi bha bhandu, ihongozi panani ja bhandu maelufu, bhandu mamia, bhandu hamsini hamsini na bhandu makome. <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" />Nabhombi bhakabhili bhatemula bha bhandu kila lichobha. Mahakau makolongwa bhakumpelakili Musa, nambu ghala machoku machoku bhakaghatemwi bheni.<verse eid="EXO 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" />Panihapa Musa akatabhukini na Yesulu, nkowanu waki, najombi Yesulu akakelawiki ku inchi jake.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli pa chitombi cha Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1" />Lichobha la kutumbula la mwehi wa tatu kutumbula Bhaizilaeli pabhakabhokiki ku inchi ja ku Misili, lichobha heli, bhakahikiki ku lipololu la ku Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2" />Pabhakabhokiki ku Lefidimu, bhakahikiki ku lipololu la ku Sinai, na Bhaizilaeli bhakatemi palipololu pala pachitumbula chitombi. <verse eid="EXO 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />Bhela Musa akakweliki panani ja chitombi kuketangana na Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 19:3">Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akundohiki Musa kuhuma pachitombi pala, akapwaghaje, “Ubhapwaghilaje anana lubheleku lwaka Yakobo, bhandu bhaka Izilaeli, <verse eid="EXO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" />‘Mwehapa mbweni monakabhatendili ku Misili hoku, na ntundu monakuntolile mwehapa ngati ngwahi mojitolela bhana bhaki mu mapapanilu ghaki, na kundeta mwehapa kwangu. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" />Henu ngati anankamwili chakaka na kulighoha lulaghilu langu, panihapa mwehapa anamkubhaje bhandu bhangu bhahaghulika pachilanda ja mataifa ghokapi. Maghambu ndema wokapi nde wangu nepane, <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" />mwehapa anamkubhaje kwangu ukolongwa wa bhapenganyambiku na litaifa lihuhu.’ Ghangani nde malobhi ghaubhapwaghilaje Bhaizilaeli.” <verse eid="EXO 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Panihapa Musa akakelawike, akabhalohiki bhazee bha Izilaeli na kubhapwaghila mambu ghokapi ghaakalaghalakiwi na Bambo Chapanga aghapwaghaje. <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" />Bhandu bhokapi bhakajetakili kwa papamu, bhakapwaghaje, “Anatutendaje kila chindu Bambo Chapanga cheapwaghike,” Najombi Musa akakelawihi mayangu ghabhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ananukuhikilaje mu lihundi la kutopa, nahuli panilongilaje na wehapa Bhaizilaeli bhanyowanyaje ghambwagha na wehapa kila chikahi bhabhekaje lihobhalelu labhu kwaku mileli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 19:9">Panihapa Musa akumpwaghi Bambo Chapanga ghala ghabhakapwaghiki bhandu. <verse eid="EXO 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ujendaje kwa bhandu ukabhagholulaje lalenu na chilabhu. Ubhapwaghilaje bhachapaje ingobhu yabhu, <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />bhakubhaje tayali kwa lichobha la pamalabhu, kwa ndandi lichobha heli, nepani Bambo Chapanga ananhulukaje panani ja chitombi Sinai pamihu gha bhandu bhokapi. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" />Wehapa ubhabhekilaje bhandu malindakanilu kuchiyongolota chitombi. Ubhapwaghilaje, ‘Ndingalyaje, ngamwikwela pachitombi au kuchikamula. Mundu jokapi joanakamulaje chakaka anaakomakikaje. <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />Mundu jokapi ngaankamula mundu joalombwike malindakanilu hoju, anakomakikaje kwa kulapulika maganga au nkoha akubhi nde mundu au nde chinyama, ngayilame.’ Nambu chikahi mbata pajijendalyaje kujemba kwa sauti ngolongwa, bhandu bhokapi anabhaheghalyaje pachitombi.”<verse eid="EXO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Bhela Musa akahulwiki pachitombi na kubhajendela bhandu, akabhagholwili, nabhombi bhakachapiki ingobhu yabhu. <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" />Panihapa Musa akabhapwaghi bhandu, “Mlibhekaje tayali kwa ndandi ja lichobha la pamalabhu. Mwanalomi jokapi ngayighonela kihyegha na mbomba.”<verse eid="EXO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />Lukela lichobha la katatu kukabhili na kulundamila na unang'anu wa hitobhi papamu na lihundi la kutopa panani ja chitombi, na sauti ngolongwa namaa ja mbata. Kila mundu joakabhili palikambi akabhaghije. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Bhela Musa akabhalongwihi bhandu kuhuma palikambi na kujenda kuhimangana na Chapanga, nabhombi bhakajemiki pachitumbula chitombi. <verse eid="EXO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" />Chitombi cha Sinai chakabhili chiyekaliwi na lyohi, kwa ndandi Bambo Chapanga akahelili panani jake mu moto. Lyohi la moto ghonihoghu ukakweliki kunani ngati lyohi la nvuni ukolongwa na chitombi chokapi chakabhaghiji kwa makili namaa. <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />Sauti ja mbata jakajendallili kujonjukeka nakanopi. Musa akalongili na Chapanga. Najombi Bambo Chapanga akamuyangiki Musa kwa sauti. <verse eid="EXO 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />Bambo Chapanga akahelili panani ja chitombi cha Sinai, konihoku Bambo Chapanga akundohiki Musa akwelaje panani pachitombi. Panihapa Musa akakweliki pachitombi. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Hulukaje pahi ukabhakanakyaje bhandu ngabhilomboka malindakanilu kuhika kumona nepani, anabhatendiki bhenibhela bhamaheli bhabhu anabhapotilaje. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" />Hata bhapenganyambiku, anabhanheghalile nepani Bambo Chapanga, ibhapalika kuligholola, anangati ngachebhatendiki bhenibhela nepani Bambo Chapanga, ananabhalapulaje.”<verse eid="EXO 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Musa akumpwaghi Bambo Chapanga, “Bhandu ngabhawezi kukwela chitombi Sinai kwa ndandi wehapa wamwete ukatulaghalakili, ukapwaghaje, ‘Tubhekaje malindakilu kuchiyongolota chitombi, na kuchitenga ngati pandu pahuhu.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />Bambo Chapanga akamuyangike, “Hulukaje pahi, na ukahikaje na Haluni. Nambu ubhahibhalakyaje bhapenganyambiku papamu na bhandu bhangi ngabhilomboka malindakanilu na kuhika kwangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, anabhatendiki bhenibhela ananabhalapulaje.” <verse eid="EXO 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Bhela Musa akahelili na kubhapwaghi Bhaizilaeli mambu ghokapi ghaakalaghalakiwi na Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s">Amuli Komi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 5:1-21">Kombukombu la Tolati 5:1-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Bhela Chapanga akapwaghiki malobhi ghokapi hagha, <verse eid="EXO 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />“Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, nenukubhohiki ku Misili, kuhuma ku inchi koukabhile untumwa.<verse eid="EXO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />“Ngawikubha na ichapanga yengi nambu nepani pela.<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />“Ngawalitendela chimong'umong'u cha kuhongola chechilengana na chindu chokapi chechibhili kunani kumahundi, wala chechibhili pahi pundema, wala chechibhili mumachi pahi ja ndema. <verse eid="EXO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />Ngawaichikamila wala kuijojabhela, kwa kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, nde Chapanga nemili na wihu, nabhatemula bhana kwa mahoku gha akatati bhabhu mbaka chibheleku cha katatu na cha kachechi cha bhala bhabhanhakalila, <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" />nambu ananangihaje upalu wangu wangakujomoka kwa hibheleku elufu ya bhala bhabhambala, na kuikamula amuli yangu.<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />“Ngawaliloghola waka lihina laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga ngayikotoki kumbalangila mahoku mundu jola joaliloghola lihina laki waka.<verse eid="EXO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />“Ulikombukaje lichobha la Sabato, uligholulaje. <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" />Machobha sita uhengaje mahengu ghaku, na uhengaje mambu ghaku ghokapi, <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" />nambu lichobha la saba nde lichobha la Sabato kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku. Mu lichobha leniheli ngawihenga lihengu lokapi lela, wehapa wala mwana waku wa chikambaku au mwali waku, wala mtumwa waku, wala mtumika waku wa chikambaku au wa chimbomba, wala chinyama chaku, wala ngeni joabhi mkati ja michi jaku. <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" />Kwa ndandi kwa machobha sita, nepani Bambo Chapanga nakabhombiki kunani na ndema, bahali na yokapi yeibhili mkati jaki, nambu nakapomulili lichobha la saba. Henu, nepani Bambo Chapanga nakalipengalili lichobha la Sabato na kulitenda kubha lihuhu.<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />“Watopilaje tati waku na mabhu waku, nahuli upataje kutama machobha ghamaheli mu inchi jeupekewa na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku.<verse eid="EXO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />“Ngawikoma.<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />“Ngawitenda ugone.<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />“Ngawijibha.<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />“Ngawandandila njaku upuhi.<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />“Ngawajitokulela nyumba jaka njaku. Ngawantokulela nhwanu waka njaku, wala mtumika waki wa chikambaku au wa chimbomba, wala ng'ombi jaki au maponda ghaki, wala chokapi chela cheabhi nachu njaku.”<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhajoghopa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 5:22-33">Kombukombu la Tolati 5:22-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />Bhandu pabhakajowini kulundamila na unang'anu wa hitobhi, na kujowana sauti ja mbata, na kuchibhona chitombi chihuka lyohi, bhakabhaghiji kwa choghohi, na kujema kutali. <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />Bhakumpwaghi Musa, “Ulongilaje na tepani wehapa wamwete, na tepani anatukujowanyaje. Nambu ngawandeka Chapanga alongilaje na tepani, anatendiki bhenibhela anatupotilaje.”<verse eid="EXO 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" />Musa akabhapwaghi bhandu, “Ngamwijoghopa! Chapanga ahikiki kundenga, nahuli nkubhaje na choghoi chaka Chapanga, na ngamwitenda mahoku.” <verse eid="EXO 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Nambu bhandu bhokapi bhakahighalili bhajemiki kutali, chikahi Musa paakaliheghalili lihundi la lwihi lukolongwa moakabhili Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shelia ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ubhapwaghilaje Bhaizilaeli anana, ‘Mbweni mabhete kubha nongili na mwehapa kuhuma kunani kumahundi. <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />Ngamwalitendela ichapanga yokapi yela na kuilenganesha na nepani, ngamwilenganakela ichapanga ya madini gha mbija, wala ichapanga ya zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" />Nambu mnenganakyaje pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku kwa lutopi, na panani jaki mbohaje nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwa moto na nyambiku ja lukwali, mmokihaje mambeleli ghinu, imbuhi na ng'ombi hinu. Mwihengaje bhenibhela pandu pokapi pala panapahaghulaje mkanyojabyaje nepani, panihapa nde panihika kwinu na kumpengalela. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" />Ngati anamnjengili pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku kwa maganga, ngamwilenganakela kwa maganga gha kuhongola, maghambu anamtumili hindu ya kuhongulela maganga, anamupatendaje pandu panihapa ngapijetakalewa palongi jangu nepani. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />Ngamwilenganakela pandu pa kubhokela nyambiku papabhili na ngazi ja kukwelela, nahuli mundu ngayibhona utopu waka joakwela panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku hapa.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="s">Malaghalakilu gha kubhahengela bhatumwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 15:12-18">Kombukombu la Tolati 15:12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />“Yenjenu nde shelia yeupalika kubhapekeha Bhaizilaeli: <verse eid="EXO 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" />Ngati anaunhemili mtumwa wa Kiebulania, anaakuhengilaje lihengu kwa hyaka sita. Nambu chaka cha saba anakubhaje wa kulijeka na kubhoka panga kundepa chindu chokapi chela. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />Ngati akahikiki kwaku kanjika jaki, anabhokaje kanjika jaki, nambu ngati akahikiki na nhwanu waki, anabhokaje papamu na nhwanu waki. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />Ngati bambo waki akuntoghukili mbomba, na kumbelakela bhana bha chimbomba au bha chikambaku, henu mbomba hoju na bhana bhaki anabhakubha mali ghaka bambo waki, na mtumwa hoju anabhokaje kanjika jaki. <verse eid="EXO 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" />Nambu ngati mtumwa hoju anapwaghiki, ‘Numpala bambo wangu, nhwanu wangu papamu na bhana bhangu na ngachembala kubha wa kulijeka,’ <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" />panihapa bambo waki anaandetaje palongi jaka Chapanga, na kumbeka pundyangu au pa ngelakete na kunhotola likutu laki kwa lukombu. Najombi anaantumakyaje bambo waki matamu ghaki ghokapi.<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />“Mundu anaandombisi kamwali waki kubha mtumwa, ngayilekakewi kubha wa kulijeka ngati bhatumwa bha chikambaku mobhalekakewa. <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />Ngati bambo waki joanhemili ngacheapala akubhaje nhwanu waki, na koni akabhi anhawile, bambo hoju ankelabhuhaje mwali hoju kwaka tati waki koanhemile. Bambo hoju ngaandombesa kabhete kwa bhagheni, maghambu lijambu leanhengile nde lijambu la ukoluheku. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />Ngati mundu anaanhemili mwali mtumwa na kuntoghukela mwana waki wa chikambaku, impalika antendilaje mtumwa hoju ngati akakamwali bhake. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />Ngati bambo hoju anatowili mbomba jongi, impalika ajendalyaje kungoha mbomba wa kutumbula kwa chilebhi, ingobhu na mambu ghokapi ghaghapalika kwaka mwanalomi na mbomba bhabhatoghuline. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />Ngati bambo hoju ngacheaweza kunhengela mambu ghatatu hagha, mbomba wa kutumbu hoju anaabhokaje na kubha wa kulijeka panga kundepa malepu ghokapi ghala gha mbija.<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shelia panani ja kubhapoteka bhandu bhangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />“Mundu jokapi joandapula njaki na kunkoma, impalika najombi akomakikaje. <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" />Nambu ngati ngacheankomiki kwa kupala, nambu Chapanga akapaliki lipitalyaje bhenibhela, henu mundu jonihoju aweza kutilila pandu panunhwaghulyaje. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" />Nambu ngati mundu anjendili njaki na kunkoma kwa kupala, hata ngati anakembalili pandu pangu pa kumokeha nyambiku, mumbohaje pandu pangu pa kubhokeha nyambiku hapa na kunkoma.<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />“Mundu jokapi joandapula tati waki au mabhu waki, impalika akomakikaje.<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />“Mundu jokapi joanjibha mundu nahuli kunhemalela au kuntenda mtumwa waki, ngati anakamuliki, impalika akomakikaje.<verse eid="EXO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" />“Mundu jokapi joampekeha masolu tati waki au mabhu waki, impalika akomakikaje.<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18" />“Ngati bhandu bhabheli bhatenda kukomana na jumu anaandapwili njaki kwa liganga au kwa ngumi panga kunkoma, nambu anaampotiki na kuntenda alwalaje na kughonela pachitanda, <verse eid="EXO 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19" />ngati mundu joalapuliki hoju anapatiki mbanga na kuweza kujenda kwa ndonga, mundu joampotiki njaki hoju analekakiwaje. Nambu, anaandepaje mbija kwa chikahi cheantendiki ahoaje pachitanda, na impalika angohaje mbaka alamaje wichu.<verse eid="EXO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />“Ngati mundu anaandapwili mtumwa waki wa chikambaku au wa chimbomba kwa ndonga na mtumwa hoju anaapotili palapala, impalika akomakikaje. <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" />Nambu mtumwa hoju anaalamike mu lichobha limu au la kabheli, bambo waki ngayitemuliwi, kwa ndandi jonihoju akabhili mtumwa waki.<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />“Ngati akanalomi bhatenda kukomana na kumpoteka mbomba joabhili na chitumbu, najombi chitumbu anachibhokike, panga kumpoteka pandu pangi nakanope, mundu jola joampotiki mbomba hoju, apalika andepaje mbija ngati moayipalilaje ndomi waka mbomba hoju, na ngati bhatemula mobhitemulyaje. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Nambu ngati anaapotakiki nakanope, bhela mundu jonihoju impalika alepaje womi kwa womi, <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" />lihu kwa lihu, linu kwa linu, chiwoku kwa chiwoku, chigholu kwa chigholu, <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />kujochakeka moto kwa kujochakeka moto, chilonda kwa chilonda, kukopukana kwa kukopukana.<verse eid="EXO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />“Ngati mundu anaandapwi mtumwa waki wa chikambaku au wa chimbomba mu lihu na kumpojola, impalika andeka kulijeka mtumwa jola kubha malepu gha lihu laki. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />Ngati anaandapwili mtumwa waki wa chimbomba au wa chikambaku na kumboha linu, impalika andekaje kulijeka mtumwa hoju kubha malepu gha linu laki.<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shelia ja kuighoha hinyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />“Ngati ng'ombi anajuntutiki mundu kwa manyelu na kunkoma, ng'ombi heji anajikomakikaje kwa kulapulika kwa maganga na inyama jaki ngajileleka. Nambu mweni ng'ombi hoju anaalekakiwaje kulijeka. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Nambu ngati ng'ombi heji jiyobhalili kubhatuta bhandu kwa manyelu, na mweni ng'ombi akakanakiwi nambu ngacheakajikongiki, ngati ng'ombi heji anajunkomiki mundu, jipalika ng'ombi heji jikomakikaje kwa kulapulika maganga, na mweni ng'ombi hoju ipalika akomakikaje. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Nambu anangati mundu impalika kulepa nahuli kuukombola womi waki, henu aweza kulepa chokapi chela chechipalika kulepa. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />Shelia yenjenu anaitumikaje ngati ng'ombi anajuntutiki kwa manyelu mwana wa chikambaku waka mundu jongi au mwana wa chimbomba waka mundu jongi. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />Ngati ng'ombi anajuntutiki kwa manyelu mtumwa wa chikambaku au wa chimbomba, mweni ng'ombi anaandepaje ipandi selasini ya madini gha feza kwaka bambo mweni mtumwa hoju, na ng'ombi heji jipalika jikomakikaje kwa kulapulika maganga.<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33" />“Mundu anaaliyekwili libhomba panga kuliyekalela, au anahembiki libhomba panga kuliyekalela, na ng'ombi au liponda laka mundu jongi analijibhili mkati jaki, <verse eid="EXO 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34" />mweni libhomba heli impalika alepaje, impalika andepaje mweni chinyama. Chinyama chechihwili hechi anachikubha chaka joakembiki libhomba. <verse eid="EXO 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />Ngati ng'ombi jaka mundu anajuntutiki ng'ombi jaka mundu jongi na kujikoma, henu bhandu anabhahemalyaje ng'ombi jejibhi jomi na kughabhana mbija heji kwa kulengana, bhelabhela bhaghabhanaje ng'ombi jejiwili jela. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Nambu ngati ng'ombi heji jakabhili jiyobhalili kulapula bhajaki kwa manyelu na mweni jaki ngacheakajikongiki, impalika mweni ng'ombi alepaje ng'ombi kwa ng'ombi, na ng'ombi jejikomakiki jela anajikubha jaki.<verse eid="EXO 21:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="s">Shelia ja kundepa njaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />“Ngati mundu anajibhiki ng'ombi au limbeleli na kunchinja au kunhemalela, mundu jonihoju apalika alepaje ng'ombi nhwanu kwa ng'ombi jimu jeajibhike, na mambeleli nchechi kwa limbeleli limu leajibhike. <verse eid="EXO 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2" />Ngati mwihi anakamuliki abhombola nyumba ikilu na kulapulika mbaka kupotela, mundu joankomiki mwihi hoju ngacheakubha na lihoku la kujitila mwahi. <verse eid="EXO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3" />Nambu lijambu heli analipitalili chikahi lyobha analipitiki, mundu joankomiki mwihi hoju akubha na lihoku la kujitila mwahi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:3">“Mwihi hoju impalika alepaje, nambu ngati ngacheabhili na chindu cha kulepa, apalika ahemaliwaje nahuli alepaje kwa ndandi ja wihi waki. <verse eid="EXO 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4" />Ngati chinyama chechijibhakiki chihimaniwi chibhili chomi mumabhoku ghaka mwihi hoju, ikubhi ng'ombi au liponda au limbeleli, impalika kulepa mala pabheli.<verse eid="EXO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />“Ngati mundu anaalekakili hinyama yaki mu ngonda au ngonda wa mizabibu, na kuileka ikulaje mu ngonda waka mundu jongi, impalika alepaje hindu hinyahi kuhuma mu ngonda waki mweni au kuhuma mu ngonda waki wa mizabibu.<verse eid="EXO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />“Ngati mundu anapambakili moto mungonda waki, na moto hoghu anaujochiki mikongu ja miha na kujaghanila mbaka kutinyiha miganda ja chilebhi, au chilebhi chaka mundu jongi panga kuchihuna, au ngonda wokapi anautinyiki, mundu joapambakili moto hoju impalika kulepa.<verse eid="EXO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />“Mundu anaampekihi njaki mbija au hindu hengi angohilaje, na ngati anaijibhakiki kuhuma mu nyumba jaka njaki hoju, na ngati mwihi hoju anaakamuliki, impalika alepaje mala pabheli pa hindu yeajibhike. <verse eid="EXO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />Nambu ngati mwihi ngacheakamuliki, mweni nyumba hoju anapelakikaje palongi ja bhatemula, nahuli kulangiha kubha ngacheatoliki hindu yaka njaki.<verse eid="EXO 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" />“Ngati bhandu bhabheli bhakomanela ng'ombi, au liponda au limbeleli, au ingobhu, au chindu chokapi chechihobhiki ambachu kila mundu apwagha nde chaki, bhandu bhanihabha anabhaletakikaje palongi ja bhatemula. Jola ambaju bhatemula anabhumbona kubha abhili na lihoku anaandepa njaki mala pabheli.<verse eid="EXO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />“Ngati mundu anaampekihi njaki liponda, au ng'ombi, au limbeleli au chinyama chengi chokapi achighohaje, na chinyama hechi anachiwili au anachilipotiki au anachitolakiki panga mundu jokapi kumanya, <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11" />lijambu heli analitemuliwaje kwa kulapa kwaka mundu hoju palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, kubha joakapekiwi ngacheakajibhiki chinyama chaka njaki. Na ngati mweni chinyama hoju anaajetakili kulapa hoku, njaki hoju ngayilepi chindu chokapi. <verse eid="EXO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12" />Nambu ngati chinyama chikajibhakiki kwaka njaki, anaimpalika andepaje mweni chinyama. <verse eid="EXO 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13" />Ngati chinyama hechi chakakomakiki na chinyama chikali cha muchitengu, mundu joakapekiwi chinyama hoju impalika aleta mahighalilu gha chinyama hechi ngati ulandilu, mundu hoju ngayilepi malepu ghokapi ghala kwa ndandi chinyama hechi chakakomakiki na chinyama chikali cha muchitengo.<verse eid="EXO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />“Ngati mundu anaajahiki chinyama kwaka njaki, na ngati chinyama hechi chitehi kulipoteka au chihwili na mweni chinyama ngacheabhili, mundu joajahiki chinyama hechi impalika alepaje chinyama hechi. <verse eid="EXO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />Nambu ngati mweni chinyama hoju anaabhili panihapa, mundu joajahiki hoju ngayilepi chokapi. Ngati chinyama chakabhili chitehi kukodiwa, mweni chinyama hechi atolaje mbija ja kodi pela.<verse eid="EXO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moibhapalakila bhandu kutama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />“Ngati mundu anaanswembiki mwali jwangakughonela na mwanalomi, na jwangakutoghuleka na kughonela naku, impalika mundu hoju kulepa mahali, na kuntoghola kamwali hoju. <verse eid="EXO 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />Nambu tati waka kamwali hoju anaakaniki katakata kuntoghukela mundu hoju kamwali waki, mundu hoju analepa mbija ya mahali yeipalika kwaka kamwali jwangakughonela na mwanalomi hoju.<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />“Ngawandeka mbomba nhwabhi kubha mwomi.<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />“Mundu jokapi joaghonela kihyegha na chinyama ipalika akomakikaje.<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />“Mundu jokapi joambokeha kichapanga jongi nyambiku badala jaka Bambo Chapanga, ipalika akomakikaje.<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />“Ngamwantendela ngeni uhakau au kung'aha, maghambu na mwehapa mkabhili mwagheni ku Misili hoku. <verse eid="EXO 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" />Ngamwantendela uhakau mbomba joahweliwi na ndomi waki, wala mwana nkebha. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" />Ngati anamwatendili uhakau bhanihabha nabhombi anabhanelili nepani, chakaka nepani ananyowanyaje chilelu chabhu, <verse eid="EXO 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />na inyela yangu anaibhelalaje, na nepani ananuntendaje mkomakikaje kwa lipanga pamwikubha ku ngondo, na akabhahanu bhinu anabhakubhaje bhabhahweliwi na bhalomi bhabhu na bhana bhinu anabhakubha bhakebha.<verse eid="EXO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />“Ngati anaunjahiki mbija mundu jokapi pachilanda ja bhandu bhangu bhabhabhili akakahochu, ngawampwaghila akulepaje mbija heji, na wala ngawandepesha nyonjeka. <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" />Ngati njaku anaabhekiki poni ingobhu jaki, ipalika ukelabhuhaje kwaki ingobhu heji mangani ja lyobha kujibhila, <verse eid="EXO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />kwa ndandi jeniheji nde ingobhu jaki ja kanjika ja kuliyeka. Nde kiki chengi cheanaaliyekaje nacho? Payinelilaje, ananyowanaje, kwa ndandi nepani mili na chiha.<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />“Ngawantondola Chapanga au kumpekeha masolu mahakau mtawala wa bhandu bhaku.<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />“Ngawikotoka kuleta nyambiku kubhokana na umaheli wa hilebhi yaku na divai yaku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:29">“Ipalika umbekyaje mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa chikambaku wa bhana bhaku. <verse eid="EXO 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />Bhelabhela umokihaje nepani bhabhelakeka bha kutumbula bha ng'ombi hinu na mambeleli ghinu. Ubhalekaje bhatamaje na akamabhu bhabhu kwa machobha saba, nambu lichobha la nane umbekyaje nepani.<verse eid="EXO 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31" />“Mwehapa anamkubha bhandu bhangu bhahuhu. Bhela ngamwikula inyama ja chinyama chechikomakike na chinyama chikali cha muchitengo, nambu ndekalyaje nakawa inyama heji.<verse eid="EXO 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s">Kubhahengela ghamboni bhandu na hinyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />“Ngawitangaza malobhi gha upuhe. Ngawanjangatila mundu muhakau kwa kubha mlandilu wa upuhe. <verse eid="EXO 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" />Ngawijengalela lipogha la bhandu kutenda mahakau, wala paubhoha ulandilu mu matakilu, ngawilombana na bhandu bhamaheli kubhoha ulandilu wa upuhe pachengu, <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />wala ngawampendalela mundu kahochu kwa matakilu ghaki.<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />“Ngati anaujiweni ng'ombi au liponda laka adui waku jihobha, ujitolaje na kunkelabhukila mweni jaki. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />Anauliweni liponda laka mundu joakuhakalila hoju ahawiki na chibwahila chaki, unjangatyaje mundu hoju kwa kulijemeka liponda laki, wala ngawandeka panga kunjangatila.<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />“Pautemula matakilu ghaka mundu kahochu, utemulaje ngati moipalakila. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" />Ulijepaje kutali na matakilu gha upuhi, wala ngawankoma mundu jwangakubha na lihoku au mundu ndongwana, maghambu nepani nganambalangili kubha ngacheabhi na lihoku jola joabhi muhakau. <verse eid="EXO 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />Ngawijopa ngolukelu, maghambu ngolukelu heji jipojola mihu gha bhala bhabhalola, na kukotoka kutemula ngati moipalakila kwa bhandu bhambone.<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />“Ngamwambonela ngeni, maghambu mwehapa mabheti mmanyi ugheni moubhelela, kwa ndandi mwehapa mkabhili mwagheni ku inchi ja ku Misili.<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chaka cha saba na lichobha la saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />“Kwa chikahi cha hyaka sita anampandaje imbeju mu mighonda jinu na kuhuna mahunu ghaki, <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />nambu chaka cha saba ujilekaje mighonda jaku panga kupanda imbeju, nahuli akakahochu pachilanda ja bhandu bhangu bhapata kutondulakela chilebhi chechihighali monihomu, na hinyama ya muchitengu ikulaje. Utenda bhenibhela mu ngonda waku wa mizabibu na wa mizeituni.<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />“Kwa machobha sita anautendaje lihengu laku, nambu lichobha la saba ngawihenga lihengu, nahuli ng'ombi yaku na liponda laku ipata kupomulela, na mtumwa waku na bhatumika bha chigheni bhapataje kuhekalela.<verse eid="EXO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />“Ughakamulaje ghokapi ghanukupwaghile. Ngawilobha kwa mahina gha ichapanga yengi, wala ghanihagha ngaghijowaneka mundomu jaku.<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwangalalu itatu ikolongwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:18-26">Kubhoka 34:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-17">Kombukombu la Tolati 16:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />“Mala patatu kwa chaka undendilaje uwangalalu kwa kundopela nepani. <verse eid="EXO 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />Utendaje uwangalalu wa mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila, kwa machobha saba anaukulaje mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila ngati monukulaghalakile. Utendaje lijambu lenu kwa chikahi chechipangakiki mu mwehi wa Abibu, yani mwehi wa kachechi, kwa ndandi mu mwehi ghonihoghu mkabhokiki ku Misili. Mundu jokapi ngayihika palongi jangu kunyojabhela mabhoku matopu.<verse eid="EXO 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />“Utendaje uwangalalu wa mahunu gha kutumbula gha lihengu laku na mahunu gha mighonda jaku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:16">“Utendaje uwangalalu wa kubhongana mahunu mu ujomukelu wa chaka, chikahi pauhuna mahunu ghaku kuhuma mungonda. <verse eid="EXO 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />Mala patatu kwa chaka akanalomi bhokapi anabhalibhonganaje kujojabhela palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu.<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />“Pauchinja chinyama cha nyambiku mu uwangalalu yeniheyi, ngawimokeha papamu na libumunda lelibhili na amila. Wala ngawihighakila kughajocha mahuta gha chinyama cha nyambiku ya uwangalalu wangu mbaka lukela.<verse eid="EXO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />“Mahunu gha kutumbula gha ngonda waku unetilaje mu nyumba jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:19">“Ngawitutuha mwanalimbeleli au mwanambuhi kwa kutumila mahibha ghaka mabhu waki.<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilanga na malaghalakilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />“Lingalyaje, nepani nuntuma mtumika wa kunani kumahundi akulongulyaje palongi jaku akulendaje mwindela na kukuleta mbaka pandu panukulenganakile. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" />Njowanyaje na kuntii chela cheapwagha. Ngamwampenga, ndandi anamumpengike, jombi ngaandekakeli kumpenga kwinu, maghambu nuntumiki kwa lihina langu. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />Nambu ngati anankamwili chakaka chela cheapwagha na kuhenga ghokapi ghanaghalakila, panihapa nepani anangubha adui wa adui bhinu, na kubhapenga bhala bhabhumpenga mwehapa. <verse eid="EXO 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" />Mtumika wangu wa kunani kumahundi anaandongulyaje palongi jinu na kundeta mu inchi jebhatama Bhaamoli, Bhahiti, Bhapelizi, Bhakanaani, Bhahivi na Bhayebusi, na nepani ananabhayonangaje bhanihabha bhokapi. <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />Ngamwaichikamila ichapanga yabhu, wala kuijojabhela, wala kujengalela ntetu wabhu. Nambu mwiyonangaje ichapanga yabhu, na mtunyulanaje nguzu ya maganga ghabhu hipandi hipandi. <verse eid="EXO 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" />Ngati anamnyojabhela nepani Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, nepani ananumpengalyaje kwa chilebhi na machi na kundenda mwehapa ngamwilwala pachilanda jabhu, <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />na njeta mbomba joanayonangaje chitumbu wala joanaakubhaje ngulumba mu inchi jaku. Nepani ananukupekyaje matamu malachu.<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />“Ananabhatendaje bhandu bhokapi bhabhunhakalila mwehapa bhunjoghupaje. Ananabhayonguhaje malangu gha bhandu bhankomana nabhu. Na ananabhatendaje bhala bhamkomana nabhu bhang'anambukaje na kutila. <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />Nanatu anambelakaje manyiwa palongi jaku ghabhatopulaje Bhahivi, Bhakanaani na Bhahiti bhabhokaje palongi jaku. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" />Nambu nganabhatopoli bhandu bhanihabha kwa chaka chimu, kwa ndandi anandendiki bhenibhela inchi anajihighalya ukebha na hinyama ya muchitengu anaikubhaje yamaheli namaa kwaku. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />Ananabhatopulaje pachoku pachoku mbaka mwehapa pamwikubhaje njonjukiki na kujaghanila mu inchi jeniheji. <verse eid="EXO 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" />Malindakilu gha inchi jinu anaghakubhaje kuhuma ku Bahali ja Shamu mbaka ku Bahali ja Meditelania, na kutumbula kulipololu mbaka ku Nkoka Eufulati. Maghambu ananabhabhekaje bhandu bhabhatama mu inchi yeniheyi pahi ja lujiniku lwaku, na wehapa anawatopulaje bhabhokaje palongi jaku. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />Ngamwitenda lulaghilu papamu nabhu, wala papamu na ichapanga yabhu. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" />Ngamwaleka bhatamaje mu inchi jinu ngabhihika kuntenda mndendilaje mahoku nepani, maghambu ngati anamuijengalili ichapanga yabhu, chakaka anaikubha chimbenda kwinu cha kunkamula.”<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhabheka lulaghilu na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Mkwelaje panani ja chitombi changu, wehapa na Haluni, Nadabu na Abihu, papamu na bhazee sabini bha Izilaeli. Munyojabyaje kwa kutali, <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />nambu wa Musa kanjika jaku unheghalyaje pambipi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, nambu bhajaku ngabhihika pambipi. Na Bhaizilaeli ngabhikwela pachitombi papamu na wehapa.”<verse eid="EXO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Musa paakapiti kubhapwaghila bhandu mambu ghokapi na shelia yokapi yaka Bambo Chapanga, bhakajetakili kwa sauti jimu, “Kila chindu cheapwaghiki Bambo Chapanga anatuhengaje.” <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Musa akalembiki kila chindu Bambo Chapanga cheakabhi apwaghike. Akajumwiki chilabhu jaki lukela pachibhombu na kuchenga pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku pachitumbula chitombi na kujemeka nguzu komi na ibheli ya maganga kumanyiha makabila komi na ghabheli gha Izilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />Bhela Musa akabhatumiki akakombu bha Bhaizilaeli, bhakumbokihaje nyambiku ja kujochakeka na kuchinja mapongu gha ng'ombi kubha nyambiku ja lukwali kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Musa akatoliki nusu ja mwahi wa hinyama yela na kuubheka mu mabakuli na nusu jengi ja mwahi akaumichiki panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Panihapa akachitoliki chitabu cha lulaghilu chela na kubhasomela bhandu. Nabhombi bhakayangiki, “Anatutendaje kila chindu cheapwaghiki Bambo Chapanga, na tepani anatukubha bhatii kwaki.”<verse eid="EXO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" />Bhela Musa akatoliki mwahi ghola, akamichiki panani ja bhandu, akapwaghaje, “Ghongoni nde mwahi ghoulangiha kubha mwehapa njetakili lulaghilu loatendiki Bambo Chapanga na mwehapa kulengana na malobhi aghagha ghokapi.”<verse eid="EXO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Panihapa Musa na Haluni, Nadabu na Abihu, papamu na bhazee sabini bha Izilaeli bhakakweliki pachitombi, <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" />nabhombi bhakumbweni Chapanga wa Izilaeli. Pahi ja magholu ghaki pakabhili na chindu ngati lubhanja lwa maganga gha yakuti samawi, ghaghabhili manyahi ngati lianga moling'anyila. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" />Nambu Chapanga ngacheakabhayoningi ihongozi bha Izilaeli habha. Bhakumbweni Chapanga, nabhombi bhakakuliki na kunywa.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa pa Chitombi Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ukwelaje uhika kwangu kunani kuchitombi na utama pambane, nanatu ananukupekyaje hibau ya maganga, yeibhili na shelia na amuli yenembiki nahuli kubhabhola bhandu.” <verse eid="EXO 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" />Panihapa Musa akabhokiki papamu na Yoshua, joakabhi anjangatila, najombi Musa akakweliki kunani ku chitombi chaka Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Musa akabhapwaghili bhazee bha Izilaeli, “Mtulendalyaje pambane mbaka patwikelabhukaje kwinu. Haluni na Huli bhabhili papamu na mwehapa, na kila joabhili na lijambu ajendaje kwa bhanihabha.”<verse eid="EXO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15" />Bhela Musa akakweliki pachitombi cha Sinai, na lihundi likachiyekiki chitombi hechi. <verse eid="EXO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16" />Na ulumbalilu waka Bambo Chapanga ukabhili panani ja Chitombi cha Sinai. Kwa chikahi cha machobha sita lihundi likachiyekiki chitombi, na lichobha la saba Bambo Chapanga akundohiki Musa kuhuma pachilanda ja lihundi heli. <verse eid="EXO 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" />Ulumbalilu waka Bambo Chapanga ukabhonakini palongi ja mihu gha bhandu bha Izilaeli ngati moto ghoubhelela panani ja chitombi. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Musa akajingili mkati ja lihundi lela, paakabhili akwela pachitombi. Akatemi konihoku chikahi cha machobha alobaini, muhi na kilu.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s">Nhupu kwa ndandi ja Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 35:4-9">Kubhoka 35:4-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" />“Ubhapwaghilaje Bhaizilaeli bhanetilaje nhupu. Anyopilaje nhupu yangu kuhuma kwaka mundu jokapi joanaabhohaje kwa mtima wa upalu. <verse eid="EXO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />Unyopilaje nhupu yenjenu, zahabu, madini gha feza na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />nyuzi ya langi ya buluu, ya zambalau, na ya langi jikeli, papamu na ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, na ingobhu jejilenganakiki kwa mangoma gha imbuhi, <verse eid="EXO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />ingumba ya mambeleli makambaku yeijeghaliki langi jikeli, na ingumba ya hinyama ya mumachi, mbau ya nkongu ghoulowakeka mshita, <verse eid="EXO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />mahuta gha mzeituni kwa ndandi ja taa, hiungu kwa ndandi ja mahuta gha kupaka, na kwa ndandi ja uvumba ghounungila wichu, <verse eid="EXO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" />na maganga gha mbija yamaheli ghaghalowakeka shohamu, na maganga ghangi gha mbija yamaheli kwa ndandi ja mapambu gha chizibau chaka mpenganyambiku na mfuku wa pachihimba. <verse eid="EXO 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" />Ubhapwaghilaje bhandu bhalenganakyaje lihema lihuhu kwa ndandi jangu, nahuli nepani nhweza kutama pachilanda jabhu. <verse eid="EXO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />Lenganakya lihema heli na hindu yaki kulengana na uwananganu ghonakulangihaje.<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lisanduku la Lulaghilu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 37:1-9">Kubhoka 37:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />“Ubhapwaghilaje Bhaizilaeli bhanenganakyaje Lisanduku la mbau ya mshita, lelibhili na ulachu wa sentimita mia moja na komi, upana wa sentimita sitini na sita, na kimu cha sentimita sitini na sita. <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Na wehapa uliyekalyaje lisanduku heli kwa zahabu jinyahi mkati na kunja, na kulenganakela ukengu wa zahabu ipambala yokapi. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Wilenganakyaje peti nchechi ya zahabu na kuiwatika mu magholu ghaki, kila chigholu peti jimu. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />Panihapa anaulenganakya mipeku jilachu ja mshita na kujiyeka kwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />Wijingihaje mipeku heji mu peti yeibhili ipambala ibheli ya lisanduku nahuli kulitotola. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" />Mipeku heji anajihighalyaje mu peti ya lisanduku heli, ngajibhohakeka. <verse eid="EXO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />Mkati ja lisanduku la lulaghilu heli wibhekaje hibau ibheli ya maganga yenakupektaje yeilembakiki amuli yangu.<verse eid="EXO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" />“Bhela ulenganakyaje chifuniku chechilowakeka chitehu cha chiha cha zahabu jinyahi, ulachu waki ukubhaje sentimita mia moja na komi, na upana waki sentimita sitini na sita. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />Na ulenganakyaje ulenganesu wa ihumbi ibheli yeibhi na mapapanila yeilowakeka makelubi kwa zahabu jejigholulike, na kughabheka pa ujomukelu ubheli wa chifuniku hechi. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />Ubhekaje kelubi jumu upambala ghumu na jongi upambala ghongi, na ughalombanishaje makelubi hagha kubha chindu chimu na chifuniku cha chiha hechi, jumu akoku na jongi akoku. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />Makelubi hagha ghalingalanyaje, na mapapanilu ghabhu ghahatambuliwaje kunani, na nhwili wabhu uyekalyaje pa chifuniku hechi. Pamihu jabhu pajinamyaje pa chifuniku cha lisanduku heli. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />Mkati ja lisanduku wibhekaje hibau ibheli ya maganga na kuchibheka chifuniku cha chiha panani jaki. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" />Nepani ananhimangana na wehapa panihapa, pandu pa chiha pachilanda ja makelubi ghabheli hagha ghaghabhili panani ja chifuniku cha Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, ananongila na wehapa na kukupekeha shelia yangu yokapi kwa ndandi ja Bhaizilaeli.<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meza ja kubhekela mabumunda ghaghabhekakiki palongi jaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 37:10-16">Kubhoka 37:10-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />“Ulenganakya meza kwa mbau ya nkongu wa mshita jejibhili na ulachu wa sentimita semanini na nane, na upana wa sentimita alobaini na ncheche, na kimu cha sentimita sitini na sita. <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Ujiyekaje meza heji kwa zahabu jinyahi na kujiyongoloha na ukengu wa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />Bhela ulenganakyaje ukengu wa ubau wa zahabu na kuyongoloha upambala wokapi, ghoubhili na upana wa milimita sabini na nhwanu. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />Lenganakya peti nchechi ya zahabu kwa ndandi ja meza heji, ukongaje mu ipambala nchechi, mu magholu nchechi hagha. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Peti heyi anaikubhaje pambipi na ukengu ghola wa kujiyongolota meza na anaikubhaje ya kujingakila mipeku ja kujitotulela meza heji. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />Uhongulaje mipeku ja nkongu wa mshita, ujiyekaje zahabu, mipeku heji anajikubhaje ja kutotulela meza heji. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Lenganakyaje mbali na hikombi ya kubhekela ubani pameza, papamu na bilika na bakuli ya kujeghalela nhupu ya hindu ya kunywa. Lenganakyaje yombu yokapi heyi kwa zahabu jinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" />Panani ja meza ubhekaje mabumunda ghala ghawamokihe. Mabumunda hagha ghahighalyaje panihapa palongi jangu machobha ghokapi.<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinala cha taa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 37:17-24">Kubhoka 37:17-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />“Lenganakyaje chinala taa kwa zahabu jinyahi. Chitamilu chaki na ufitu wa chindu cha kubhekela taa hechi anaikubhaje chindu chimu, bhelabhela na ingonyu yaki, na lihundwa laki, ilenganaje na malobha ghaki, yokapi anailenganikikaje kwa zahabu na kubha chindu chimu. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Mambandi sita anaghapitalyaje mu upambala wa ufitu waki, mambandi ghatatu upambala ghumu na mambandi ghatatu upambala ghongi. <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />Kila limbandi analikubhaje na ingonyu itatu yeilengana na malobha gha mlozi, kila chimu na lihundwa laki na lilobha laki. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Mu ufitu hoghu kukubhaje na ingonyu nchechi yeilengana na malobha gha mlozi, papamu na mahundwa ghaki na malobha ghaki. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Kila pandu paghapitalila mambandi ghabheli pachilanda ja mambandi sita ghala, anapakubhaje na lihundwa limu lelilombanishwi na ufitu wa chindu cha kubhekela taa heji. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Mahundwa ghanihagha na mambandi ghaki anaghakubhaje chindu chimu na chinala cha taa hechi, na chokapi anachilenganikiwaje kwa zahabu jinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" />Bhela lenganakyaje taa saba ubhekaje panani ja chinala cha taa hechi nahuli iwezaje kumulika palongi jaki. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />Mikasi ja kulenganakela utambi na mbali yake, ikubhaje yeilenganakiki kwa zahabu jinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />Utumilaje kilu selasini na nhwanu ya zahabu jinyahi, kulenganakela chinala cha taa hechi papamu na hindu yaki yokapi. <verse eid="EXO 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" />Lingalyaje, ulenganakyaje chindu cha kubhekela taa hechi ngati chelachela monukulangihe pachitombi pala.<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s">Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 36:8-38">Kubhoka 36:8-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />“Ulenganakyaje lihema kwa mapazia komi gha ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu jejilokakiki wichu na uzi wa langi ja buluu, zambalau na langi jikeli, na kulokakeka wichu picha ya makelubi mu mapazia hagha. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Kila lipazia analikubhaje na ulachu wa mita komi na ibheli, na upana wa mita ibheli. Mapazia ghanihagha ghakubhaje na chipemu chimu. <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />Ulombanishaje mapazia nhwanu ghakubhaje lipazia limu, na ulombanishaje mapazia nhwanu ghangi ghala ghakubhaje lipazia limu. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" />Lenganakyaje ikamulilu ya chitambala cha buluu mu ujomukelu wa lipazia la kujomukela la chipandi cha kutumbula, kabheti chipandi cha ujomukelu cha lipazia la kabheli utendaje bhelabhela. <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />Ubhekaje hikamulilu hamsini mu lipazia la kujomulela la chipandi cha kutumbula na hikamulilu hamsini yengi mu lipanzia la kujomulela la chipandi cha kabheli, hikamulilu yokapi ilingalanyaje. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Bhela ulenganakyaje ifungu hamsini ya zahabu nahuli kuhuta mapazia papamu na kutenda lihema kubha limu.<verse eid="EXO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />“Lenganakyaje mapazia komi na jimu kwa mangoma gha imbuhi kwa ndandi ja kuliyekalela lihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Kila lipazia analikubhaje na ulachu wa mita komi na itatu, na upana wa mita ibheli. Mapazia ghokapi komi na jimu hagha ghakubhaje na chipemu chimu. <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />Ughalombaje mapazia nhwanu papamu, na mapazia sita papamu. Lipazia la sita lela ulikunjaje mala pabheli palongi ja lihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Ulenganakyaje hikamulilu hamsini mu ujomukelu wa lipazia la kujomulela la chipandi cha kutumbula, na hikamulilu hamsini mu ujomukelu wa lipazia la chipandi cha kabheli. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />Bhela ulenganakyaje ifungu hamsini ya shaba, na kuibheka mu hikamulilu hamsini yela nahuli kulombanesha hipandi ibheli ya mapazia yela na kutenda kubha lipazia limu la lihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />Na nusu ja chipandi cha lipazia chela chechihighalalili uchijenjihaje upambala wa kunyuma wa lihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Mapazia gha lihema anaghakubhaje na ulachu wa mita jimu nakanope ipambala yokapi, pandu papihighalyaje anapajenjalaje ipambala yokapi ya lihema nahuli kulihyeka.<verse eid="EXO 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />“Lenganakyaje chifuniku cha lihema kwa hingumba ya mambeleli makambaku chechijeghaliki langi jikeli, panani ja chifuniku hechi uyekalyaje ingumba ya hinyama ya mumachi.<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />“Ulenganakyaje nguzu ya nkongu wa mshita, kwa ndandi ja kujemakela lihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />Kila nguzu anajikubhaje na ulachu wa mita ncheche, na upana wa sentimita sitini na sita. <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />Kila nguzu anajikubhaje na pandu pabheli papapitalile, kwa ndandi ja kuilombanesha. Bhenibhela nde nguzu yokapi ya lihema moipalakila kulenganakeka. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18" />Bhela ulenganakya nguzu ishilini ya upambala wa kunkachi wa lihema, <verse eid="EXO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19" />na hitamilu yaki alobaini ya madini gha feza ya kubheka pahi ja nguzu, hitamilu ibheli kwa kila nguzu jimu, nahuli kukamulakila pandu pabheli papapitalile. <verse eid="EXO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20" />Upambala wa kungondi wa lihema, lenganakyaje nguzu ishilini, <verse eid="EXO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21" />na hitamilu yaki alobaini ya madini gha feza ya kubheka pahi ja nguzu, hitamilu ibheli kwa kila nguzu jimu. <verse eid="EXO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />Lenganakyaje nguzu sita kwa kila ujomukelu, upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa Lihema, <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />bhelabhela ulenganakya nguzu ibheli na kuijemeka mu kona ja lihema upambala wa kunyuma. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />Nguzu ibheli heyi ipalika ilombanishwaje kutumbula pahi, na kwa panani ilombanishwaje mu peti jimu ja kutumbula, na yokapi ibheli ilenganaje. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Bhela anakukubhaje na nguzu nane na hitamilu komi na sita ya madini gha feza, ibheli pahi ja kila nguzu.<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />“Ulenganakyaje mipengu ja nkongu wa mshita, nhwanu kwa ndandi ja nguzu ya upambala ghumu wa lihema, <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />na nhwanu kwa ndandi ja nguzu ya upambala ghongi, na nhwanu kwa ndandi ja nguzu ya upambala wa kunyuma ja Lihema, kolijibhila lyobha. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Lenganakyaje mpengu wa pachilanda upitalyaje kuhuma ujomukelu ghongoni mbaka ujomukelu ghongi pachilanda ja mapali. <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Yekalyaje mapali ghanihagha kwa zahabu, kabheti ulenganakyaje peti ya zahabu yeanaikamulyaje mipengu heji. Kabheti yekalyaje mipengu heji kwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />Lenganakyaje Lihema heli kwa uwananganu ghonukulangihe panani pachitombi.<verse eid="EXO 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />“Ulenganakyaje lipazia la ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, jejilokakiki wichu kwa uzi wa langi ja buluu, zambalau na langi jikeli, na kulokakeka wichu picha ya makelubi mu lipazia heli. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Panihapa ulijenjihaje lipazia mu mapali nchechi gha nkongu wa mshita ghaghayekaliwi kwa zahabu, ikobhakelu yaki anaikubhaje ya zahabu, ikabya ijemikwi mu hitamilu nchechi ya madini gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" />Ulijenjihaje lipazia heli mu ikobhakelu heyi, nanau uletaje Lisanduku la Lulaghilu lela na mkati jaki kukabya na hibau ibheli ya maganga, kunyuma ja lipanzia heli. Lipazia heli analilekanishaje Pandu Pahuhu na Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi. <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" />Na wehapa anaubhekaje chifuniku cha chiha panani ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu mkati ja Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi pala. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />Ubhekaje meza kunja ja lipazia upambala wa kungonde wa Lihema, jilingalanyaje na chinala cha taa upambala wa kunkache wa Lihema.<verse eid="EXO 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />“Pundyangu wa lihema ulenganakyaje lipazia la ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, lelilokakiki wichu kwa uzi wa langi ja buluu, zambalau, na wa langi jikeli. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />Bhelabhela ulenganakyaje mapali nhwanu gha nkongu wa mshita na kughayeka kwa zahabu. Mapali ghanihagha anaghakubhaje na ikamulakilu ya zahabu, na kila limu analikubhaje na chitamilu chimu cha shaba.<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s">Kulenganakela pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku kwa nkongu wa mshita</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 38:1-7">Kubhoka 38:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />“Ulenganakyaje pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku kwa mbau ya nkongu wa mshita, pakubhaje papalengana ipambala yokapi, ulachu waki mita ibheli na lobu, na upana waki mita ibheli na lobu, kimu chaki chikubhaje mita jimu na lobu. <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" />Ulenganakyaje manyelu ncheche mu kona yaki ncheche, manyelu ghanihagha anaghakubhaje chindu chimu na pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku hapa. Na wehapa upayekaje pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku hapa kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />Lenganakyaje hindu yokapi kwa shaba, yombu ya kubhokeha ilihu, na yoma yaki ya kubhokeha ilihu, na mabakuli ghaki gha kumichila, yoma ya kujochela inyama, na imbani ya kujokulela moto. Hindu heyi yokapi ulenganakyaje kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Bhela ulenganakyaje waya wa shaba ghoubhili na peti nchechi ya shaba, na kujingiha pahi ja ukengu mbaka pachilanda ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />Ubhekaje waya hoghu mu ukengu wa pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku hapa, nahuli waya hoghu uhikilaje pachilanda ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku hapa. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />Lenganakyaje mipeku ja nkongu mshita kwa ndandi ja kutotulela pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku hapa, na ujiyekaje kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />Mipeku jeniheji ujingihaje mu peti yela yeibhili mu kila upambala wa pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, nahuli kulitotola. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />Lenganakyaje pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku hapa kwa mbau, na kukubhaje na mbekenyu mkati jaki, kubhokana na uwananganu ghonukulangihe pachitombi.<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liwangala la Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 38:9-20">Kubhoka 38:9-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />“Ulenganakyaje liwangala kwa ndandi ya Lihema Lihuhu. Upambala wa kunkachi wa liwangala anakukubhaje na mapazia ghaghalenganakiwi kwa ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, ambaju anajikubhaje na ulachu wa mita alobaini na nchechi kwa upambala ghumu, <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />mapazia ghanihagha ghakobhakikaje mu mapali ishilini na hitamilu ishilini ya shaba. Kabhate anakukubhaje na ifungu ya madini gha feza na ikamulakilu ya madini gha feza panani ja mapali ghanihagha. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Upambala wa kungondi, ulachu wa mapazia anaukubhaje mita alobaini na nchechi, na mapali ishilini gha shaba, na hitamilu ishilini ya shaba, nambu ifungu ya mapali na hikamulilu yaki anaikubhaje ya madini gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />Na upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa lihema la kuhimanganila anakukubhaje na mapazia ghaghabhili na ulachu wa mita ishilini na ibheli, na mapali ghaki komi na hitamilu yaki komi. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Upambala wa kolipita lyobha, koubhili ndyangu wa lihema la kuhimanganila anakukubhaje na upana wa mita ishilini na ibheli. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14" />Lipazia la upambala ghumu wa ndyangu analikubhaje na upana wa mita sita na nusu, papamu na mapali ghatatu na hitamilu yaki itatu. <verse eid="EXO 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15" />Bhelabhela mu upambala wa kabheli wa ndyangu anakukubhaje na mapazia ghaghabhili na upana wa mita sita na nusu papamu na mapali ghaki ghatatu na hitamilu yaki itatu. <verse eid="EXO 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />Pundyangu wa liwangala heli anapakubhaje na lipazia lelibhili na ulachu wa mita tisa, lelilokakiki kwa uzi wa langi ja buluu, zambalau na jikeli, papamu na ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu jejilokakiki wichu. Lipazia heli analikamuliwaje na mapali nchechi na hitamilu nchechi. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Mapali ghokapi ghaghayongolota Lihema Lihuhu analikubhaje na fitu na ifungu ya madini gha feza, na hitamilu ya shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Lihema Lihuhu analikubhaje na ulachu wa mita alobaini na nchechi, upana waki mita ishilini na ibheli, na kimu chaki mita ibheli na nusu. Mapazia ghaki anaghakubhaje gha ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, na hitamilu yaki ya shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Hindu yokapi ya lihema lihuhu yeitumika mu kila ntundu, papamu na higingi yokapi ya liwangala heli anaikubhaje ya shaba.<verse eid="EXO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntundu wa kujighoha taa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 24:1-4">Bhalawi 24:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />“Ubhalaghalakyaje Bhaizilaeli bhakuletilaje mahuta manyahi gha zeituni ghaghajenguliwi kwa ndandi ja kupambakila taa, nahuli kujitenda taa jela jibhelalaje chikahi chokapi. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" />Mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu, kunja ja lipazia lelibhili palongi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, Haluni na bhana bhaki anabhapambakyaje taa heji nahuli jibhelalaje kutumbula pakamihi mbaka lukela palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga. Lilaghalakilu lenu lipalika lijengaliwaje chikahi chokapi na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi kwa ibheleku yokapi yeihika.<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s">Ingobhu ya kipenganyambiku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 39:1-7">Kubhoka 39:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />“Nanau wa Musa, untola Haluni ndongu waku joaletakiki kwaku kuhuma pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli, papamu na bhana bhaki, Nadabu na Abihu na Eleazali na Itamali, nahuli bhandumakyaje mu lihengu la upenganyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" />Undokila Haluni mbeli waku ingobhu ihuhu ya kipenganyambiku, nahuli yumpekya lujiniku na utopelu. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" />Na wehapa ubhapwaghilaje akafunde bhabhaloka wichu, bhala bhanabhapekihi umanyi, bhundokilaje Haluni ingobhu, nahuli abhohakikaje na kundumakila nepani ngati mpenganyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />Yenjenu nde ingobhu yeanabhalokaje, chifuku cha pachihimba, chizibau, likanzu, likanzu lelilokakiki wichu, mbumbu na lughoji. Ingobhu heyi anaalokiwaje ndongu waku Haluni na bhana bhaki nahuli bhandumakya nepani ngati bhapenganyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />Bhalokaje ingobhu ya langi ja buluu, zambalau, na langi ikeli papamu na ingowu jinyahi jihuhu, kwa kutumila uzi wa langi ja zahabu.”<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />“Lenganakyaje chizibau cha ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, uchilenganakyaje kwa langi ja buluu, na zambalau, na langi jikeli, jejilokakiki wichu na fundi kwa kutumila uzi wa langi ja zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />Chikubhaje na mighoji jibheli ja mumabhegha yeilombaniki pandu pabheli mu makeghi ja chizibau nahuli kukongela chizibahu hechi. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Lughoji lwa muchibhunu lolulenganakiwi wichu ambalu nde chindu chimu na chizibahu, ulenganakyaje kwa langi ja buluu, na zambalau, na langi jikeli, jejilokakiki wichu na fundi kwa kutumila uzi wa langi ja zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9" />Tolaje maganga ghabheli gha shohamu na ulembaje panani jaki mahina komi na ghabheli gha bhana bha Izilaeli, <verse eid="EXO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10" />mahina sita mu liganga la kutumbula, na mahina sita ghaghahighalili mu liganga la kabheli, mahina ghajengalanyaje kubhokana na kubhelakeka kwabhu. <verse eid="EXO 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11" />Ughalemba mahina gha bhana bha chikambaku bha Izilaeli panani ja maganga ghabheli hagha ngati bhela fundi sonala moahongulela muhuli. Bhela ughabhekaje maganga ghanihagha mu hikamulakilu ya zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12" />Maganga ghabheli hagha ghabhekakikaje panani ja mighoji jibheli ja chizibahu ngati ukombukelu wa makabila komi na ghabheli gha Izilaeli. Haluni anawataje mahina ghanihagha mumabhegha ghaki ngati ukombukelu palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13" />Lenganakyaje hikamulakilu ibheli ya zahabu, <verse eid="EXO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14" />na mikufu jibheli ja zahabu jinyahi, jejilokakiki ngati ngoji, na ujikongaye mikufu heji mu hikamulakilu.”<verse eid="EXO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chifuku cha pachihimba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 39:8-21">Kubhoka 39:8-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" />“Lenganakyaje chifuku cha pachihimba cha kutemulila, lenganakyaje wichu ngati chizibau chela, uchilenganakyaje kwa nyuzi ja langi ja buluu, na zambalau, na langi jikeli, na ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, jejilokakiki wichu na fundi kwa kutumila uzi wa langi ja zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />Chifuku chechikunjakiki hechi, anachikubhaje na ipambala nchechi yeilengana ya sentimita ishilini na ibheli, ulachu waki na upana waki ilenganaje. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />Bhela ubhekaje misitali nchechi ja maganga gha mbija yamaheli. Msitali wa kutumbula ubhekaje maganga gha akiki, topazi na alumasi jikeli. <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />Msitali wa kabheli ubhekaje maganga gha zumalidi, yakuti samawi na alumasi. <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />Msitali wa katatu ubhekaje maganga gha hiakinto, na akiki jikeli na amesisto. <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />Msitali wa kachechi ubhekaje maganga gha zabalajadi, shohamu, na yasipi. Maganga ghanihagha ghokapi ughabhekaje mu hikamulakilu ya zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Panihapa anapakubhaje na maganga komi na ghabheli, na kila liganga analikubhaje lilembakiki lihina limu laka mwana jumu waka Izilaeli. Kila lihina lakalembakiki kwa kuchola ngati muhuli, nahuli kughamanyiha makabila komi na ghabheli gha Izilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22" />Kwa ndandi ja chifuku cha pachihimba hechi, ulenganakyaje mikufu ja zahabu jinyahi, jejilokakiki ngati ngoji. <verse eid="EXO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23" />Bhelabhela ulenganakyaje peti ibheli ya zahabu kwa ndandi ja chifuku cha pachihimba na kujibheka mu kona ibheli ya chifuku hechi. <verse eid="EXO 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24" />Ukongaje mikufu jibheli ja zahabu heji mu peti ibheli yela yeibhili mu kona ya chifuku cha pachihimba. <verse eid="EXO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25" />Ujomukelu ghongi wa mikufu jibheli ja zahabu jela ulombanishaje mighoji heji mu hikamulakilu ibheli yela ya chizibau upambala wa palongi. <verse eid="EXO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />Lenganakyaje peti ibheli ya zahabu wikongaje mu kona ibheli ya pahi upambala wa mkati wa chifuku cha pachihimba pambipi na chizibau. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />Bhela ulenganakyaje peti yengi ibheli ya zahabu na kuijeghela palongi mu kona ya pahi ya hipandi ya chizibau, pandu chizibau pachilombana na ulamba ghoulokakiki kwa unyahi. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Chifuku cha pachihimba anachikongakikaje pa chizibau kwa kulombanesha peti yaki na chizibau kwa ngoji wa langi ja buluu, nahuli chifuku hechi cha pachihimba ngachileghaleka nambu chitamilaje ulamba ghoulokakiki wichu.”<verse eid="EXO 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" />“Chikahi chokapi Haluni pajingila Pandu Pahuhu, anawataje pachihimba jaki chizibau chela cha kutemulila chechilembakiki mahina gha makabila gha bhana bha chikambaku bha Izilaeli, kwa kutenda bhenibhela nepani Bambo Chapanga ananabhakombukaje bhandu bhangu mileli. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" />Ubhekaje hindu yeilowakeka Ulimu na Sumimu pa chifuku cha pachihimba, ghakubhaje pachihimba chaka Haluni kila pajingila palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga. Bhela machobha ghokapi Haluni anakubhaje na uwezu wa kutenda utemulo muntima waki kwa ndandi ja bhana bha Izilaeli palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ingobhu yengi ya kipenganyambiku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 39:22-31">Kubhoka 39:22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />“Ulokaje likanzu la kuwatila chizibau kwa chitambala cha langi ja buluu pela. <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />Pachilanda jaki ubhekaje mbekenyu ja kujingakiha mmutu, na mbekenyu heji jiyongalutwaje na upindo ghoulokakiki nahuli ngalikachuka. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Pa upindo wa pahi upambaje kwa hindu ngati makomamanga gha langi ja buluu, na zambalau, na gha langi jikeli kuyongolota munkeghi ja likanzu heli, anakukubhaje na mangengecha gha zahabu pachilanda ja makomamanga ghanihagha. <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />Komamanga na mangengecha gha zahabu, komamanga na mangengecha gha zahabu, kuliyongolota likanzu lokapi. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Haluni anaawataje likanzu heli kuhenga lihengu laki la upenganyambiku na sauti ja mangengecha ghanihagha anajijowanikaje chikahi pajingila Pandu Pahuhu palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, na paapita kunja, nahuli ngayipotela.”<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />“Lenganakyaje chibati cha zahabu jinyahi na kulemba panani jaki ngati mundu joabacha muhuli, ‘Mhuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga.’ <verse eid="EXO 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />Chibati hechi anauchikongaje palongi ja mbumbu kwa lughoji lwa langi ja buluu. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" />Haluni achiwataje chibati hechi pachibhongi chaki, na kwa chibati chenihechi Haluni anaatolaje mahoku ambaghu Bhaizilaeli bhaweza kubha bhaghahengike mu chikahi cha kumokeha nyambiku jihuhu, nahuli bhajetakaliwaje palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 28:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />“Undenganakyaje Haluni likanzu lelilenganakiki wichu kwa ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, na undenganakyaje mbumbu kwa ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu na luhunga lolulenganakiki wichu na mshona.”<verse eid="EXO 28:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" />“Lenganakyaje makanzu kwa ndandi ja bhana bhaka Haluni, na luhunga na kofia nahuli bhabhonikanaje bhabhili na lujiniku na unyahi. <verse eid="EXO 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" />Unhwatikaje ndongu waku Haluni na bhana bhaki ingobhu yenjenu, na bhela ubhajeghalaje mahuta gha zeituni, na kubhabheka kwa lihengu lihuhu. Ubhabhekaje palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga nahuli bhanhengilaje lihengu la upenganyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />Ubhalenganakyaje mabundulo manyahi mahuhu, nahuli kuhyekalela utopu wa hyegha yabhu, kutumbula mu chibhunu mbaka mu mapaja. <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />Haluni na bhana bhaki anabhawataje mabundulu ghanihagha kila pabhijingalaje mu Lihema Lihuhu, au pabhiheghalyaje pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku na kutenda lihengu la upenganyambiku mu Pandu Pahuhu. Kwa indela jeniheji ngabhilangihi utopu wabhu nahuli ngabhikomakeka. Jeniheji anajikubhaje amuli ja mileli kwaka Haluni na hibheleku yaki.<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s">Malaghalakilu gha kubhabheka kubha bhapenganyambiku Haluni na bhana bhaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 8:1-36">Bhalawi 8:1-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />“Ghangani nde mambu ghawantendilaje Haluni na bhana bhaki na kubhabheka palongi jangu nepani nahuli bhanhengilaje lihengu la upenganyambiku. Utolaje litoli likambaku na mambeleli makambaku ghabheli ghangakubha na chilema, <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" />na mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila, maandazi ghangakubha na amila ghaghahunyakiki kwa mahuta, na mabumunda mapepandau ghaghapakakiki mahuta, yeniheyi yokapi ulenganakyaje kwa uhembi unyahi wa ingano. <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />Ujeghalaje hilebhi yokapi heyi mkati ja chitonga na umokihaje papamu na litoli likambaku lela na mambeleli ghabheli makambaku ghala.<verse eid="EXO 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" />“Undetaje Haluni na bhana bhaki pundyangu wa pa Lihema Lihuhu na kubhagholola kwa machi. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />Panihapa utolaje ingobhu ya chipenganyambiku heyi na unhwatikaje Haluni, unhwatikaje likanzu, na lijoho, na chizibau, na chifuku cha pachihimba, na kunkonga luhunga lolulokakiki wichu. <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />Unhwatikaje mbumbu pamutu jaki na kuchibheka chibati cha zahabu chela, chikamulanaje na mbumbu heji. <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" />Bhela utolaje mahuta gha mzeituni, ujeghalaje panani ja mmutu waka Haluni nahuli kumbeka palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />“Panihapa ubhaletaje bhana bhaka Haluni na kubhawatika makanzu. <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />Ubhakongaje luhunga muibhunu, Haluni na bhana bhaki, na kubhawatika kofia yabhu. Bhenibhela nde moubhabhekilaje Haluni na bhana bhaki kubha bhapenganyambiku kwa kundumakila nepani machobha ghokapi. Kwa indela jeniheji anaubhatengaje Haluni na bhana bhaki kwa lihengu lihuhu.<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />“Uletaje litoli likambaku lela palongi ja Lihema Lihuhu. Haluni na bhana bhaki anabhabhekaje mabhoku ghabhu panani ja mmutu wa ng'ombi jeniheji. <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />Panihapa ulichinjaje ng'ombi heji palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga pundyangu wa pa Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />Witolaje pandu pa mwahi wa litoli heli na kuupaka mu manyelu gha pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku kwa lukonji lwaku, na mwahi ghouhighalile ujitalaje pahi ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" />Panihapa utolaje mahuta ghokapi gha litoli heli gha pandu pa mkati, ghaghayekalela imani na figo ibheli papamu na mahuta ghaki, ujochaje panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" />Nambu inyama ja litoli heli papamu na chingumba na matumbu ghaki utolaje na kujocha kwa moto kunja ja likambi. Jeniheji nde nyambiku ja kubhoha mahoku.<verse eid="EXO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" />“Utolaje limbeleli limu likambaku pachilanda ja mambeleli ghabheli ghala, na umpwaghila Haluni na bhana bhaki bhabhekaje mabhoku ghabhu panani ja mmutu wa limbeleli likambaku heli. <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />Uchinjaje limbeleli likambaku heli, na utolaje mwahi waki na kumicha ipambala yokapi ya pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />Ulihekataje limbeleli likambaku heli hipandi hipandi na ugholulaje matumbu ghaki na magholu ghaki, ubhekaje yokapi papamu na mmutu na hipandi yengi. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" />Panihapa ujochaje limbeleli lokapi panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku nahuli kubhoha nyambiku ja kujochakeka kwangu nepani Bambo Chapanga. Kunungila kunyahi kwa nyambiku jejijochakiki kwa moto heji anakunyambiha nepani Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />“Utolaje limbeleli lengi likambaku lela, najombi Haluni na bhana bhaki bhabhekaje mabhoku ghaghu panani ja mmutu wa limbeleli heli. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />Uchinjaje limbeleli heli, na utolaje pandu pa mwahi waki na kuupaka munkeghi ja makutu gha kumalelelu ghaka Haluni na bhana bhaki, mu ngonji ikolongwa ya mumabhoku ghabhu gha kumalelelu, kabheti mu ngonji ikolongwa ya mumagholu ghabhu gha kumalelelu. Na mwahi ghouhighili hoghu umichaje ipambala yokapi ya pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" />Kabheti utolaje pandu pa mwahi ghoubhili panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku na pandu pa mahuta gha mzeituni, ummichilaje Haluni na ingobhu yaki, bhelabhela ubhamichilaje bhana bhaka Haluni na ingobhu yabhu. Panihapa Haluni na bhana bhaki papamu na ingobhu yabhu anabhakubhaje tayali bhabhekakiki palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />“Panihapa utolaje mahuta gha limbeleli likambaku heli, mahuta gha nkela waki, mahuta ghaghayekalela matumbu na pandu panyahi pa imani, figo yaki ibheli na mahuta ghaki, papamu na lipaja la kumalelelu. Limbeleli heli analikubhaje kwa ndandi ja kubhabheka bhapenganyambiku palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />Kuhuma mu chitonga chela chechibhili na mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila, chechibhekakiki palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, utolaje libumunda limu, na liandazi limu lelijeghaliki mahuta na libumunda lipepandau limu. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />Hilebhi yokapi heyi umpekyaje Haluni na bhana bhaki nabhombi bhaikwehaje kunani na kuilangiha kubha nginyulila ja kumokeha nyambiku palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />Panihapa utolaje hindu heyi kuhuma mumabhoku ghabhu, ujochaje panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku papamu na nyambiku ja kuyochakeka, ikubhaje unungalilu unyahi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. Jeniheji nde nyambiku jejibhohakiki kwangu nepani Bambo Chapanga kwa moto.<verse eid="EXO 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />“Utolaje chidali cha limbeleli likambaku heli kwa ndandi ja kumbeka Haluni palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, uchikwehaje kunani palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga kubha nde nyambiku jihuhu, na chidali hechi anachikubha chako.<verse eid="EXO 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27" />“Mpenganyambiku pahimikwa kuntumakila Bambo Chapanga, chidali na lipaja la limbeleli likambaku lelitumika mu lihengu la kunhimika, anachikwehakikaje kunani palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga ngati nginyulila ja kumokeha nyambiku, lela lelakabhili kwa ndandi jaka Haluni na bhana bhaki. Inyama heji jokapi apekiwaje Haluni na bhana bhaki. <verse eid="EXO 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28" />Bhela, chikahi chokapi Bhaizilaeli anabhabhohaje pandu pa hindu yeniheyi mu nyambiku yabhu ya kutama kwa lukwale yebhamokeha nepani Bambo Chapanga, na kumpekeha Haluni na bhana bhaki. Jeniheji anajikubhaje nde nyambiku jabhu kwangu nepani Bambao Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />“Payipotilaje Haluni, ingobhu yaki ya kipenganyambiku anabhapekahiwaje bhana bhaki, nabhombi anabhawataje mu lichobha lela la kujeghalewa mahuta, na kubhekakeka kubha bhapenganyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Mwana waka Haluni joanakubhaje mpenganyambiku pandu paka tati waki anahwataje ingobhu heye machobha saba mu Lihema Lihuhu, nahuli atumikaje Pandu pa Pahuhu.<verse eid="EXO 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />“Utolaje inyama ya limbeleli likambaku heli la kubhekakeka palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga ujitelakaje mu Pandu Pahuhu. <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" />Pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu heli, Haluni na bhana bhaki anabhakulaje inyama ja limbeleli likambaku heli papamu na mabumunda ghala ghaghahighalili mu chitonga hechi. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" />Anabhakulaje hilebhi heyi yeibhohakiki kwa ndandi ja kubhahimika Haluni na bhana bhaki kwa ndandi ja lihengu langu, na kwa ndandi ja kubhatendela ujonganeshu, nambu mundu jongi ngacheapalika kula maghambu nde hindu ihuhu. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />Ngati inyama jokapi jela ja limbeleli likambaku heli au libumunda lokapi lela analihighalile mbaka lukela jaki, ujochaje kwa moto. Hilebhi heyi ngayileleka maghambu nde hindu ihuhu.<verse eid="EXO 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />“Anana nde mowabhatendilaje Haluni na bhana bhaki kubhokana na ghala ghokapi ghanukulaghalakile, na utumilaje machobha saba kwa lihengu la kubhahimika kubha bhapenganyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" />Kila lichobha anaubhohaje litoli likambaku kubha nyambiku ja kubhabhokeha bhandu mahoku ghabhu nahuli kutenda ujonganeshu. Na kwa kutenda bhenibhela anaupagholulaje pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, na wehapa wijeghalaje mahuta nahuli kupagholola. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" />Kwa machobha saba utendeje ugholuleku kwa ndandi ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku na kupabheka palongi jangu. Panihapa pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku hapa anapakubhaje pahuhu namaa, kila chindu cheanachigusaje pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku hapa anachikubhaje chihuhu.<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyambiku ya kila lichobha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 28:1-8">Hesabu 28:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />“Henu nyambiku yeanaubhohaje panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku kila lichobha nde yenjeno, bhanambeleli bhabheli bhabhabhili na chaka chimu. <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />Mwanambeleli jumu anaumboha nyambiku chikahi cha lukela na jongi pakamihi. <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />Papamu na mwanambeleli wa kutumbula, ubhohaje njipulila ghumu wa uhembi laini wa inganu ghouhangangini na lita jimu ja mahuta ghaghajenguliwi gha zeituni papamu na lita jimu ja divai kubha nyambiku ja kunywa. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" />Mwanambeleli jongi hoju umbohaje nyambiku chikahi cha pakamihi papamu na nyambiku ya uhembi na chakunywa ngati mowatendile lukela, unungilu unyahi wa nyambiku jejijochakiki kwa moto heji, anaunyambihaje nepani Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 29:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />Kwa hibheleku yokapi yeihika anaukubhaje ntetu kubhoha nyambiku heji ja kujochakeka kila chikahi pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga. Panihapa nde nepani panihimanganaje na mwehapa, nahuli kulongela na mwehapa. <verse eid="EXO 29:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" />Konihoku nde konihimanganaje na Bhaizilaeli, na Lihema Lihuhu heli analigholulikaje kwa ulumbalilu wangu. <verse eid="EXO 29:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />Lihema Lihuhu na pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ananitendaje kubha ihuhu, nanatu ananabhahimikaje Haluni na bhana bhaki nahuli bhandumakyaje ngati bhapenganyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 29:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" />Anandamaje pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli, na nepani anangubhaje Chapanga wabhu. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Nabhombi anabhamanyaje kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wabhu, nenabhabhohiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili nahuli mbataje kutenda matamu papamu na bhombi. Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wabhu.<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku la kuhukila ubani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 37:25-28">Kubhoka 37:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />“Lenganakyaje lisanduku kwa nkongu wa mshita kwa ndandi ja kuhukila ubani. <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />Lisanduku heli lilenganaje ipambala yokapi, ulachu na upana waki sentimita alobaini na nhwanu, na kimu chaki sentimita tisini. Manyelu ghaki anaghakubhaje chindu chimu na lisanduku heli. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />Na wehapa ulihyekaje lisanduku heli kwa zahabu jinyahi, upambala waki wa kunani, ipambala yaki yokapi ya muluteta na manyelu ghaki, kabheti uyongaluhaje ukengu wa zahabu munkeghi jaki. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Ulenganakyaje peti ibheli ya zahabu kwa ndandi ja lisanduku pahi paukeghi, yengi ibheli upambala wa kabheli nahuli kukamulila mipeku heji chikahi cha kulitotola. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />Mipeku heji jikubhaje ja mkongu wa mshita na ujiyekaje kwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Lisanduku heli ulibhekaje palongi ja lipazia paukeghi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, palongi ja chitehu cha chiha chechibhili panani ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, pandu panihapa nde panihimanganaje na wehapa. <verse eid="EXO 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />Kila lukela Haluni pajingila kuibheka wichu taa yeibhili panihapa, anahuwaje ubani ghoubhili na unungalilu unyahi panani ja lisanduku heli. <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />Impalika Haluni kuhuwa ubani chikahi cha pakamihi paapambakila taa. Nhupu ja ubani jenu anajihuwakikaje chikahi chokapi palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga kwa hibheleku hinu yokapi. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" />Ngawihuwa ubani wangakujetakalewa palongi jangu panani ja lisanduku heli ng'o, wala nyambiku yengi yokapi ya kujochakeka, wala nhupu ya uhembi, wala ngawijeghela nhupu ya kunywa panani jaki. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />Mala nunkamu kwa chaka Haluni anatendaje ugholuleku panani ja manyelu gha lisanduku heli. Ugholuleku hoghu wa chaka upalika utendakikaje kwa mwahi wa nyambiku ja ugholuleku kwa ndandi ja mahoku kwa hibheleku hinu yokapi. Nde jihuhu namaa kwangu nepani Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kode kwa ndandi ja Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" />“Pawikubhaje ubhabhalanga Bhaizilaeli, kila jumu analepaje mbija kwa ndandi ja kukengalela matamu ghaki palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, nahuli ngabhikubha na hitamu ihakau pachilanda jabhu chikahi cha kubhalangika. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13" />Kila jumu joanabhalangikaje anabhohaje nusu shekeli ja madini gha feza kulengana na ipemu yeitumika Pandu Pahuhu. Nhupu jeniheji amokeha nepani Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14" />Bhokapi bhala bhabhabhili na umule wa hyaka ishilini na kupetalela, anabhamokihaje nhupu jeniheji nepani Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" />Bhanahindu yamaheli na akakahochu, bhokapi anabhalepaje chipemu chelachela cha nusu shekeli cha madini gha feza, chikahi pabhilepaje mbija heji nahuli kughakengalela matamu ghabhu kwangu nepani Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />Wehapa anaujopaje mbija ja kughakengalela matamu ghabhu heji kuhuma kwa Bhaizilaeli, na wehapa ujitumilaje kwa ndandi ja lihengu la mu Lihema Lihuhu. Anajikubhaje nde ukombukelu kwa Bhaizilaeli palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, nahuli nepani naghakengalyaje matamu ghinu.”<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liteleku la shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />“Lenganakyaje liteleku la shaba, lelibhili na chitamilu cha shaba kwa ndandi ja kuchambila. Libhekaje pachilanda ja Lihema Lihuhu na pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ya kujochakeka, na ujeghalaje machi mkati jaki. <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" />Haluni na bhana bhaki anabhachambaje mabhoku na magholu ghabhu kwa machi ghaghabhi monihomu, <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20" />na chikahi chokapi mangani ja kujingila mu Lihema Lihuhu, anabhachambaje machi nahuli ngabhihika kupotela. Bhelabhela pabhiheghalyaje pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku nahuli kumokeha nepani Bambo Chapanga nyambiku jejijochakiki kwa moto. <verse eid="EXO 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21" />Anabhachambaje mabhoku na magholu ghabhu nahuli ngabhihika kupotela. Jenjenu anajikubhaje nde amuli ja mileli kwa ndandi jaka Haluni na bhana bhaki kwa hibheleku yokapi yeihika.”<verse eid="EXO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntundu wa kulenganakela mahuta gha mzeituni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23" />“Utolaje hiungu inyahi ngati yenjeno, manemane jibhei kilu sita, uhembi wa mdalasini ghounungila wichu kilu itatu, uhembi wa mikota jejinungila wichu kilu itatu, <verse eid="EXO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24" />na ntundu ghongi wa mdalasini ghoulowakeka kida kilu sita, hipemu yokapi heyi ikubhaje ya kulengana na hipemu ya Lihema Lihuhu. Bhelabhela utolaje lita nchechi ya mahuta gha zeituni. <verse eid="EXO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />Kubhokana na ihungu heyi ulenganakyaje mahuta mahuhu ughahangaghanaje ngati moatendela ndenganakela wa manungilu. Mahuta ghanihagha anaghatumikaje kwa ndandi ja kuibheka hindu yeitumika palongi jangu nepani. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" />Panihapa ulipakaje mahuta Lihema Lihuhu heli, na Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />meza na hindu yaki yokapi, chinala cha taa na hindu yaki, lisanduku la kuhuwila ubani, <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />lisanduku la kubhokeha nyambiku ja kujochakeka na hindu yaki yokapi, na liteleku la shaba papamu na chitamilu chaki. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />Waitendaje hindu yeniheyi kubha yangu nepani, nahuli ikubhaje ihuhu nakanopi, na kila cheanachigusaje hindu yeniheyi anachikubhaje chihuhu. <verse eid="EXO 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />Bhela ubhaghalaje mahuta Haluni na bhana bhaki, na kubhahimika palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga nahuli bhandumakyaje ngati bhapenganyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />Ubhapwaghilaje Bhaizilaeli, ‘Ghangani anaghakubhaje mahuta ghangu mahuhu gha kujeghalewa kwa hibheleku hinu yokapi. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Mahuta ghanihagha ngaunjeghela mundu jokapi jwangakupalika ng'o, wala ngaghilenganakeka mahuta ghangi gha ntundu ghoni. Nde mahuta mahuhu na ipalika mughabhonaje kubha nde mahuhu. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Mundu jokapi joanalenganakyaje mahuta ghaghalengana na aghagha, au kunjeghela mundu jwangakupalika kujeghalewa mahuta ghanihagha, mundu hoju anatengakikaje kutali na bhandu bhaki.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntundu wa kulenganakela ubani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Utolaje hiungu yeinungila wichi ngati yenjeno, ulibhalibha wa natafi, na ulibhalibha wa shekeleti, na ulibhalibha wa kelibena, hiungu yeinungila wichu na ubani unyahi, yokapi ikubhaje na chipemu chechilengana. <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />Tumilaje hindu heyi kulenganakela ubani ngati moulenganakewa na ndenganakela wa manungilu, ujeghalaje mwinyu nahuli upata kubha unyahi na uhuhu. <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />Uyaghaje hindu yeniheyi kubha uhembi laini na ubhekaje palongi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu, pandu panihimanganaje na wehapa. Ghonihoghu anaukubhaje ubani uhuhu nakanopi kwinu. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />Ngawilenganakela ubani naghongi wa ntundu aghogho kwa ndandi jinu mabhete. Mubhonaje kubha nde uhuhu kwangu nepani Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Mundu jokapi joanalenganakyaje ubani wa ntundu ghonihoghu nahuli kuhekalela unungilu waki unyahi, ipalika abhekakikaje kutali na bhandu bhaki.”<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s">Mafundi bha kulenganakela Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 35:30-36:1">Kubhoka 35:30-36:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" />“Nepani nunhawili Bezaleli, mwana waka Uri, nchokolu waka Huri, wa likabila laka Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" />nanatu nuntwelakili Roho wangu, na nuntendiki akubhaje na mbulau, uwezu, umanyi, na awezaje kuhenga mahengu gha kila ntundu, <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4" />nahuli abyaje funde mnyahi wa kulenganakela hindu ya zahabu, madini gha feza na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5" />numpekihi umanyi wa kuhongola maganga gha mbija yamaheli gha kupamba, na kuhenga ufunde kwa mbau, na umanyi wa kila ntundu wa ufunde. <verse eid="EXO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" />Bhelabhela nunhawili Oholiabu, mwana waka Ahisamaki, wa likabila laka Dani, nahuli kunjangatila. Na mafunde bhokapi nabhapekihi umanyi wa kutenda kila chindu chenukulaghalakile wehapa: <verse eid="EXO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />Bhalenganakyaje, Lihema Lihuhu na Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, papamu na chitehu cha chiha panani jaki, papamu na hindu yokapi ya Lihema, <verse eid="EXO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />meza na hindu yaki, chinala cha taa cha zahabu jinyahi na hindu yaki yokapi, na chihanja cha kuhuwila ubani, <verse eid="EXO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />lisanduku la kubhokeha nyambiku ja kujochakeka na hindu yaki yokapi, na liteleku la shaba na chitamilu chaki, <verse eid="EXO 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />papamu na ingobhu yeilokakiki wichu, na ingobhu ihuhu yaka mpenganyambiku Haluni, na ingobhu ya bhana bhaki yebhawata chikahi cha kutenda lihengu la upenganyambiku, <verse eid="EXO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />na mahuta gha mzeituni na ubani ghounungila wichu ghoutumika Pandu Pahuhu. Hindu heyi yokapi ilenganikiwaje wichu ngati bhela monukulaghalakile.”<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lichobha la Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="EXO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13" />“Ubhapwaghilaje Bhaizilaeli, ‘Mwehapa impalika muikamulaje Sabato yangu. Jenjenu anajikubhaje nginyulila pachilanda jangu nepani na mwehapa kwa ndandi ja hibheleku hinu yokapi yeihika, nahuli mpata kumanya kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, nenuntenda mwehapa kubha bhahuhu. <verse eid="EXO 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" />Mkamulaje Sabato, kwa ndandi nde jihuhu kwinu. Mundu jokapi joalijeghela uhakau lichobha heli ipalika akomakikeje, na mundu jokapi joanahengaje lihengu mu lichobha heli anatengakikaje kutali na bhandu bhaki. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Mtendaje lihengu kwa machobha sita, nambu lichobha la saba nde Sabato, lichobha la kupomulela, lihuhu kwangu nepani Bambo Chapanga. Mundu jokapi joanahengaje lihengu lokapi lela mu lichobha leniheli ipalika akomakikaje. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />Bhaizilaeli anabhajikamulaje Sabato, na kujihekalela kwa hibheleku yabhu yokapi yeihika kubha Lulaghilu lwa mileli. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Lijambu heli analikubhaje nginyulila pachilanda jangu nepani na Bhaizilaeli mileli, kwa ndandi kwa machobha sita nepani Bambo Chapanga nakabhombiki mbengu na ndema, na lichobha la saba nakakotwiki kuhenga lihengu, na kupomulela.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />Bambo Chapanga paakajomwili kulongela na Musa panani ja Chitombi cha Sinai, Chapanga akumpekihi hibau ibheli yeilembakiki Amuli, hibau ya maganga yeyalembakiki kwa lukonji lwaki mweni Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s">Chimong'umong'u cha litoli la zahabu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 9:6-29">Kombukombu la Tolati 9:6-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />Bhandu pabhakaweni kubha Musa akabhakili namaa kuhelela kuhuma kuchitombi, bhakalibhongini palongi jaka Haluni na kumpwaghila, “Hikaje utulenganakyaje ichapanga yutulonguhaje, maghambu ngachetumanyi lelumpatiki Musa hoju joatubhohiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" />Haluni akabhayangike, “Mtolaje ndolowa ya zahabu mu makutu gha akabhahanu bhinu, bhana bhinu bha chikambaku na akakamwali bhinu, na mnetilaje.” <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Bhela bhandu bhokapi bhakabhohiki ndolowa yokapi ya zahabu mu makutu ghabhu, na kundetela Haluni. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" />Najombi akaitoliki na kuiyeyusha, akalenganakili litoli la chikambaku la zahabu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 32:4">Bhakapwaghiki kwa sauti, “Wenga wa Izilaeli, jonjoni nde chapanga witu joatubhohiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Haluni paakaweni lijambu leniheli, akachengiki pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku palongi ja litoli lela na kutangaza, “Chilabhu anakukubhaje na uwangalalu kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="EXO 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" />Chilabhu jaki bhandu bhakajumwiki lukela pachibhombu bhakabhohiki nyambiku ya kujochakeka, na nyambiku ya kutama kwa lukwali. Bhandu bhakatemi pahi kula na kunywa, nabhombi bhakajemiki na kukina.<verse eid="EXO 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Uhelalaje pahi manyata, kwa ndandi bhandu bhaku wawaletiki kuhuma ku inchi ja ku Misili, bhatehi kuhobha. <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" />Bhajilekiki manyata indela jenakabhalaghalakili na kulenganakela litoli la ng'ombi kwa kuyeyusha, nabhombi bhakalihobhalili na kulibhokeha nyambiku, bhakapwaghaje, ‘Wenga wa Izilaeli, jonjoni nde chapanga witu joatubhohiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Nepani nabhamanyi bhandu abhabha, nabhombi nde bhandu bhabhabhili na hingu yeinonwipe. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />Sajenu unekaje, nahuli inyela yangu ikabhelalaje panani jabhu, na kubhayonanga. Bhela nepani ananukutendaje wehapa kubha litaifa likolongwa.”<verse eid="EXO 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" />Nambu Musa akumpembalili Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waki, akapwaghaje, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, maghambu kiki inyela yaku ibhelela panani ja bhandu bhako, bhala wawabhohiki ku Misili kwa uwezu waku ukolongwa na chiwoku chaku chechibhili na makile? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />Anautendiki bhenibhela, Bhamisili anabhapwaghaje, ‘Bho, Chapanga wabhu le akabhabhohiki mu inchi jitu ja Misili nahuli abhakomaje pachitombi na kubhahungula pamihu ja ndema?’ Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, ngaubhayomela kwa inyela yaku ikali, ubhabhonilaje chiha na kukotoka kuhenga lijambu leniheli lihakau leupala kubhahengela bhandu bhako. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" />Ubhakombukaje bhatumika bhaku Ibulahimu, Isaka na Izilaeli, ambabhu ukabhalapili wamwete kwa kupwagha, ‘Anandendaje lubheleku lwinu lukubhaje lwamaheli ngati ndondwa ya kunani, nanatu ananabhapekyaje bhabhelakeka bhinu inchi jenu jokapi ambaju nakabhalapili ananabhapekyaje, jikubhaje upwelelu wabhu mileli.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akabhabhonili chiha, akakotwiki kubhatendela bhandu bhaki lijambu lihakau lela leakapaliki kubhahengela.<verse eid="EXO 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Musa akang'anambwiki, na kuhelela kuhuma pachitombi akabya na hibau ibheli yeyalembakiki Amuli mu mabhoku ghaki. Ikabhili ilembakiki Amuli yaka Bambo Chapanga ipambala yokapi ibheli, kulongi na kunyuma. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" />Hibau heyi yakalenganakiki na Chapanga mweni. Malembu ghakabhili ghalembakiki na Chapanga mweni, ghakalembakiki ngati muhuli panani ja hibau.<verse eid="EXO 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />Yoshua paakajowini sauti ya bhandu bhakahona njobhela, akumpwaghi Musa, “Kubhili na sauti ja ngondo kulikambi.”<verse eid="EXO 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Musa akayangike, “Nga sauti ja ushinde, wala nga sauti ja kulepalela, nambu nyowana sauti ya bhandu bhabhajemba.”<verse eid="EXO 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Musa paakaheghalili palikambi akaliweni litoli la zahabu lela na bhandu bhakakinaje, panihapa inyela yaka Musa yakabhelili ngati moto, akailekili pahi hibau yela kuhuma mu mabhoku ghaki na kuikajula pahi pa chitombi pala. <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Musa akatoliki litoli la zahabu lela akalijochiki moto, akaliyaghiki mbaka lakabhi uhembi, akaukolwighi uhembi hoghu mu machi na kubhajomalakela Bhaizilaeli bhakunywaje. <verse eid="EXO 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Musa akundalukili Haluni, “Bho, bhandu abhabha bhakutendiki kike, mbaka ubhalongoha kutenda lihoku likolongwa bhenibhela?”<verse eid="EXO 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Haluni akayangike, “Ngawiyoma bambo wango. Wehapa umanyi ntundu bhandu abhabha mobhabhelili tayali kwa kuhenga mahakau. <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />Bhombi bhakambwaghile, ‘Utulenganakyaje ichapanga yeyatulonguhaje. Maghambu Musa hoju, joakatubhohiki kuhuma mu inchi ja Misili, ngachetumanyi ghaghumpatike.’ <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Bhela nakabhapwaghile, ‘Mundu jokapi jola joabhili na chindu cha zahabu, ahulaje.’ Panihapa bhakambekihi zahabu heyi, nanatu nakajibhekiki pa moto, na likapitalili litoli likambaku aleli!”<verse eid="EXO 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />Musa paakaweni kubha bhandu bhatehi kuasi, kwa ndandi Haluni akabhili abhalekiki bhandu bhatendaje kuasi, na kutenda ngati mobhapalilaje, na kupata iyoni palongi ja adui bhabhu, <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />panihapa Musa akajemiki palongi ja ndyangu wa likambi, akapwaghaje, “Mundu jokapi joabhili upambala waka Bamabo Chapanga, na ahikaje kwangu.” Bhalawi bhokapi bhakunjendile. <verse eid="EXO 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" />Akabhapwaghile, “Lendenu nde leapwagha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, ‘Kila mundu na alikongaje lipanga laki muchibhunu, na akayongalutaje kila pandu palikambi, akapetaje akoku na akoku, kuhuma ndyangu ghumu mbaka ndyangu ghongi, na kila mundu akunkomaje ndongu waki, nkochi waki na njaki.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />Bhalawi bhakatendiki ngati Musa moakalaghalakile, na mu lichobha lela bhakakomakiki ngati bhandu elufu itatu. <verse eid="EXO 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Musa akapwaghike, “Lalenu mulibhekiki kutumika palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, kwa kubha mkabhili chihanganyuma na kubhakoma bhana bhinu na bhalongu bhinu, Chapanga ampekyaje mbengalelu lalenu jenu.”<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />Chilabhu jaki Musa akabhapwaghi bhandu, “Mtendiki mahoku makolongwa. Nambu sajenu anangwelaje panani pachitombi kwaka Bambo Chapanga, pangi nhweza kutenda ujonganeshu kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghino.” <verse eid="EXO 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Bhela Musa akakelawiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga, na kumpwaghila, “Umina mtima namaa! Bhandu abhabha bhatendiki mahoku makolongwa! Bhalilenganakili bheni ichapanga ya zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" />Nambu sajenu nukulobha, ubhalekakyaje mahoku ghabhu. Ngati nangakubhalekakela, nukulobha unhungulaje kuhuma mu chitabu chaku cheubhalembiki mahina gha bhandu bhako.”<verse eid="EXO 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga akamuyangiki Musa, “Mundu jokapi joandendili mahoku nde joananunhungulaje kuhuma mu chitabu changu. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" />Sajenu ujendaje, ukabhalonguhaje bhandu abhabha mbaka pandu pala panukupwaghile malobhi ghake. Lingalyaje, mtumika wangu wa kunani anaakulongulyaje. Hata bhela, chikahi panabhahikilaje nepani kubhalapula, ananabhalapulaje kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghabhu.”<verse eid="EXO 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akabhalapwili bhandu kwa chitamu chihakau, maghambu bhakundobhiki Haluni abhalenganakyaje litoli likambaku la zahabu lela, na Haluni akabhalenganakile.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="s">Bambo Chapanga abhalaghalakila Bhaizilaeli kubhoka pa Chitombi cha Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Haya, ubhokaje pandu panihapa, wehapa papamu na bhandu bhaubhabhohiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili, nkwelaje mbaka ku inchi jenakundapile Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo, nakapwaghaje, ‘Ananabhapekyaje bhabhelakeka bhinu inchi jenjeno.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />Nepani ananuntumaje mtumika wangu wa kunani andongulyaje, nanatu ananabhatopulaje Bhakanaani, Bhaamoli, Bhahiti, Bhapelizi, Bhahivi na Bhayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" />Njendaje ku inchi jela jejitwelile mahibha na buse. Nambu nepani nganyendi papamu na mwehapa, maghambu mwehapa nde mabhandu mwembili na mitima jejinonwipe, nganihika kunkoma mwindela.”<verse eid="EXO 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />Bhandu pabhakajowini malobhi ghanihagha mahakau, bhakatumbwili kuombuleza wala njeta mundu joakawatiki hindu yaki inyahi ya kulipamba. <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />Bhakahengiki bhenibhela maghambu Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli, ‘Mwehapa nde mabhandu mwembili na mitima jejinonwipe. Anambiti papamu na mwehapa hata kwa chikahi chijipe, ananunkomaje. Sajenu muhulaje hindu hinu inyahi ya kulipamba, nanatu anamanyaje leananuntendilaje.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakahuliki hindu yabhu inyahi ya kulipamba, kutumbula pabhakabhokiki ku Chitombi cha Holebu, yani Sinai.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />Bhela Musa akabhili na ntetu wa kulitola lihema na kulijemeka kunja ja likambi patali pachokopi, kokapi kobhakabhekiki likambi, akalilohiki, “Lihema Lihuhu.” Kila mundu joakabhi apala kumanya lijambu lokapi lela kwaka Bambo Chapanga, akapiti ku Lihema Lihuhu kunja ja likambi. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Kila chikahi Musa paakapitiki kujenda ku Lihema heli, bhandu bhokapi bhakajemiki pundyangu wa mahema ghabhu, na kundingalila Musa mbaka ajingalaje mkati ja Lihema heli. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" />Kila chikahi Musa paakajingili mkati ja Lihema heli, nguzu ja lihundi jela jakahelili, na kujema pundyangu wa Lihema, na panihapa Bambo Chapanga akalongili na Musa. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />Kila chikahi bhandu pabhakajiweni nguzu ja lihundi jijemiki pundyangu wa Lihema, bhandu bhokapi bhakajemiki kujojabhela, kila mundu pundyangu wa Lihema laki. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" />Bhenibhela nde Bambo Chapanga moakabhelile alongela na Musa pamihu kwa pamihu, ngati mundu moalongalela na nkochi waki. Panihapa Musa akabhili akelabhuka kabheti kulikambi, nambu Yoshua, joakabhi anjangatila, mwana waka Nuni ngacheakabhokiki mu Lihema mola.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambo Chapanga alaghila kubha papamu na bhandu bhake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />Musa akumpwaghi Bambo Chapanga, “Lingalyaje, wehapa ukambwaghili, ‘Ubhalonguhaje bhandu abhabha,’ nambu ngacheumbwaghile nde nane joanauntumaje ajangatanaje papamu na nepane. Hata bhela ukapwaghiki, ‘Nukumanyi wehapa kwa lihina lako, nanau upatiki chihomu palongi jango.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" />Bhela, sajenu nukulobha, ngati anachakaka nepani mbatiki chihomu palongi jaku, unangihaje indela yaku, nahuli mbataje kukumanya, na kujendalela kupata chihomu palongi jako. Ukombukaje kubha litaifa lendenu nde bhandu bhako.”<verse eid="EXO 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" />Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Nepani namwete ananyendaje papamu na wehapa, nanatu ananukupekyaje chiheko.”<verse eid="EXO 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Bhela, Musa akumpwaghile, “Ngati wehapa ngaujendi papamu na tepani, ngawatubhoha kuhuma pandu pambane. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" />Bho, anamanya bhole kubha nepani na bhandu bhaku tupatiki chihomu palongi jako, ngati wehapa ngaujendi papamu na tepane? Bho, chindu bholi chengi chechiwezaje kututenda tepani kulekana nepani na bhandu bhaku bhabhabhile pachilanda ja bhandu bhangi bhokapi bhabhabhile pundema wokapi?”<verse eid="EXO 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ananukutendilaje lijambu lela leukanobhike, kwa ndandi upatiki chihomu palongi jangu, nanatu nukumanyi kwa lihina lako.”<verse eid="EXO 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Panihapa Musa akapwaghike, “Chonde nukulobha unangihaje ulumbalilu wako.”<verse eid="EXO 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />Bambo Chapanga akamuyangiki Musa, “Anambetaje palongi jaku na kukulangiha wamboni wangu wokapi, nanatu ananilitangazaje lihina langu Bambo Chapanga, palongi ja pamihu ghako. Nepani ananundangihaje wamboni wangu mundu jola jombala kundangiha wamboni, na kumbonela chiha mundu jola jombala kumbonela chiha.” <verse eid="EXO 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" />Panihapa Chapanga akapwaghike, “Ngauwezi kumona pamihu jangu, kwa ndandi njeta mundu jokapi joaweza kumona nepani, na kujendalela kubha mwome.” <verse eid="EXO 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Lingalyaje, apapa pabhili na pandu pambipi na nepani, uweza kujenda kujema panani ja litalaghu. <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" />Ulumbalilu wangu pawipetaje, ananukubhekaje mu limbaku mu litalaghu na kukuyekalela kwa chiwoku changu, mbaka panikubhaje nyomwili kupeta. <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" />Panihapa anamohaje chiwoku changu, nanau anaumonaje kungongu wango, nambu pamihu jangu ngapibhonikane.”<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s">Hibau yengi yeilembakiki Amuli yaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 10:1-5">Kombukombu la Tolati 10:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Uhongulaje hibau ibheli ya maganga ngati yela ya kutumbula, nanatu ananembaje panani ja hibau heyi malobhi ghala ghala ghaghakabhili panani ja hibau yela ya kutumbula, yela yewahekite. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />Ubyaje tayali chilabhu lukela, nanau wikwelaje panani ja Chitombi cha Sinai. Wihikaje kuhimangana na nepani kunani ja chitombi. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Ngayikwela mundu jokapi jola papamu na wehapa, wala ngayibhonikana mundu jokapi jola panani ja chitombi hechi. Wala mambeleli na ng'ombi ngayidimakika pambipi na chitombi hechi.” <verse eid="EXO 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Bhela, Musa akahongwili hibau ibheli ya maganga ngati yela ya kutumbula. Akabhokiki lukela pachibhombu, na kukwela panani ja Chitombi cha Sinai, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakile, koni akabyaje na hibau ibheli ya maganga yela mumabhoku ghaki.<verse eid="EXO 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akahelili mu lihundi na kujema papamu na Musa, na kulitangaza lihina laki, Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" />Bambo Chapanga akapetiki palongi jaka Musa, akatangazaje, “Nepani Bambo Chapanga, nepani Bambo Chapanga, nepani nde Chapanga joabhili na chiha na chihomu, ngachealabhalila kubha na inyela, abhili na upalu wamaheli na chakaka, <verse eid="EXO 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" />nabhabhonela chiha bhandu maelufu elufu, nekakela uhakau wabhu, makosa ghabhu na mahoku ghabhu. Wala ngachenumbalangila mundu muhakau kubha abhili na mahoku. Nabhatemula bhana na bhachokolu bhabhu kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghabhakahengiki akatati na akahokolu bhabhu, hata chibheleku cha katatu na cha kacheche.”<verse eid="EXO 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Palapala Musa akachikimi na kujinamisha mmutu waki mbaka pahi, na kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />Musa akapwaghike, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, ngati anambatiki chihomu palongi jaku, Bambo Chapanga, nukulobha ujendaje papamu na tepane. Hata ngati bhandu abhabha nde bhandu bhabhabhili na mitima jejinonwipe, utulekakyaje uhakau witu na mahoku ghitu, ututolaje kubha upwelelu wako.”<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulaghilu luhengakeka kabhete</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 23:14-19">Kubhoka 23:14-19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:1-5">Kombukombu la Tolati 7:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-17">16:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Lingalyaje, sajenu ndenda Lulaghilu na bhandu bhokapi. Anandendaje ngangachu ikolongwa palongi jabhu ambayu ngacheihengakiki mu litaifa lokapi lela pundema wokapi. Bhandu bhala bhamtama pachilanda jabhu anabhabhonaje moghabhelile gha kukangacha mahengu ghala ghanunhengilaje nepani Bambo Chapanga winu. Maghambu anandendaje lijambu la kujoghoha kwa ndandi jaku wehapa. <verse eid="EXO 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />Mkamulaje Shelia yangu yenumpekeha lalenu. Lingalyaje, palongi jinu ananabhatopulaje Bhaamoli, Bhakanaani, Bhahiti, Bhapelizi, Bhahivi na Bhayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Mlilingalyaje ngamwitenda lulaghilu na bhenei bhabhatama mu inchi jela jemujijendela, maghambu leniheli analikubhaje chimbenda pachilanda jino. <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" />Nambu ubhombulaje pandu pabhu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, na kuitunyulana nguzu yabhu ya maganga gha kujojabhela, uhekatanaje ichapanga yabhu ya Ashela.<verse eid="EXO 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" />“Ngamwanjojabhela chapanga jongi, kwa kubha nepani Bambo Chapanga, manyikana kwa lihina, ‘Joabhi na Wihu,’ nepani nde Chapanga nemili na wihu. <verse eid="EXO 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" />Mlilingalyaje ngamwitenda majetanganelu na bhenei bha inchi jeniheji, maghambu bhandu pabhajenda kutenda ukemi na kuibhokeha nyambiku ichapanga yabhu, bhandu anabhundohaje, nanamu anamkulaje nhupu yabhu. <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" />Anamubhatoghukili akakombu bhinu kwa akakamwali bhabhu, na akakamwali bhabhu anabhapiti kuhenga ukemi na ichapanga yabhu, anabhalonguhaje bhana bhinu bha chikambaku kuijengalela ichapanga yabhu.<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />“Ngamwalilenganakela ichapanga ya upuhi ya choma cha kuyeyusha.<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />“Muhengaje Uwangalalu wa Mabumunda Ghangakujeghaleka Amila. Kwa machobha saba anamkulaje mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila, ngati monundaghalakile. Muhengaje bhenibhela kwa chikahi chela chenundaghalakile, mu mwehi wa Abibu, yani mwehi wa kachechi, kwa kubha mu mwehi ghonihoghu wa Abibu, mwehapa nukumbohiki kuhuma mu inchi ja Misili.<verse eid="EXO 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />“Kila mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa chikambaku nde wangu nepani, papamu na bhabhelakeka bhaku bha kutumbula bha chikambaku bha hinyama yaku yokapi, bhabhelakeka bha kutumbula bha ng'ombi, mambeleli na imbuhi. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa liponda munkombulaje kwa kumokeha nepani mwanambeleli. Nambu ngati ngachempala kulikombola, mtunyulaje hingu jaki. Bhelabhela anamubhakombulaje bhabhelakeka bhinu bha kutumbula bha chikambaku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">“Mundu jokapi ngayihika palongi jangu mabhoku matopu.<verse eid="EXO 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />“Mtendaje mahengu ghinu machobha sita, nambu lichobha la saba nde mpomulyaje. Hata ngati anachibhili chikahi cha kulema mighonda, na chikahi cha kuhuna mahunu, impalika mpomulyaje.<verse eid="EXO 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" />“Mtendaje Uwangalalu wa Majuma, najombi nde ja mahunu gha kutumbula gha ingano, na mtendaje Uwangalalu wa Kubhongana mahunu mu ujomukelu wa chaka.<verse eid="EXO 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23" />“Mala patatu kwa chaka akanalomi bhokapi anabhalibhonganaje palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24" />Kwa kubha nepani ananaghatopulaje mataifa palongi jinu, na kujonjukela malindakanilu gha inchi jinu, wala njeta mundu jokapi joanatokulyaje inchi jinu, chikahi panjenda kunyojabhela palongi jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu mala patatu kwa kila chaka.<verse eid="EXO 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />“Ngamwimokeha mwahi wa nyambiku papamu na libumunda lelijeghaliki amila, wala ngamwihighakila nyambiku ja Uwangalalu wa Pasaka heji mbaka lukela.<verse eid="EXO 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" />“Uletaje mahunu gha kutumbula ghaghabhili manyahi nakanope gha mighonda jinu, na kughaleta mkati ja nyumba jangu nepani Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:26">“Ngawitutuha mwanambuhi mu mahibha ghaka mabhu waki.”<verse eid="EXO 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, “Ulembaje malobhi ghangane, maghambu kubhokana na malobhi ghangani, nepani ndendiki Lulaghilu na wehapa, papamu na bhandu bha Izilaeli.” <verse eid="EXO 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Musa akatemi konihoku papamu na Bambo Chapanga kwa machobha alobaini ikilu na muhi panga kula, wala kunywa machi. Najombi akalembiki panani ya hibau malobhi gha Lulaghilu, na Amuli Komi yela.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa ahelela kuhuma ku Chitombi Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />Musa paakahelili kuhuma ku Chitombi Sinai koni akabya na hibau ibheli ya Amuli yela mu mabhoku ghaki, ngacheakamanyi kubha pamihu jaki pakabhi pang'anya, maghambu akabhi alongela na Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Bhela Haluni na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi pabhakumbweni Musa, kubha ngozi ja pamihu paki patenda pang'anya, bhakajowipi kunheghalela. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Nambu Musa akundohiki Haluni na hiongozi bhokapi bha uhimanganu wa Bhaizilaeli bhajendaje pambipi jake, najombi Musa akatehi kulongela nabhu. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Palongi Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhakunheghalile, najombi akabhapekihi Amuli yokapi ambayu Bambo Chapanga akumpekihi pa Chitombi cha Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" />Musa paakajomwili kulongela na bhandu, akayekalili pamihu jaki kwa chitambala chechinang'ana. <verse eid="EXO 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />Nambu kila chikahi Musa paakapiti kulongela na Bambo Chapanga mu Lihema leli, akachibhohiki chitambala hechi mbaka paapitikaje kunja. Paakabhili ajomwili kupita kunja akabhapwaghi Bhaizilaeli mambu ghokapi ghaakalaghalakiwe, <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />nabhombi Bhaizilaeli bhakaweni pamihu jaka Musa pang'anya. Panihapa Musa akayekalili kabheti pamihu jaki kwa chitambala hechi, mbaka paakapiti kulongela na Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s">Malaghalakilu gha Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Musa akabhabhongini bhandu bhokapi bha Bhaizilaeli na kubhapwaghila, “Ghangani nde mambu ambaghu Bambo Chapanga andaghalakili mwehapa mughatendaje. <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" />Mtendaje mahengu ghinu kwa machobha sita, nambu lichobha la saba analikubhaje lichobha lihuhu kwinu, nde Sabato ja kupomulela kwaka Bambo Chapanga. Mundu jokapi joanatendaje lihengu lokapi lela mu lichobha leniheli impalika akomakikaje. <verse eid="EXO 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />Ngamwipambakila moto mu manyumba ghinu mu Lichobha la Sabato.”<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Michangu kwa ndandi ja Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 25:1-9">Kubhoka 25:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Musa akalongili na uhimanganu wokapi wa Bhaizilaeli, akapwaghaje, “Lendenu nde lealaghalakile Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" />Mbohaje mu mali ghinu nhupu ya kumpekeha Bambo Chapanga. Kila jumu joabhili na mtima wa kupala, aletaje nhupu yaki kwaka Bambo Chapanga nhupu ya zahabu, madini gha feza na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />na uzi ya langi ja buluu, ya langi ja zambalau, langi jikeli na ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, na ingobhu jejilokakiki kwa mangoma gha imbuhi, <verse eid="EXO 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />hingumba ya mambeleli makambaku yeijeghaliki langi jikeli na hingumba ya hinyama ya mumachi, na mbau ya nkongu wa mshita, <verse eid="EXO 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />mahuta gha zeituni kwa ndandi ja kupambakila taa, hiungu ya kubheka mu mahuta gha kujeghalewa, na kwa ndandi ja ubane ghounungila wichu, <verse eid="EXO 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />maganga gha mbija yamaheli ghaghalowakeka shohamu, na maganga ghangi gha mbija yamaheli kwa ndandi ja mapambu gha chizibau chaka mpenganyambiku na chifuku cha pachihimba.<verse eid="EXO 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hindu yeipalika mu Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 39:32-43">Kubhoka 39:32-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />“Kila mundu joabhili na umanyi pachilanda jinu ibhapalika kuhika na kulenganakela kila chindu Bambo Chapanga chealaghalakili: <verse eid="EXO 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" />Kulenganakela Lihema Lihuhu, chiyekalelu chaki, hikamulakilu, mbau yaki, fitu yaki, mapali ghaki na hitamilu yaki. <verse eid="EXO 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />Lisanduku la Lulaghilu papamu na mipeku jaki ja kutotulela, na chifuniku cha chiha, na lipazia la Pandu Pahuhu Nakanope, <verse eid="EXO 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />meza na mipeku jaki papamu na yombu yaki yokapi, na mabumunda ghaghabhekakiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, <verse eid="EXO 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />chinala cha taa kwa ndandi ja unang'anu, papamu na yombu yaki yokapi, taa na mahuta kwa ndandi ja unang'anu, <verse eid="EXO 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />lisanduku la kuhukiha ubani papamu na mipeku jaki, mahuta gha kujegalewa na ubani ghounungila wichu, lipazia la pundyangu pandu pa kujingalila mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu, <verse eid="EXO 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />lisanduku la kubhokeha nyambiku ja kujochakeka papamu na waya waki wa shaba, na mipeku jaki na yombu yaki yokapi, liteleku la shaba papamu na chitamilu chaki, <verse eid="EXO 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />lipazia la liwangala la lihema papamu na mapali ghaki na hitamilu yaki, na lipazia la pundyangu wa liwangala, <verse eid="EXO 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />higingi ya Lihema Lihuhu, na higingi ya liwangala papamu na mighoji jaki, <verse eid="EXO 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />ingobhu yeilokakiki wichu nakanopi kwa ndandi ja lihengu la Pandu Pahuhu, yani ingobhu ihuhu yaka mpenganyambiku Haluni na bhana bhaki, kwa ndandi ja kuhenga lihengu labhu la upenganyambiku.”<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhaleta nhupu yabhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Panihapa bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakabhokiki palongi jaka Musa, <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" />na kila mundu joakabhili na mtima wa kupala, akumbokihi nhupu Bambo Chapanga. Bhakaletiki kila chindu chechapaliki kuhengela lihengu la mu Lihema Lihuhu, mahengu ghaki ghokapi na kulenganakela ingobhu ihuhu. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />Bhokapi bhabhakabhili na mtima wa kubhoha, akanalomi kwa akambomba, bhakaletiki ipini, ndolowa, peti, ibangili, na hindu yokapi ya zahabu. Kila mundu akabhohiki nhupu wa zahabu kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Kila mundu joakabhili na uzi wa langi ja buluu, langi ja zambalau, na langi jikeli, ingobhu jinyaji jihuhu, na ingobhu ya mangoma gha imbuhi, hingumba ya mambeleli makambaku yeijeghaliki langi jikeli, na hingumba ya hinyama ya mumachi, akailetike. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Bhokapi bhakaletiki nhupu ya madini gha feza, shaba, na kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga, na kila joakabhili na mbau ya nkongu wa mshita kwa ndandi ja kutumila lihengu lokapi lela, akailetike. <verse eid="EXO 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" />Akambomba bhokapi bhabhakabhili na umanyi wa kuloka, bhakailetiki hindu yabhu yebhakalokiki kwa uzi wa langi ja buluu, zambalau, langi jikeli, na ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu. <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />Na akambomba bhokapi bhabhakabhili na umanyi bhakalokiki ingobhu ya mangoma gha imbuhi. <verse eid="EXO 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />Hiongozi bhakaletiki maganga gha mbija yamaheli ghaghalowakeka shohamu, papamu na maganga ghangi gha kupamba chizibau na chifuku cha pachihimba. <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />Bhelabhela bhakaletiki ihungu na mahuta gha zeituni kwa ndandi ja taa, mahuta gha kujegalewa na ubani ghounungila wichu. <verse eid="EXO 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />Bhaizilaeli bhokapi akanalomi kwa akambomba, bhakailetiki hindu yabhu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kwa kupala bhene, nhupu kwa ndandi ja lihengu lokapi laka Bambo Chapanga leakabhili abhalaghalakili kulihenga kupetela kwaka Musa.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhalenganakela bha Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 31:1-11">Kubhoka 31:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Bhela Musa akabhapwaghili Bhaizilaeli, “Mlingalyaje, Bambo Chapanga anhawili Bezaleli, mwana waka Uri, Uri hoju tati waki akabhi Huri, wa likabila laka Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" />najombi antwelakili Roho waka Chapanga, na antendiki akubhaje na mbulau, uwezu, umanyi, wa kuhenga mahengu gha kila ntundu gha kulenganakela hindu, <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32" />nahuli abyaje funde mnyahi wa kuhumbula mahengu gha kutumila malangu na kulenganakela hindu ya zahabu, na madini gha feza na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33" />numpekihi umanyi wa kuhongola maganga gha kupamba, na kuhongola milyangu, na umanyi wa kila ntundu wa ufunde. <verse eid="EXO 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Bhelabhela ampekihi umanyi hoghu Bezaleli na Ohaliabu, mwana waka Ahisamaki, wa likabila laka Dani, bhawezaje kubhabhola bhandu bhange. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />Bambo Chapanga abhapekihi bhandu bhanihabha umanyi wa kuhenga lihengu la ntundu wokapi wa ufunde lelihengakeka na bhandu bhabhabheka mapambu kwa uzi wa langi ya buluu, na zambalau, na jikeli, na ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, na umanyi wa kila ntundu wa ufunde.<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />“Bhela Bezaleli na Oholiabu, papamu na kila mundu Bambo Chapanga joampekihi umanyi na uwezu wa kumanya ntundu wa kuhenga mahengu ghokapi gha kuchenga Pandu Pahuhu bhakahengiki kila chindu ngati Bambo Chapanga moalaghalakile.”<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhaleta nhupu yamaheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Bhela Musa akabhalohiki Bezaleli na Oholiabu, na kila mundu joabhili na umanyi ambau Bambo Chapanga akabhili ampekihi uwezu na joakabhi apala mweni kuhika na kuhenga lihengu. <verse eid="EXO 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />Bhanihabha bhakajopalili nhupu yokapi kuhuma kwaka Musa ambayu Bhaizilaeli bhakabhili bhailetiki kwa ndandi ja lihengu la pa Lihema Lihuhu. Nabhombi bhandu bhakajendalili kundetela Musa nhupu kwa kupala bhene kila lukela. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />Bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhili na umanyi bhabhakabhili bhahenga lihengu la kila ntundu la Pandu Pahuhu bhakapiti mundu kuhuma mu lihengu laki leakabhi alihenga, <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" />nabhombi bhakumpwaghi Musa, “Bhandu bhaleta hindu yamaheli nakanopi kupeta yela yeipalika kwa lihengu leatulaghalakile Bambo Chapnga tutendaje.”<verse eid="EXO 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />Panihapa Musa akabhohiki lilaghalakilu, nabhombi bhakapeliki lilaghalakilu heli mu likambi lokapi, bhakapwaghaje, “Mundu jokapi akubhi mwanalomi au mbomba ngayileta kabhete chindu chokapi kwa ndandi ja nhupu ja Pandu Pahuhu.” Bhenibhela nde bhandu mobhakahibhalakiwi kuleta nakanopi, <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />maghambu hindu yebhakaletiki yakabhili yamaheli kupeta hindu yela yeikabhi ipalika kuhengela lihengu leniheli lokapi.<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulenganakela Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 26:1-37">Kubhoka 26:1-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />Akanalomi bhokapi bhabhabhili na umanyi bhakalenganakili Lihema Lihuhu kwa mapazia komi gha ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu jejilokakiki wichu kwa uzi wa langi ja buluu, zambalau na langi jikeli, na kulokakeka wichu picha ya makelubi mu mapazia ghanihagha. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Kila lipazia analikubhaje na ulachu wa mita komi na ibheli, na upana wa mita ibheli. Mapazia ghanihagha ghakubhaje na chipemu chimu. <verse eid="EXO 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />Bhakalombanishi mapazia nhwanu ghakubhaje lipazia limu, na akaghalombanishi mapazia nhwanu ghangi ghala ghakubhaje lipazia limu. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Bhakalenganakili ikamulilu ya chitambala cha buluu mu ujomukelu wa lipazia la kujomukela la chipandi cha kutumbula, kabhete chipandi cha ujomukelu cha lipazia la kabheli bhakatendiki bhelabhela. <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />Bhelabhela bhakabhekiki ikamulilu hamsini mu lipazia la kujomulela la chipandi cha kutumbula na hikamulilu hamsini yengi mu lipanzia la kujomulela la chipandi cha kabheli, ikamulilu yokapi yakatei kulingalanila. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Panihapa bhakalenganakili ikobhakelu hamsini ya zahabu, nahuli kuhuta mapazia papamu, na kutenda Lihema kubha limu.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />Bhelabhela bhakalenganakili mapazia komi na jimu kwa mangoma gha imbuhi kwa ndandi ja kuliyekalela Lihema. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Kila lipazia lakabhili na ulachu wa mita komi na itatu, na upana wa mita ibheli. Mapanzia ghokapi komi na jimu hagha ghakabhili na chipemu chimu. <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />Bhela bhakaghalombini mapazia nhwanu papamu, na mapazia sita papamu. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Bhela bhakabhekiki hikamulilu hamsini mu ujomukelu wa lipazia la kujomulela la chipandi cha kutumbula, na hikamulilu hamsini mu ujomukelu wa lipazia la chipandi cha kabheli. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />Bhelabhela bhakalenganakili ikobhakelu hamsini ya shaba, na kuibheka mu hikamulilu hamsini yela nahuli kulombanesha hipandi ibheli ya mapazia yela na kutenda kubha lipazia limu la kuliyeka Lihema. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />Bhela bhakalenganakili chiyekalelu cha lihema kwa hingumba ya mambeleli makambaku yeijeghaliki langi jikeli, na panani ja chihibhalakilu hechi akayekalili chingumba cha hinyama ya mumachi.<verse eid="EXO 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Bhela bhakalenganakili ngelakete ya nkongu wa mshita kwa ndandi ja kujemakela Lihema. <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />Kila ngelakete jakabhili na ulachu wa mita ncheche, na upana wa sentimita sitini na sita. <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />Kila ubau ukabhili na pandu pabheli papapitalile, kwa ndandi ja kuilombanesha. Bhenibhela nde mbau yokapi moyapalakile kulenganakeka mbau yokapi ya Lihema. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />Bhela bhakalenganakili mapali ishilini gha upambala wa kunkachi wa Lihema, <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />na hitamilu yaki alubaini ya madini gha feza ya kubheka pahi ja mapali, hitamilu ibheli kwa kila lipali limu, nahuli kukamulakila pandu pabheli papapitalile. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25" />Upambala wa kungondi wa Lihema, bhakalenganakili mapali ishilini, <verse eid="EXO 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26" />na hitamilu yaki alubaini ya madini gha feza ya kubheka pahi ja mapali, hitamilu ibheli kwa kila lipali limu. <verse eid="EXO 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />Bhakalenganakili mapali sita kwa kila ujomukelu, upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa Lihema, <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />bhelabhela bhakalenganakili mapali ghabheli na kughajemeka munkeghi ja Lihema upambala wa kunyuma. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />Mapali ghabheli hagha ghakalombanishwi kutumbula pahi, na kwa panani ghakalombanishwi mu peti ja kutumbula, na mapali gha kona yokapi ibheli ghakatei kulengana. <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />Bhela kukabhili na mapali nane na hitamilu komi na sita ya madini gha feza, ibheli pahi ja kila lipali.<verse eid="EXO 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />Bhela bhakalenganakili fitu ya nkongu wa mshita, nhwanu kwa ndandi ja mapali gha upambala ghumu wa Lihema, <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />na nhwanu kwa ndandi ja mapali gha upambala ghongi, na nhwanu kwa ndandi ja mapali gha upambala wa kunyuma ja Lihema, kolijibhi lyobha. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Bhakalenganakili mpengu wa pachilanda ghoukajomukili pachilanda ja Lihema, ambau ukapetiki pachilanda kuhuma ku ujomukelu ghumu mbaka ujomukelu ghongi pachilanda ja mapali. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Bhakaiyekalili nguzu heyi kwa zahabu, kabhete bhakalenganakili peti ya zahabu yeyakamulakile mipengu heji. Kabhete bhakayekalili mipengu heji kwa zahabu.<verse eid="EXO 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />Bhakalenganakili lipazia la ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, jejalokakiki wichu kwa uzi wa langi ja buluu, zambalau na langi jikeli, na bhakalokiki wichu picha ya makelubi mu lipazia heli. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />Bhelabhela bhakalenganakili mapali nchechi gha nkongu wa mshita, akaipakiki zahabu na kuijeghela ikobhakelu ya zahabu. Bhelabhela bhakalenganakili hitamilu nchechi ya madini gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Pundyangu wa Lihema bhakalenganakili lipazia la ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, lelilokakiki wichu kwa uzi wa langi ja buluu, zambalau, na langi jikeli. <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />Bhelabhela bhakalenganakili mapali nhwanu kwa nkongu wa mshita na kughayeka kwa zahabu. Mapali ghanihagha ghakabhili na chikobhakelu cha zahabu, na kila chimu chakabhili na hitamilu nhwanu ya shaba.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s">Kulenganakela Lisanduku la Lulaghilu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 25:10-22">Kubhoka 25:10-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Bezaleli akalenganakili Lisanduku la Lulaghilu kwa mbau ya nkongu wa mshita, lelakabhili na ulachu wa sentimita mia moja na komi, upana wa sentimita sitini na sita, na kimu cha sentimita sitini na sita. <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />Bhela akaliyekiki Lisanduku heli kwa zahabu jinyahi mkati na kunja, na kulenganakela ukengu wa zahabu ipambala yokapi. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />Akalenganakili peti nchechi ya zahabu na kuihwatika mu magholu ghaki, kila chigholu peti jimu. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />Bhelabhela akalenganakili mipeku kwa nkongu wa mshita na kujihyeka kwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" />Akajipetishi mipeku heji mu peti yeyabhili mu ipambala ibheli ya lisanduku, nahuli kulitotola lisanduku heli. <verse eid="EXO 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />Bhela akalenganakili chifuniku cha zahabu, na pachifuniku hapa pakabhili na chifuniku cha chiha, ulachu waki ukabhili sentimita mia moja na komi, na upana waki sentimita sitini na sita. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />Bhelabhela akalenganakili picha ya makelubi ghabheli kwa zahabu jejigholulike, na kughabheka pa ujomukelu ubheli wa chifuniku hechi. <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />Bhela akalenganakili picha jaka kelubi jumu upambala ghumu na jongi upambala ghongi, na akaghalombanishi makelubi hagha kubha chindu chimu na chifuniku cha chiha hechi, jumu akoku na jongi akoku. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" />Makelubi hagha ghakatei kulingalanila, na mapapanilu ghabhu ghakahatambwiki kunani, na nhwili wabhu kuhyekalela pa chifuniku cha chiha hechi. Pamihu jabhu pakajinamili kulingalila pa chifuniku cha lisanduku heli.<verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meza ja kubhekela mabumunda ghaghabhekakiki palongi jaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Kubhoka 25:23-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />Bhelabhela Bezaleli akalenganakili meza kwa nkongu wa mshita jejibhili na ulachu wa sentimita semanini na nane, na upana wa sentimita alobaini na ncheche, na kimu cha sentimita sitini na sita. <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />Akajipakiki meza heji kwa zahabu jinyahi na kujiyongoloha na ukengu wa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />Bhela akalenganakili ukengu wa ubau wa zahabu na kuyongoloha upambala wokapi, ghowabhili na upana wa milimita sabini na nhwanu. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />Bhelabhela akalenganakili peti nchechi ya zahabu kwa ndandi ja meza heji, na kuikonga mu ipambala nchechi, mu magholu nchechi hagha. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />Bhela peti heyi yakabhili pambipi na ubau ghola wa kujiyongolota meza na yakabhili ya kujingakila mikongu ja kujitotulela meza heji. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />Bhelabhela akalenganakili mipeku jibheli ja mshita, na kujiyeka kwa zahabu, mipeku heji jakabhili ja kutotulela meza heji. <verse eid="EXO 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Bhela akalenganakili mbali na hikombi ya kubhekela ubani pameza, papamu na bilika na bakuli ya kujeghalela nhupu ya kunywa. Akalenganakili yombu yokapi heyi kwa zahabu jinyahi.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulenganakela chinala cha taa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Kubhoka 25:31-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />Bhela Bezaleli akalenganakili chinala cha taa kwa zahabu jinyahi. Chitamilu chaki na ufitu wa chinala hechi yakabhili chindu chimu, bhelabhela na ingonyu yaki, lihundwa laki, yakalengini na malobha ghaki, yokapi yakalenganakiki kwa zahabu na kubha chindu chimu.<verse eid="EXO 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />Mambandi sita ghakapitalili mu ipambala ya ufitu waki, mambandi ghatatu upambala ghumu na mambandi ghatatu upambala ghongi. <verse eid="EXO 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />Mu kila limbandi kukabhili na ingonyu itatu yeilengana na malobha gha mlozi, kila chimu na lihundwa laki na lilobha laki. <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />Mu ufitu hoghu kukabhili na ingonyu nchechi yeilengana na malobha gha mlozi, papamu na mahundwa ghaki na malobha ghaki. <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />Pahi ja kila paghapitalila mambandi ghabheli pachilanda ja mambandi sita ghala, pakabhili na lihundwa limu lelilombanishwi na ufitu wa chinala hechi. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Mahundwa ghanihagha na mambandi ghaki ghakabhili chindu chimu na chinala hechi, na chokapi chakalenganakiki kwa zahabu jinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />Bhela akalenganakili taa saba, na hindu ya kulenganakela utambi na mbali yake, yokapi yakalenganakiki kwa zahabu jinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />Akatumili kilu selasini na nhwanu ya madini gha zahabu jinyahi, kulenganakela chinala hechi na hindu yaki yokapi.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulenganakela lisanduku la kuhukila ubani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 30:1-5">Kubhoka 30:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />Bhela Bezaleli akalenganakili lisanduku kwa nkongu wa mshita kwa ndandi ja kuhukila ubani. Lisanduku heli lakalengini ipambala yokapi, ulachu na upana waki sentimita alobaini na nhwanu, na kimu chaki sentimita tisini. Manyelu ghaki ghakabhili chindu chimu na lisanduku heli. <verse eid="EXO 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />Bhela jokapi akajipakiki kwa zahabu jinyahi, upambala waki wa kunani, ipambala yaki yokapi ya muluteta na manyelu ghaki, kabheti akayongalwihi ukengu wa zahabu munkeghi jaki. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />Akalenganakili peti ibheli ya zahabu kwa ndandi ja lisanduku pahi punkeghi, yengi ibheli upambala wa kabheli nahuli kukamulila mipeku heji chikahi cha kuchitotola. <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />Akajilenganakili mipeku jibheli kwa nkongu wa mshita, na kujihyeka kwa zahabu.<verse eid="EXO 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulenganakela mahuta gha kubhahimika bhandu na hindu yengi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 30:22-38">Kubhoka 30:22-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Bhela Bezaleli akalenganakili mahuta mahuhu gha kubhahimika bhandu na hindu yengi, na ubani unyahi ghounungila wichu, ghowalenganakiki na fundi joalenganakela manungilu kwa hindu yeinungila wichu.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s">Kulenganakela lisanduku la kubhokeha nyambiku ya kujochakeka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 27:1-8">Kubhoka 27:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />Bhela Bezaleli akalenganakili lisanduku kwa mbau ya nkongu wa mshita, lakalengini ipambala yokapi, ulachu waki ukabhili mita ibheli na lobu, na upana waki ukabhili mita ibheli na lobu, kimu chaki chakabhili mita jimu na lobu. <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />Bhelabhela akalenganakili manyelu ncheche mu kona yaki ncheche, manyelu ghanihagha ghakabhili chindu chimu na lisanduku heli. Najombi akalihyekiki lisanduku heli kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />Bhelabhela akalenganakili hindu yokapi kwa shaba, yombu ya kubhokeha ilihu, na yoma yaki ya kubhokeha ilihu, na mabakuli ghaki gha kumichila, yoma ya kujochela inyama, na yombu ya kujokulela moto. Hindu heyi yokapi akailenganakili kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />Bhela akalenganakili waya wa shaba ghowabhili na peti nchechi ya shaba, na akaujingihi pahi ja ukengu mbaka pachilanda ja lisanduku. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />Bhelabhela akabhekiki peti nchechi ya shaba yela, mu kona nchechi ya waya wa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />Bhela akalenganakili mipeku kwa nkongu wa mshita kwa ndandi ja kutotulela lisanduku heli, na kujihyeka kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />Bhelabhela akajibhekiki mipeku heji mu peti yela yeyabhili mu kila upambala wa lisanduku, nahuli kulitotola. Akalenganakili lisanduku heli kwa mbau, na lakabhili na mbekenyu mkati jaki.<verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulenganakela liteleku la shaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 30:18">Kubhoka 30:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />Bhela Bezaleli akalenganakili liteleku la shaba, na chitamilu chaki cha shaba, liteleku heli lakalenganakiki kwa hioo yebhabhohiki akambomba bhabhakabhi bhahenga lihengu pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liwangala la Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 27:9-19">Kubhoka 27:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />Bhela Bezaleli akalenganakili liwangala kwa ndandi ja Lihema Lihuhu. Upambala wa kunkachi wa liwangala kukabhili na mapazia ghaghalenganakiwi kwa ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, ambaju jakabhili na ulachu wa mita alobaini na nchechi kwa upambala ghumu, <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />mapazia ghanihagha ghakakobhakiki mu mapali ishilini yeyakabhili na hitamilu ishilini ya shaba. Kabhate kukabhili na ikobhakelu ya madini gha feza na hikamulilu ya madini gha feza panani ja mapali ghanihagha. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Bhelabhela upambala wa kungondi, mapazia ghanihagha ghakabhili na ulachu wa mita alobaini na nchechi, na mapali ishilini gha shaba, na hitamilu ishilini ya shaba, nambu ikobhakelu ya mapali na hikamulilu yaki yakabhili ya madini gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Na upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa Lihema Lihuhu kukabhili na mapazia ghaghabhili na ulachu wa mita ishilini na ibheli, na mapali ghaki komi na hitamilu yaki komi. Ikobhakelu na hikamulilu yaki yakabhili ya madini gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Bhelabhela upambala wa kolipita lyobha, kowabhili ndyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu lakabhili na upana wa mita ishilini na ibheli. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14" />Kila upambala ghumu wa ndyangu lakabhili na lipazia lelakabhili na upana wa mita sita na nusu, papamu na mapali ghatatu na hitamilu yaki itatu. <verse eid="EXO 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15" />Bhelabhela mu upambala wa kabheli wa ndyangu ukabhili na mapazia ghaghabhili na upana wa mita sita na nusu papamu na mapali ghaki ghatatu na hitamilu yaki itatu. <verse eid="EXO 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Mapazia ghokapi kuliyongolota liwangala ghakabhili gha ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu jejilokakiki wichu. <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />Hitamilu yaki yokapi ya mapali ghanihagha ghakabhi gha shaba, nambu ikobhakelu ya mapali na hikamulilu yaki yakabhili ya madini gha feza. Mapali ghaki ghakabhili gha madini gha feza, na fitu yeyatumiki kughakamulila mapali ghanihagha ghakabhi gha madini gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Pundyangu wa liwangala heli akabhekiki lipazia lelilenganakiki wichu kwa ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu jejilokakiki wichu kwa lughoji lwa langi ja buluu, zambalau na jikeli, lihengu laka fundi mnyahi wa kuloka. Lipazia heli lakabhili na ulachu wa mita tisa, na kimu cha mita ibheli, ngati moghabhelile mapazia gha liwangala. <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />Bhelabhela mapali ghaki nchechi, na hitamilu yaki nchechi, yakabhili ya shaba. Mapali ghaki na peti yaki yakabhili ya madini gha feza, hikamulakilu yaki yakabhili iyekaliwi kwa madini gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Higingi yokapi kuliyongolota Lihema Lihuhu, na liwangala yakabhili ya shaba.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hindu yeyatumiki kulichenga Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21" />Yenjenu nde hindu yeyatumiki kwa ndandi ja kuchenga Lihema Lihuhu, mobhakabhekiki Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, ambayu ikaletakiki na Bhalawi ngati moakalaghalakili Musa, pahi ja ujemalelu waka Isamali, mwana waka mpenganyambiku Haluni.<verse eid="EXO 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22" />Bezaleli, mwana waka Uri, Uri hoju tati waki akabhi Huri, wa likabila laka Yuda, akatendiki kila chindu ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakile Musa. <verse eid="EXO 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23" />Akabhili na mundu wa kunjangatila joakalowakiki Oholiabu mwana waka Ahisamaki, wa likabila laka Dani, mundu jonihoju akabhili na umanyi wa kuhongola maganga, na kubheka mapambu gha hindu, na kuloka wichu mapambu mu ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu kwa uzi wa langi ya buluu, zambalau, na jikeli, na umanyi wa kila ntundu wa ufunde.<verse eid="EXO 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Zahabu jokapi jebhakumbohili Bambo Chapanga kwa ndandi ja kuchenga Lihema Lihuhu jakabhili na kilu mia nane na sabini na saba na gilamu mia tatu, kulengana na hipemu ya Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="EXO 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25" />Madini gha feza ghaghapatakini kubhokana na lipogha la bhandu bhanihabha bhabhakabhalangiki ghakabhili ngati kilu elufu itatu na komi na saba, na gilamu mia saba na hamsini, kulengana na hipemu ya Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="EXO 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26" />Kila mundu joakabhalangiki kutumbula joakabhili na hyaka ishilini na jimu na kupetalela, akabhohiki nhupu waki wa gilamu nhwanu ya madini gha feza, kwa ndandi ja kuhengela lihengu la mu Lihema Lihuhu. Akanalomi bhokapi bhabhakabhalangiki bhakabhili ngati akanalomi laki sita na elufu itatu na mia nhwanu na hamsini. <verse eid="EXO 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Kilu ngati elufu itatu ya madini gha feza yakatumiki kulenganakela hitamilu mia jimu ya Lihema Lihuhu lela na lipazia lela, yani kilu selasini kwa kila chitamilu. <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />Akatumili kilu komi na saba na gilamu sabini na nhwanu ya madini gha feza yeyakahighalili kulenganakela ikobhakelu na hikamulilu, na ifuniku ya mapali ghanihagha. <verse eid="EXO 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Shaba yeyakapatakini kubhokana na Bhaizilaeli yebhakumbokili nhupu Bambo Chapanga jakabhili ngati elufu ibheli na mia jimu na ishilini na ncheche. <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />Bezaleli akatumili shaba heji kulenganakela hitamilu ya ndyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu, lisanduku la shaba la kubhokeha nyambiku ja kujochakeka papamu na waya waki wa shaba, na yombu yokapi ya lisanduku heli, <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" />na hitamilu ya liwangala yeyakayongalwiti Lihema Lihuhu na ya ndyangu wa liwangala, na higingi yokapi ya Lihema Lihuhu na ya liwangala.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s">Kulenganakela ingobhu ya bhapenganyambiku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 28:1-14">Kubhoka 28:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Bhakatumili uzi wa langi ya buluu, zambalau, na jikeli kulenganakela ingobhu ya kuwata chikahi cha kutumika mu Lihema Lihuhu. Bhelabhela bhakundokili Haluni ingobhu ihuhu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakili Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />Akalenganakili chizibau cha ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, akachilenganakili kwa langi ja buluu, zambalau, na langi jikeli, jejilokakiki wichu. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />Bhakajipondiki kwa nyundu ipandi ipepandau ya zahabu na kulenganakela uzi upepandau nahuli kuloka papamu na uzi wa langi ja buluu, zambalau, jikeli na ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, jejakalokakiki wichu. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Chakabhili na mighoji jibheli ja mumabhegha yeyalombaniki pandu pabheli mu makeghi gha chizibau nahuli kukongela chizibahu hechi. <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />Bhakalenganakili lughoji lwa muchibhunu lolulenganakiwi wichu ambalu lukabhili chindu chimu na chizibahu, akachilenganakili kwa langi ja buluu, zambalau, na langi jikeli, jejilokakiki wichu ngati Bambi Chapanga moakundaghalakili Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6" />Bhela bhakatoliki maganga ghabheli gha shohamu na bhakalembiki panani jaki mahina komi na ghabheli gha makabila komi na ghabheli gha Izilaeli, ngati muhuli moulembakeka. <verse eid="EXO 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7" />Bhela bhakabhekiki maganga ghabheli hagha panani ja mighoji jibheli ja chizibahu ngati ukombukelu wa makabila komi na ghabheli gha Izilaeli, ngati Bambo moakundaghalakili Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulenganakela chifuku cha pachihimba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 28:15-30">Kubhoka 28:15-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />Bhela akalenganakili chifuku cha pachihimba, akalenganakili wichu ngati chizibau chela, akachilenganakili kwa langi ja buluu, zambalau, na langi jikeli, na ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, jejilokakiki wichu. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Bhela chifuku hechi chakatehi kukunjakika, na chakabhili na ipambala ncheche yeilengana, ulachu waki chakabhili sentimita ishilini na ibheli, na upana waki chakabhili sentimita ishilini na ibheli. <verse eid="EXO 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Bhela akabhekiki misitali nchechi ja maganga gha mbija yamaheli. Msitali wa kutumbula akabhekiki maganga gha akiki, topazi na alumasi jikeli. <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />Msitali wa kabheli ukabhili na maganga gha zumalidi, yakuti samawi na alumasi. <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />Msitali wa katatu ukabhili na maganga gha hiakinto, na akiki jikeli na ametisto. <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />Msitali wa kachechi ukabhili na maganga gha zabalajadi, shohamu, na yasipi. Maganga ghanihagha ghokapi akaghabhekiki mu hikamulakilu ya zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Bhela, kukabhili na maganga komi na ghabheli, na kila liganga lakabhili lilembakiki lihina limu laka mwana jumu wa likabila la Izilaeli. Kila lihina lakalembakiki kwa kuchola ngati muhuli, nahuli kughamanyiha makabila komi na ghabheli gha Izilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />Kwa ndandi ja chifuku cha pachihimba hechi, bhakachilenganakili mikufu ja zahabu jinyahi, jejilokakiki ngati ngoji. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Bhelabhela bhakalenganakili peti ibheli ya zahabu na kuibheka kwa ndandi ja chifuku cha pachihimba na kujibheka mu kona ibheli ya chifuku hechi. <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />Bhakajikongiki mikufu jibheli ja zahabu heji mu peti ibheli yela yeibhili mu kona ya chifuku cha pachihimba. <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />Na kona ibheli ya mikufu ja zahabu bhakalombanishi mighoji heji mu hikamulakilu ibheli yela ya chizibau upambala wa palongi. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />Bhakalenganakili peti ibheli ya zahabu na kuikonga mu kona ibheli ya pahi upambala wa mkati wa chifuku cha pachihimba pambipi na chizibau. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />Bhela bhakalenganakili peti yengi ibheli ya zahabu na kubheka palongi mu kona ya pahi ja hipandi ya chizibau, pandu chizibau pachilombana na ulamba ghoulokakiki kwa unyahi. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Chifuku cha pachihimba akachikongiki pa chizibau kwa kulombanesha peti yaki na peti ya chizibau kwa ngoji wa langi ja buluu, nahuli chifuku hechi cha pachihimba ngachileghaleka nambu chitamilaje ulamba ghoulokakiki wichu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakili Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulenganakela ingobhu yengi ya kuwata mpenganyambiku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 28:31-43">Kubhoka 28:31-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Bhela Bezaleli akalenganakili likanzu la kuwatila chizibau kwa chitambala cha langi ja buluu pena. <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />Pachilanda ja likanzu heli akabhekiki mbekenyu ja kujingakiha mmutu, na mbekenyu heji jakayongalitwi na upindo ghoulokakiki nahuli ngalikachuka. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Pa upindo wa pahi akapambiki mapambu gha makomamanga gha langi ja buluu, na zambalau, na ya langi jikeli, na ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu jejilokakiki wichu, kuyongolota munkeghi ja likanzu heli. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Panihapa bhakalenganakili mangengecha gha zahabu jinyahi na kughabheka kuyongolota upindo wa pahi pachilanda ja makomamanga. <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />Mangengecha ghanihagha na makomamanga yakajengalanili kwa kuuyongolota upindu wa likanzu nahuli liwatakikaje kwa lihengu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakandaghalakili Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27" />Bhelabhela bhakundenganakili Haluni na bhana bhaki makanzu majipi gha ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, <verse eid="EXO 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28" />na mbumbu ja ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, kofia ja ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu, mabundulu manyahi mahuhu gha mkati, ghaghalokakiki wichu, <verse eid="EXO 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />na luhunga lukabhili lwa ingobhu jinyahi jihuhu jejalokakiki wichu kwa langi ya buluu, zambalau, na jikeli, kwa lihengu laka fundi joaloka wichu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakili Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />Bhela bhakalenganakili chibati cha zahabu jinyahi na kulemba panani jaki ngati mundu joabacha muhuli, “Mhuhu kwaka Bambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="EXO 39:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Bhakachikongiki chibati hechi palongi ja mbumbu kwa uzi wa langi ja buluu, ngati Bambo moakundaghalakili Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujomoka kwa lihengu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 35:10-19">Kubhoka 35:10-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Bhela, lihengu lokapi la kulenganakela Lihema Lihuhu lakajomwike. Bhaizilaeli bhakahengiki ghokapi ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakili Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" />Nabhombi bhakundetili Musa Lihema Lihuhu, chiyekalelu chaki, hikamulakilu, mbau yaki, na fitu yaki, mapali na hitamilu yaki, <verse eid="EXO 39:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />na chiyekalelu cha ingumba ya mambeleli makambaku yeijeghaliki langi jikeli, na chiyekalelu cha hinyama ya mumachi, na lipazila la Lihema Lihuhu, <verse eid="EXO 39:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />na Lisanduku la Lulaghilu papamu na mipeku jaki, na chifuniku chaki chechibhili na pandu pa chiha, <verse eid="EXO 39:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />na meza papamu na yombu yaki yokapi na mabumunda ghaghabhohakiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga, <verse eid="EXO 39:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" />na chinala cha taa cha zahabu jinyahi, na taa yaki papamu na mahuta kwa ndandi ja taa heyi, <verse eid="EXO 39:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />na lisanduku la zahabu la kuhukila ubani, mahuta gha kujitaliwa, ubani ghounungila wichu, na lipazia la pundyangu wa Lihema, <verse eid="EXO 39:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />na lisanduku la shaba na waya waki wa shaba, mipeku jaki na yombu yaki yokapi, liteleku na chitamilu chaki, <verse eid="EXO 39:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" />na mapazia gha liwangala papamu na mapali ghaki na hitamilu yaki, lipazia kwa ndandi ja ndyangu wa liwangala na ngoji waki, na hingingi yaki, na hindu yokapi yeyapalakike kutumika mu Lihema Lihuhu, <verse eid="EXO 39:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />na ingobhu yokapi yeyalokakiki wichu kwa ndandi ja lihengu la Pandu Pahuhu, ingobhu ihuhu yaka mpenganyambiku Haluni, na ingobhu ya bhana bhaki kwa ndandi ja lihengu la upenganyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 39:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />Bhaizilaeli bhakahengiki kila chindu ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakili Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" />Musa akakaghulili lihengu na kubhona kubha bhakabhili bhatendiki kila chindu wichu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakabhili alaghalakile. Bhela Musa akabhapengalile.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s">Lihema Lihuhu lichengakeka na kubhekakeka palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Musa, <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />“Mu lichobha la kutumbula la mwehi wa kutumbula, ulichengaje Lihema Lihuhu la kuhimanganila. <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />Ubhekaje Lisanduku la Lulaghilu mkati ja Lihema heli na kulihibhalakila kwa lipazia. <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />Panihapa ujingihaje meza na kupanga yombu yaki panani. Ujingihaje chinala cha taa chela, na kujibheka taa panani jaki. <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />Lisanduku la zahabu la kuhukila ubani ulibhekaje palongi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, na kubheka lipazia pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="EXO 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />Ubhekaje lisanduku la kujochela nyambiku hechi palongi ja ndyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />Panihapa ulibhekaye liteleku la shaba, pachilanda ja Lihema Lihuhu na chihanja cha nyambiku ja kujochakeka, na ubhekaje machi mkati jaki. <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />Uchengaje liwangala kuyongolota Lihema lokapi na ubhekaje lipazia pundyangu wa liwangala.<verse eid="EXO 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />“Utolaje mahuta gha zeituni, na ulipakaje Lihema laka Chapanga papamu na kila chindu chechibhili mkati jaki, ibhekaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga papamu na hindu yokapi yeibhili mkati jaki, nalombi analikubha lihuhu. <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />Panihapa ulipakaje mahuta lisanduku la kujochela nyambiku heli papamu na hindu yaki yokapi, ulibhekaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, nalombi lisanduku heli analikubha lihuhu namaa. <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />Bhelabhela liteleku la shaba na chitamilu chaki uibhekaje palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kulitenda kubha lihuhu.<verse eid="EXO 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" />“Bhela undetaje Haluni na bhana bhaki pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu, na ubhagholulaje kwa machi ngati moibhapalakila. <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />Panihapa unhwatikaje Haluni ingobhu ihuhu, na wehapa unjeghalaje mahuta, na kumbeka akubha mhuhu, nahuli apata kundumakila nepani ngati mpenganyambiku. <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" />Ubhalohaje bhana bhaka Haluni na kubhawatika makanzu ghanihagha. <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />Nanau ubhajeghalaje mahuta ngati moukunjeghalili tati wabhu, nahuli bhanhengilaje lihengu la upenganyambiku. Kujeghalewa mahuta hoku anakubhatendaje bhakubhaje bhapenganyambiku mileli kwa hibheleku yabhu yokapi.”<verse eid="EXO 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Bhela, Musa akatendi ghanihagha ghokapi wichu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakile. <verse eid="EXO 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />Mu lichobha la kutumbula la mwehi wa kutumbula chaka cha kabheli baada ja kubhoka ku Misili, Lihema Lihuhu lakachengakike. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />Musa akalichengiki Lihema, akabhekiki hitamilu yaki, akajemiki mapali ghaki na kujingiha fitu yaki, na kughajemeka mapali ghaki. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Akayekalili lipazia panani ja Lihema Lihuhu na kubheka chifuniku cha Lihema panani jaki, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakile. <verse eid="EXO 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Bhela akatoliki hibau ibheli ya maganga yela na kuibheka mkati ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu lela, akabhekiki mipeku ja kutotulela lisanduku, na akabhekiki chifuniku cha chiha panani ja lisanduku heli. <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />Panihapa Musa akaletiki Lisanduku la Lulaghilu na kulibheka mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu, na kubheka lipazia kulihibhalila Lisanduku la Lulaghilu heli, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakili Musa.<verse eid="EXO 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Bhela Musa akabhekiki meza mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu, upambala wa kungondi wa Lihema kunja ja lipazia, <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />na panani jaki akabhekiki mabumunda ghaghabhohakiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa. <verse eid="EXO 40:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24" />Akachibhekiki chinala cha taa mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu kulingalanila na meza upambala wa kunkachi wa Lihema. <verse eid="EXO 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25" />Bhela akapambakili taa yaki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakili Musa. <verse eid="EXO 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26" />Bhela Musa akabhekiki lisanduku la zahabu la kuhukila ubani mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu palongi ja lipazia, <verse eid="EXO 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27" />na kulihukila ubani ghounungila wichu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakili Musa. <verse eid="EXO 40:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Panihapa akabhekiki lipazia pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu. <verse eid="EXO 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />Musa akabhekiki lisanduku la nyambiku ja kujochakeka pundyangu wa Lihema Lihuhu, akabhohiki nyambiku ja kujochakeka panani jaki, na nhupu ya uhembi, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa. <verse eid="EXO 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Akabhekiki liteleku la shaba pachilanda ja Lihema Lihuhu na lisanduku la nyambiku ja kujochakeka, na kubheka machi mkati jaki. <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />Musa na Haluni, na bhana bhaki bhokapi bhakachambiki mabhoku na magholu ghabhu kwa machi ghanihagha. <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />Kila pabhajingalaje mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu au pabhakabhili bhajenda pa lisanduku la kubhokeha nyambiku ja kujochakeka lela, bhakachambiki machi, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalaki Musa. <verse eid="EXO 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Bhela Musa akalenganakili liwangala kuliyongolota Lihema Lihuhu na lisanduku la kubhokeha nyambiku ja kujochakeka, na kubheka lipazia pundyangu wa liwangala. Bhela Musa akajomwili lihengu heli lokapi.<verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihundi panani ja Lihema Lihuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 9:15-23">Hesabu 9:15-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />Bhela lihundi lela lakayekalili Lihema Lihuhu, na ulumbalilu waka Bambo Chapanga ukatwelili mu Lihema. <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" />Musa akalepalili kujingila mkati ja Lihema Lihuhu kwa ndandi lihundi heli lakatemi panani ja Lihema heli, na ulumbalilu waka Bambo Chapanga ukatwelili mu Lihema. <verse eid="EXO 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" />Mu mwanja wokapi wa Bhaizilaeli, chikahi lihundi palakatumbwili kujinuliwa kuhuma panani ja Lihema, nabhombi bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakajendalili na mwanja wabhu. <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />Ngati lihundi heli ngachelajinuliwi, nabhombi Bhaizilaeli ngachebhakatumbwi mwanja, bhakalendalili mbaka chikahi lihundi heli palajinuliwe. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" />Kwa ndandi lihundi laka Bambo Chapanga lela lakabhili panani ja Lihema chikahi cha muhi, na kukabhili na moto mkati ja lihundi chikahi cha ikilu, palongi ja bhandu bha Izilaeli mu mwanja wabhu wokapi.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>